+{"id": "P0028", "q": "If = + 2, then the value of x³ 5 is equal to: x³ − 6 x² + 12 x − 12", "o": ["0", "2", "1", "- 1"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "c", "e": "SSC CHSL", "y": "2020", "t": "बीजगणित", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "= + 2 x³ 5 ⇒ x − 2 = 3⁵ Cubing both sides, we get = 5 = 5 ( x − 2 )³ ⇒ x³ − 6 x² + 12 x − 8 = 1 ⇒ x³ − 6 x² + 12 x − 12"},
+{"id": "P0029", "q": "If ‘a’ is a natural number, then (7a² + 7a) is always divisible by:", "o": ["7 and 14 both", "7 only", "14 only", "21 only"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "a", "e": "SSC CHSL", "y": "2020", "t": "बीजगणित", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "7a² + 7a = 7a(a + 1) a and a + 1 are two consecutive number and out of two consecutive number one is odd and one is even and even is always divisible by 2 So, the complete number is divisible by 14 and 7 both."},
