+{"id": "P0050", "q": "If x = 2 - p , then , is x³ + 6 xp + p³ equal to :", "o": ["12", "6", "8", "4"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "c", "e": "SSC CGL", "y": "2019", "t": "बीजगणित", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "x = 2 - p x + p = 2 ⇒ Cubing both sides = ( x + p )³² 3 ⇒ x³ + p³ + 3 xp ( x + p ) = 8 ⇒ x³ + p³ + 3 xp ( 2 ) = 8 ⇒ x³ + 6 xp + p³ = 8"},
+{"id": "P0051", "q": "If + 6x - 2xy + 9 = 0, then 2 x² + y² the value of is : 4 x³ − y³ + x² y²", "o": ["0", "9", "- 3", "- 9"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "a", "e": "SSC CGL", "y": "2019", "t": "बीजगणित", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "+ 6x - 2xy + 9 = 0² x² + y² - 2xy = 0 ⇒ x² + 6 x + 9 + x² + y² + = 0 ⇒ ( x + 3 )² ( x − y )² Sum of the squares of two numbers is equal to zero only if the numbers themselves are zero. (x + 3) = 0 and (x - y) = 0 x = y = - 3 ⇒ ⇒ Now, …...(x = y)⁴ x³ − y³ + x² y² ⇒ 3 x³ + x⁴ = 0 ⇒ x³ ( 3 + x ) ⇒ (− 3 )³ ( 3 − 3 ) Sol."},
