+{"id": "P0053", "q": "If x + y = 1 and xy(xy - 2) = 12, then the value of is: x⁴ + y⁴", "o": ["19", "25", "20", "23"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "b", "e": "SSC CGL", "y": "2019", "t": "बीजगणित", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "x + y = 1 Squaring both sides = 1 = 1 - 2xy x² + y² + 2 xy ⇒ x² + y² Again squaring both sides = 1 + - 4xy x⁴ + y⁴ + 2 x² y² 4 x² y² = 1 + - 4xy x⁴ + y⁴ 2 x² y² = 1 + 2 ( - 2xy) x⁴ + y⁴ x² y² Put ( - 2xy = 12) = 1 + 2(12) = 25 x² y²"},
+{"id": "P0054", "q": "If 24(x - y + z)¹6 x² + 9 y² + 4 z² = , then the value of (xy + 2z) is : − 61", "o": ["1", "2", "3", "5"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "d", "e": "SSC CGL", "y": "2019", "t": "बीजगणित", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "16 x² + 9 y² + 4 z² = 24 ( x − y + z ) − 61 ⇒ ( 16 x² − 24 x + 9 ) + ( 9 y² + 24 y + 16 ) + ( 4 z² − 24 z + 36 ) = 0 ⇒ ( 4 x − 3 )² + ( 3 y + 4 )² + ( 2 z − 6 )² = 0 = , = , ⇒ x³ 4 y − 4³ z = 3 Therefore, = xy + 2 z³ 4 × (− 4³ ) + 2 × 3 = (− 1 ) + 6 = 5"},
