+{"id": "P0056", "q": "If x + y + z = 19, and xz = , then the x² + y² + z² = 133 y² difference between z and x is :", "o": ["5", "3", "6", "4"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "a", "e": "SSC CGL", "y": "2019", "t": "बीजगणित", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "We know that (x + y + z)² = x² + y² + z² + 2(xy + yz + zx) Put the given values = 133 + 2(xy + yz + )¹9² y² 114 = y(x + y + z) y = 6 ⇒ x + z = 19 - 6 = 13 xz = = 36 ⇒ 6² Only 9 and 4 are such pairs whose sum is 13 and multiplication is 36 Required difference = 9 - 4 = 5"},
