+{"id": "P0058", "q": "If roots of - 4x + a = 0 are equal, x² then a = ?", "o": ["- 4", "4", "8", "-8 Practice Questions SSC CHSL 2023 Tier - 2"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "b", "e": "SSC CPO", "y": "2019", "t": "बीजगणित", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "We know the roots of an equation = − b ± b² − 4 ac 2 a here , a = 1, b = - 4 and c = a According to question − (− 4 ) + (− 4 )² − 4 a ( 1 )² ( 1 ) ........ ( 1 ) = − (− 4 ) − (− 4 )² − 4 a ( 1 )² ( 1 ) ........ ( 2 ) Equating eq .(1) and (2), we get 2 = 0¹6 − 4 a¹6 = 4a so, a= 4 ans."},
+{"id": "P0059", "q": "If (a − 2b) = 8 and 2ab = 9, then find the value of (a + 2b).", "o": ["12", "6", "10", "8"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "c", "e": "SSC CHSL", "y": "2023", "t": "बीजगणित", "d": "कठिन", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": ", ( a − 2 b ) = 8² ab = 9 ∵ ( a − 2 b )² = ( a + 2 b )² − 8 ab ( a + 2 b )² = 8² + 8× 9² ( a + 2 b )² = 64 + 36 = 100 ( a + 2 b ) = 10"},
+{"id": "P0060", "q": "If + = 1 and = 2, then x y y x x + y the value of is: x³ + y³", "o": ["0", "1", "3", "2"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "a", "e": "SSC CPO", "y": "2023", "t": "बीजगणित", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "Given , x + y = 2 and + = 1 x y y x ⇒ x² + y² = xy Formula : x³ + y³ = ( x + y )( x² + y² − xy ) ⇒ x³ + y³ = 2 × 0 = 0"},
