+{"id": "P0233", "q": "If x > 0, and = 2207, what x⁴ + 1 x⁴ is the value of ? x⁷ + 1 x⁷", "o": ["710649", "710647", "710654", "710661"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "b", "e": "SSC CGL", "y": "2022", "t": "बीजगणित", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "……eq .(1) x⁴ + 1 x⁴ = 2207 Adding 2 in eq .(1), we get , = 47 ……eq .(2) x² + 1 x² Adding 2 in eq .(2), we get , = 7 ⇒ x + 1 x Then , = = 322 x³ + 1 x³ 7³ − 3 × 7 Now , using Identities :- ⇒ x⁷ + 1 x⁷ ( )( ) ( ) = x³ + 1 x³ x⁴ + 1 x⁴ − x + 1 x = 322 × 2207 - 7 = 710647"},
