+{"id": "P0236", "q": "If (4 + + 5) = 14, what is the a⁵ a value of (16 ² + ) ? a²5 a²", "o": ["25", "36", "41", "40"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "c", "e": "SSC CGL", "y": "2022", "t": "बीजगणित", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "Identities :- when ax + = k y a , then = ( ax )² + y² a² k² − 2 xy 298 Now, 4a + + 5 = 14⁴a + = 9 …e.q .(1)⁵ a ⇒ 5 a On squaring e.q .(1) , we get = = 41¹6 a² + 25 a² 9² − 2 × 4 × 5"},
+{"id": "P0237", "q": "If x - = 13 then, what will be 1 x the value of x⁴ + ? 1 x⁴", "o": ["28561", "29243", "27887", "29239"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "d", "e": "SSC CGL", "y": "2022", "t": "बीजगणित", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "Identity : when , x − 1 x = k then, , x² + 1 x² = k² + 2 ⇒ x − 1 x = 13 then , = 171 x² + 1 x² = 13² + 2 And = x⁴ + 1 x⁴ 171 ( )² − 2 = 29241 - 2 = 29239"},
+{"id": "P0238", "q": "The factors of x⁴ + x² + 25 are:", "o": ["(x² + 3x - 5)(x² - 3x + 5)", "(x² + 3x + 5)(x² - 3x + 5)", "(x² - 3x + 5)(x² - 3x + 5)", "(x² + 3x + 5)(x² + 3x + 5)"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "b", "e": "SSC CGL", "y": "2022", "t": "बीजगणित", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "= x⁴ + x² + 25 ( ) x⁴ + x² + 5² ( ) [{( )² } ] x² + 5 − 2 × 5 × x² + x² = [( )² ] x² + 5 − 10 x² + x² = [( )² ] = [( )² ] x² + 5 − 9 x² x² + 5 − 3 x ( )² = x² + 3 x + 5 ( ) x² − 3 x + 5 ( )"},
+{"id": "P0239", "q": "If x = 3 + 2 , x > 0, then the value 2 of - is: x¹ x", "o": ["1", "2", "2² 2"], "ol": ["a", "c", "d"], "a": "c", "e": "SSC CGL", "y": "2022", "t": "बीजगणित", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "x = 3 + 2² x = = 2 ( )² + ( 1 )² + 2² 2 + 1 ( )² = ……eq .(1) x² + 1 ( ) Taking reciprocal of eq .(1) , we get = = 1 x¹ 2 + 1 ( ) × 2 − 1 ( )² − 1 ( )² − 1 ( )¹ = ……eq .(2)² − 1 ( ) Now, From eq .(1) and eq .(2), we get, = - = 2 x − 1 x² + 1 ( )² − 1 ( )"},
+{"id": "P0240", "q": "If x + - 2, then what is the 1 x = value of + + + ? (x < 0) x¹7 x − 17 x¹2 x − 12", "o": ["- 2", "- 1", "1", "0"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "d", "e": "SSC CGL", "y": "2022", "t": "बीजगणित", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "when, x + 1 x = − 2 then, x = − 1 Now , = - 1 -1 + 1 + 1 = 0 x¹7 + x − 17 + x¹2 + x − 12"},
+{"id": "P0241", "q": "What is the possible value of (a + b + c) – 3 , if a² + b² + c² = 9 and ab + bc + ca = 8 ?", "o": ["5", "3", "9", "2"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "d", "e": "SSC CGL", "y": "2022", "t": "बीजगणित", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "x + y + z ( )² = x² + y² + z² + 2 ( xy + yz + zx ) a + b + c ( )² = 9 + 2 × 8 a + b + c = 5 Now, (a + b + c) - 3 = 5 - 3 = 2"},
+{"id": "P0242", "q": "If a – b = 2 and a³ – b³ = 80, then what will be the value of ab?", "o": ["12", "− 24", "24", "− 12"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "a", "e": "SSC CGL", "y": "2022", "t": "बीजगणित", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "Formula :- a − b ( )³ = a³ − b³ − 3 ab ( a − b ) and ……(given) a − b = 2 a³ − b³ = 80 Now , ab = 12² ( )³ = 80 − 3 ab ( 2 ) ⇒"},
