+{"id": "P0244", "q": "Which of the following statement is correct ? I. The value of 100² - 99² + 98² - 97² + 96² - 95² + 94² - 93² +...... + 22² - 21² is 4840. II. The value of ( )( ) k² + 1 k² k − 1 k ( ) ( ) ( ) k⁴ + 1 k⁴ k + 1 k k⁴ − 1 k⁴ is . k¹6 − 1 k¹6", "o": ["Neither I nor II", "Only II", "Only I", "Both I and II"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "c", "e": "SSC CGL", "y": "2022", "t": "बीजगणित", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "Statement 1. 100² − 99² + 98² − 97² ........ + 22² − 21² (100 + 99)(100 - 99) + (98 + 97)(98 - ⇒ 97) ……… + (22 + 21)(22 - 21)¹00 + 99 + 98 + 97…….22 + 21 ⇒ Sum = n² × ( a + l ) = = 40 × 121 = 4840⁸0² ( 100 + 21 ) Statement 2."},
+{"id": "P0245", "q": "If x² + y² + z² = xy + yz + zx and x = 1, then find the value of . 10 x⁴ + 5 y⁴ + 7 z⁴ 13 x² y² + 6 y² z² + 3 z² x²", "o": ["2", "0", "- 1", "1"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "d", "e": "SSC CGL", "y": "2022", "t": "बीजगणित", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "x = 1 …..(given) …..(given) x² + y² + z² = xy + yz + zx Put , y = 1 and z = 1 . which satisfies the given condition. = = 1¹0 x⁴ + 5 y⁴ + 7 z⁴ 13 x² y² + 6 y² z² + 3 z² x² 10 + 5 + 7¹3 + 6 + 3"},
+{"id": "P0246", "q": "If x + = 3, then evaluate 1² x⁸x³ + . 1 x³", "o": ["212", "216", "180", "196"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "c", "e": "SSC CGL", "y": "2022", "t": "बीजगणित", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "…..e.q .(1) x + 1² x = 3² x + 1 x = 6 Now, ( )³ = + 6 ( )² x + 1 x⁸ x³ + 1 x³ 2 x + 1 x - 6 × 6 = 6³ 8 x³ + 1 x³ Hence, = 216 - 36 = 180⁸ x³ + 1 x³"},
+{"id": "P0247", "q": "If x² - 2xy = 84 and x - y = -10, then the value of y is:", "o": ["2", "1", "4", "3"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "c", "e": "SSC CGL", "y": "2022", "t": "बीजगणित", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "x - y = - 10 x² − 2 xy = 84 Adding both sides y² x² − 2 xy + y² = 84 + y² x − y ( )² = 84 + y² = 100 - 84 y = 4 y² ⇒"},
+{"id": "P0248", "q": "If = 1, then the value of x + 1 x is: x¹2 + x⁹ + x⁶ + x³ + 1", "o": ["1", "- 1", "0", "- 2"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "a", "e": "SSC CGL", "y": "2022", "t": "बीजगणित", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "When , , x + 1 x = 1 then x³ = − 1 + 1 = 0 ……e.q .(1) x³ Now, x¹2 + x⁹ + x⁶ + x³ + 1¹ ⇒ x⁹ ( x³ + 1 ) + x³ ( x³ + 1 ) + 1 ⇒"},
+{"id": "P0249", "q": "If + = 1 and a + b = 2, then a b b a the value of a³ + b ³ is:", "o": ["0", "3", "1", "2"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "a", "e": "SSC CGL", "y": "2022", "t": "बीजगणित", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "a + b = 2 ……eq .(1) a b + b a = 1 = 1 = ab a² + b² ab ⇒ a² + b² - ab = 0 ……eq .(2) a² + b² a³ + b³ = (a + b) ( a² + b² -ab ) From eq (1) and (2) a³ + b³ = 0"},
+{"id": "P0250", "q": "If 4x² + y² = 40 and xy = 6, find the positive value of 2x + y.", "o": ["8", "6", "5", "4"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "a", "e": "SSC CGL", "y": "2022", "t": "बीजगणित", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "4 + = 40 x² y² Adding (4xy) both sides , we get + + 4xy = 40 + 4xy xy = 6 given) ( 2 x )² y² = 64²x + y = 8² x + y ( )² ⇒ Short trick :- 4 + = 40 and xy = 6 ….(given) x² y² Put x= 3 and y = 2 which satisfy the both given equations ."},
+{"id": "P0251", "q": "If 2a + 3b = 10 and ab = 3, then find the value of 4a² + 9b² .", "o": ["60", "62", "64", "66²72"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "c", "e": "SSC CGL", "y": "2022", "t": "बीजगणित", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "ab = 3 …(given)²a + 3b = 10 On squaring , = 100⁴ a² + 9 b² + 12 ab = 100 - 12 × 3 = 64⁴ a² + 9 b²"},
+{"id": "P0252", "q": "If (4x - 7y) = 11 and xy = 8, what is the value of 16x² + 49y² , given that x and y are positive numbers ?", "o": ["596", "484", "569", "448"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "c", "e": "SSC CGL", "y": "2022", "t": "बीजगणित", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "xy = 8 ….(given) (4x - 7y) = 11 On squaring , we get = 121¹6 x² + 49 y² − 56 xy = 121 + 56 × 8 = 569¹6 x² + 49 y²"},
