+{"id": "P0256", "q": "If x² + y² + 2y + 4x + 5 = 0 , then = . ( x + y ) ( x − y )", "o": ["- 3", "-1", "3¹ 3"], "ol": ["a", "c", "d"], "a": "d", "e": "SSC CGL", "y": "2022", "t": "बीजगणित", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "Concept :- If , ( x )² + ( y )² = 0 only possible when x = 0 and y = 0 . x² + y² + 2 y + 4 x + 5 = 0 ⇒ ( x² + 4 x + 4 ) + ( y² + 2 y + 1 ) = 0 ⇒ ( x + 2 )² + ( y + 1 )² = 0 So, x + 2 = 0 ⇒ x =− 2 And, y + 1 = 0 ⇒ y =− 1 Now, x + y x − y = − 3 − 1 = 3"},
