+{"id": "P0263", "q": "Find the remainder when we divide 3x⁴ - 2x² + 4x - 1 by 2x - 1 .", "o": ["2", "3", "11¹6¹5¹6"], "ol": ["a", "b", "d"], "a": "c", "e": "SSC CGL", "y": "2022", "t": "बीजगणित", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "2x - 1 = 0 , ⇒ x = 1² Put x = in the given equation. 1² 3x⁴ - 2x² + 4x - 1 = ( )⁴ ( )² ( )³¹ 2 − 2¹ 2 + 4¹ 2 − 1 = = 3¹6 − 1² + 2 − 1¹1¹6 So, the remainder = 11¹6"},
+{"id": "P0264", "q": "What is the value of (a + b)² – (a – b)² ?", "o": ["2(a² + b² )", "4(a² + b² )", "8ab", "4ab"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "d", "e": "SSC CGL", "y": "2022", "t": "बीजगणित", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "(a + b)² – (a – b)² = (a² + b² + 2ab) - (a² + b² - 2ab) = a² + b² + 2ab - a² - b² + 2ab = 4ab"},
+{"id": "P0265", "q": "The factors of x² + 4y² + 4y - 4xy - 2x - 8 are:", "o": ["(x - 2y - 4) (x - 2y + 2)", "(x² - 2y - 4) (x² - 2y + 2)", "(x + 2y - 4) (x + 2y + 2)", "(x² - 2y - 4) (x² + 2y + 2)"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "a", "e": "SSC CGL", "y": "2022", "t": "बीजगणित", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "x² + 4y² + 4y - 4xy - 2x - 8 = (x² - 4xy + 4y² ) + 4y - 2x - 8 = ( x − 2 y )² − 2 ( x − 2 y ) − 8 ( x − 2 y )² − 4 ( x − 2 y ) + 2 ( x − 2 y ) − 8 = ( x − 2 y ) ( x − 2 y ) − 4 { } + 2 ( x − 2 y ) − 4 { } = x − 2 y − 4 { } x − 2 y + 2 { }"},
