+{"id": "P0270", "q": "If 4(z + 7) (2z – 1) = Az 2 + Bz + C, then the value of A + B + C is:", "o": ["28", "32", "74", "81"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "b", "e": "SSC CGL", "y": "2022", "t": "बीजगणित", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "4(z + 7) (2z – 1) = (4z + 28)(2z - 1) = 8 - 4z + 56z - 28 = 8 + 52z - 28 z² z² Now, 8 + 52z - 28 = A + Bz + C z² z² On comparing both side, we have : A = 8, B = 52 , C = - 28 So, A + B + C = 8 + 52 - 28 = 32"},
