+{"id": "P0294", "q": "If + = - 1 and a - b = 2, then a b b a the value of a³ - b³ is:", "o": ["0", "1", "- 1¹ 2"], "ol": ["a", "c", "d"], "a": "a", "e": "SSC CGL", "y": "2022", "t": "बीजगणित", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "+ = - 1 a b b a = - 1 + = - ab a² + b² ab ⇒ a² b² Now, (a - b = + - 2ab )² a² b² 4 = + - 2ab = - ab - 2ab = - 3ab a² b² ab = - 4³ - = (a - b) a³ b³ ( a − b )² + 3 ab [ ] = 2[ ( )] = 2 × 0 = 0⁴ + 3 × − 4³"},
+{"id": "P0295", "q": "If x = 2 - 2 + 2 then find the 1³ 2³ value of x³ - 6x² + 18x.", "o": ["40", "33", "45", "22"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "d", "e": "SSC CGL", "y": "2022", "t": "बीजगणित", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "x = 2 - 2 + 2¹ 3² 3 x - 2 = 2 - 2² 3¹ 3 Taking cube on both side, = (2 - 2 ( x − 2 )³² 3¹ 3 )³ - 8 - 6 + 12x x³ x² = 4 - 2 - 3 × 2 × 2 ( 2 - 2 )²³ 1³ 2³ 1³ - 10 - 6 + 12x = - 6(x - 2) x³ x² - 10 - 6 +12x + 6x - 12 = 0 x³ x² - 6 + 18x = 22 x³ x²"},
