+{"id": "P0297", "q": "If x⁴ + x - 4 = 47, x > 0, then what is the value of x + - 2 ? 1 x", "o": ["1", "0", "5", "3"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "a", "e": "SSC CPO", "y": "2022", "t": "बीजगणित", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "+ = 47 x⁴ 1 x⁴ Adding both side by 2, = 49 + = = 7 ( x² + 1 x² )² ⇒ x² 1 x² 49 Again, Adding both side by 2 (x + = 9 x + = 3¹ x )² ⇒ 1 x So, x + - 2 = 3 - 2 = 1¹ x"},
+{"id": "P0298", "q": "The value of where ( x − y )³ + ( y − z )³ + ( z − x )³ ( x² − y² )³ + ( y² − z² )³ + ( z² − x² )³ x y z, is : ≠ ≠", "o": ["0", "1 ( x + y + z )", "1¹ ( x + y )( y + z )( z + x )"], "ol": ["a", "b", "d"], "a": "c", "e": "SSC CPO", "y": "2022", "t": "बीजगणित", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "Formula used : + + = 3abc (when a + b + c = 0) a³ b³ c³ - = (a - b)(a + b) a² b² Now, (x - y) + (y - z) + (z - x) = 0 (x - y + (y - z + (z - x = 3(x - y)(y - ⇒ )³ )³ )³ z)(z - x) ( - ) + ( - ) + ( - ) = 0 x² y² y² z² z² x² ( - + ( - + ( - = 3( - ⇒ x² y² )³ y² z² )³ z² x² )³ x² )( - )( - ) y² y² z² z² x² So, ( x − y )³ + ( y − z )³ + ( z − x )³ ( "},
+{"id": "P0299", "q": "If a + b + c = 10 ; a² + b² + c² = 38, what is the value of (a - b)² + (b - c)² + (c - a)² ?", "o": ["15", "12", "14", "13"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "c", "e": "SSC CPO", "y": "2022", "t": "बीजगणित", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "As we know that, (a + b + c = + + + 2(ab + bc + ca) )² a² b² c² = 38 + 2(ab + bc + ca)¹⁰ 2⁶2 = 2(ab + bc + ca)³1 = ab + bc + ca ⇒ Now, (a - b + (b - c + (c - a )² )² )² = 2[ ] a² + b² + c² − ( ab + bc + ca ) = 2 = 2 × 7 = 14³8 − 31 [ ]"},
+{"id": "P0300", "q": "The value of is: {( m ² + n ² )( m − n ) − ( m − n )³ } ( m ² n − mn ² )", "o": ["m + n", "m − n", "2", "m n"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "c", "e": "SSC CPO", "y": "2022", "t": "बीजगणित", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "Formula used : (m - n = - - 3mn(m-n) )³ m³ n³ = ⇒ ( m² + n² )( m − n ) − ( m − n )³ { } ( m² n − m n² ) m³ − m² n + n² m − n³ −( m³ − n³ − 3 m² n + 3 m n² ){ } ( m² n − m n² ) = = 2² ( m² n − m n² ) m² n − m n²"},
+{"id": "P0301", "q": "If x + y + z = 8, and x² + y² + z² = 20 then the value of x³ + y³ + z³ - 3xyz is _______.", "o": ["16", "10", "15", "– 16"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "d", "e": "SSC CPO", "y": "2022", "t": "बीजगणित", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "Formula used : (x + y + z = + + + 2(xy + yz + zx) )² x² y² z² + + - 3xyz = (x + y + z) x³ y³ z³ x² + y² + z² − ( xy + yz + zx )[ ] x + y + z = 8 , x² + y² + z² = 20 Now, xy + yz + zx = = 22⁸ 2 − 20² So, + + - 3xyz = 8(20 - 22) x³ y³ z³ = 8 × (-2) = - 16"},
+{"id": "P0302", "q": "If {(1 ÷ x) (x³ - 2x²) + (4³ ÷ 2⁵ ) × × } ÷ 25 = 1, then the possible values of x x is/are:", "o": ["– 5", "5", "0", "Both 5 and - 5"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "d", "e": "SSC CPO", "y": "2022", "t": "बीजगणित", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "{(1 ÷ ) × ( 3 - 2² ) + (4³ ÷ 2⁵ ) × } ÷ 25 = 1 x x x x { × ( 2 - 2 ) + (64 ÷ 32) × } = 25¹ x x x x x { ( 2 - 2 ) + 2 } = 25 = 25 x = 5 x x x ⇒ x² ⇒ ± So, the possible value of x is 5 and -5 ."},
+{"id": "P0303", "q": "The simplified form of (7x + 4y)² + (7x − 4y)² is:", "o": ["98x² + 32y²", "98x² + 32y² – 5xy", "32x² + 98y²", "98x² − 32y²"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "a", "e": "SSC CPO", "y": "2022", "t": "बीजगणित", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "(7x + 4y + (7x - 4y = 2[ ] )² )² ( 7 x )² + ( 4 y )² = 2[ ] = 98 + 32⁴9 x² + 16 y² x² y²"},
+{"id": "P0304", "q": "If x + y = 10, 2xy = 48 and x > y, 274 then find 2x - y.", "o": ["6", "8", "4", "3"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "b", "e": "SSC CPO", "y": "2022", "t": "बीजगणित", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "The best approach to solve his question is the value putting method. By putting x = 6 and y = 4, we get : x + y = 6 + 4 = 10 and 2xy = 2 × 6 × 4 = 48(satisfied) So, 2x – y = 2 × 6 – 4 = 8"},
+{"id": "P0305", "q": "If a² + b² + 1 = 2a, then the value of a⁴ + b⁷ is:", "o": ["1", "0", "2", "4"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "a", "e": "SSC CPO", "y": "2022", "t": "बीजगणित", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "+ + 1 = 2a a² b² + = 0 → a − 1 ( )² b² a = 1 and b = 0 → So, + = + 0 = 1 a⁴ b⁷ 1⁴"},
+{"id": "P0306", "q": "If a,b,c are all non - zero and a + b + c = 0 , find the value of + + ? a² bc b² ca c² ab", "o": ["3", "4", "1", "1²"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "a", "e": "SSC CPO", "y": "2022", "t": "बीजगणित", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "Formula used : + + = 3abc (when a + b + c = 0) x³ y³ z³ Now, + + = a² bc b² ac c² ab a³ + b³ + c³ abc = = 3³ abc abc"},
+{"id": "P0307", "q": "Simplify: - - ( x + y )³ ( x − y )³⁶y( - ) x² y²", "o": ["8y³", "x³", "8x³", "y³"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "a", "e": "SSC CPO", "y": "2022", "t": "बीजगणित", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "Formula used : (x - y = - - 3xy (x - y) )³ x³ y³ (x + y - (x - y - 6y( - ) )³ )³ x² y² = (x + y - (x - y - 3(x + y)(x - y)2y )³ )³ = (x + y - (x - y - 3(x + y)(x - y) )³ )³ x + y − ( x − y )[ ] = = = 8 ( x + y ) − ( x − y )[ ]³² y [ ]³ y³"},
+{"id": "P0308", "q": "If + 6x + 1 = 0 then the value of x² + = ? ( x + 6 )³¹ ( x + 6 )³", "o": ["245", "216", "186", "198"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "d", "e": "SSC CPO", "y": "2022", "t": "बीजगणित", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "+ 6x + 1 = 0 x² Dividing both side by x, x + 6 + = 0 x + = -6¹ x ⇒ 1 x + = ( -3 × ( - 6) x³ 1 x³ − 6 )³ = - 216 + 18 = -198 Also, x + 6 = - 1 x Now, (x + 6 + = - ( + ) )³¹ ( x + 6 )³¹ x³ x³ = 198"},
+{"id": "P0309", "q": "If a, b and c are positive integers such that + = 82 and + = 65, a² b² b² c² then the value of 2a + 7b - 3c is:", "o": ["2", "5", "49", "1"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "d", "e": "SSC CPO", "y": "2022", "t": "बीजगणित", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "Putting b = 1, we have ; = 82 - 1 = 81 a = 9 a² ⇒ and = 65 - 1 = 64 c = 8 c² ⇒ Now , 2a + 7b - 3c = 2 × 9 + 7 × 1 - 3 × 8 = 18 + 7 - 24 = 1"},
+{"id": "P0310", "q": "If x(x - 5) = - 1, then the value of x³ (x³ - 110) = ?", "o": ["0", "- 1", "1", "2"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "b", "e": "SSC CPO", "y": "2022", "t": "बीजगणित", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "x ( x − 5 ) =− 1 x − 5 = − 1 x ⇒ x + 1 x = 5 ............ ( 1 ) Now , x³ + 1 x³ = 5³ − 3 × 5 = 110 ⇒ x⁶ + 1 = 110 x³ ⇒ x⁶ − 110 x³ = − 1 ⇒ x³ ( x³ − 110 ) = − 1"},
+{"id": "P0311", "q": "If a + = p² , then find a² + . 1 a¹ a²", "o": ["p² - 2", "p² + 2", "p⁴ - 2", "p⁴ + 2"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "c", "e": "SSC CPO", "y": "2022", "t": "बीजगणित", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "Given , a + = p² , 1 a ( a + b )² = a² + b² + 2 ab Then, a² + 1 a² = p⁴ − 2"},
+{"id": "P0312", "q": "If a = - 9.6, b = 4.44 and c = 5.16, then the value of a³ + b³ + c³ - 3abc is:", "o": ["0", "- 1", "2", "1"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "a", "e": "SSC CPO", "y": "2022", "t": "बीजगणित", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "a = - 9.6, b = 4.44 and c = 5.16, If a + b + c = 0 - 9.6 + 4.44 + 5.16 = 0 ⇒ then a³ + b³ + c³ - 3abc = 0"},
+{"id": "P0313", "q": "Find the value of the following equation. (Given a < 10) = 1 ( 187 ÷ 17 × a − 3 × 3 ) ( 8² − 9 × 7 + a² )", "o": ["2", "1", "4", "3"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "b", "e": "SSC CPO", "y": "2022", "t": "बीजगणित", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "( 187 ÷ 17 × a − 3 × 3 ) ( 8² − 9 × 7 + a² ) = 1 ⇒ ( 11 a − 9 ) = ( 64 − 63 + a² ) ⇒ a² − 11 a + 10 = 0 ⇒ a² − 10 a − a + 10 = 0 ⇒ ( a − 10 )( a − 1 ) = 0 ⇒ a = 1 , 10 Since, a is less than 10 , a = 1"},
+{"id": "P0314", "q": "If = , then the 1 + x⁵29²4²3 value of x is:", "o": ["15", "27", "47", "30"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "c", "e": "SSC CPO", "y": "2022", "t": "बीजगणित", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "1 + x⁵29 = 24²3¹ + x⁵29 = 576⁵29 x⁵29 = 47⁵29 ⇒ x = 47"},
+{"id": "P0315", "q": "If the equation k(21x² + 24) + rx + (14x² - 9) = 0 and k(7x² + 8) + px+ (2x² – 3) = 0 have both roots common, then the value of is: p r", "o": ["1", "3", "2", "5"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "a", "e": "SSC CPO", "y": "2022", "t": "बीजगणित", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "k(21x² + 24) + rx + (14x² - 9) = 0 ------(i) k(7x² + 8) + px + (2x² – 3) = 0 ----(ii) Multiply equation (ii) by 3 and subtract from equation (i), k(21x² + 24) + rx + (14x² - 9) - 3 × [k(7x² +8) + px + (2x² – 3)] = 0⁸x² - (3p - r)x + 0 = 0 --------(iii) So let roots of equation (iii) are α and β = = 0 α + β 3 p − r⁸ ⇒ α β Equations have both roots common."},
+{"id": "P0316", "q": "What is the value of 7 + 5⁷ − 5 ÷ ? 14 + 10¹4 − 10 + 10⁵", "o": ["2 + 2² 2 + 2", "2² + 1² + 1"], "ol": ["b", "d"], "a": "c", "e": "SSC CGL", "y": "2022", "t": "बीजगणित", "d": "कठिन", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "7 + 5⁷ − 5 ÷ 14 + 10¹4 − 10 + 10⁵ 302 = × + 7 + 5⁷ − 5¹4 − 10¹4 + 10² × 5⁵ = × + = 1 + 7 + 5⁷ − 5² ( 7 − 5 )² ( 7 + 5 )²²"},
+{"id": "P0317", "q": "If ( )² , then what is the x + 1 x = 3 value of ? x⁶ + x − 6", "o": ["6", "2", "- 6", "- 2"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "d", "e": "SSC CGL", "y": "2022", "t": "बीजगणित", "d": "कठिन", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "( )² x + 1 x = 3 + + 2 = 3 + = 1 ⇒ x² 1 x² ⇒ x² 1 x² On cubing above equation, we get ( )³ = + + 3( )( ) = 1 x² + 1 x² 1³ ⇒ x⁶ 1 x⁶ x² 1 x² + + 3 = 1 + = - 2 x⁶ 1 x⁶ ⇒ x⁶ 1 x⁶ So, + = - 2 x⁶ x − 6"},
+{"id": "P0318", "q": "If xy = - 6 and + = 19 ( x and x³ y³ y are integers), then what is the value of + ? 1 x − 1¹ y − 1", "o": ["- 1", "- 2", "1", "2 SSC Selection Post (Phase - X)"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "c", "e": "SSC CGL", "y": "2022", "t": "बीजगणित", "d": "कठिन", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "Let = 3 and = - 2 x y Putting above values of and , we get x y = (3)(-2) = - 6 ….(satisfied) x y + = + (- x³ y³ 3³ 2 )³ = 27 - 8 = 19 …..(satisfied) Hence, = 3 and = -2 x y So, + = x + y = 3 + (-2) = 3 - 2 = 1¹ x − 1¹ y − 1"},
