+{"id": "P0386", "q": "If is exactly px 3 + x² + 3 x + q divisible by (x + 2) and (x - 2), then the values of p and q are:", "o": ["and q = 4 p = − 3⁴", "and q = 4 p = 3⁴", "and q = - 4 p = 3⁴", "and q = - 4 p = − 3⁴"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "d", "e": "SSC CHSL", "y": "2022", "t": "बीजगणित", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "px 3 + x² + 3x + q is divisible by (x + 2) and (x - 2) When x = -2 p(-2)³ + (-2)² + 3(-2) + q = 0 -8p + 4 - 6 + q = 0⁸p - q = -2 …(i) ⇒ ⇒ When x = 2 p(2)³ + (2)² + 3(2) + q = 0 ⇒ 8p + 4 + 6 + q = 0⁸p + q = -10…..(ii) ⇒ On solving eq (i) and (ii) p = , q = - 4 − 3⁴"},
+{"id": "P0387", "q": "If and x + y = 8, x³ + y³ = 416 then find x⁴ + y⁴", "o": ["3002", "3204", "3004", "3104"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "d", "e": "SSC CHSL", "y": "2022", "t": "बीजगणित", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "Formula used :- + = (x + y) x³ y³ ( x + y )² − 3 xy [ ]⁴16 = 8 ⇒ 8² − 3 xy [ ]⁵2 = 64 - 3xy 12 = 3xy xy = = 4 ⇒ ⇒ 12³ + = - 2xy x² y² ( x + y )² = - 2 × 4 = 64 - 8 = 56⁸ 2 + = - 2 × = 3136 - 32 = 3104 x⁴ y⁴ 5⁶ 2⁴ 2"},
+{"id": "P0388", "q": "If 2z = x + y, then the value of + x x − z y y − z", "o": ["0", "1", "2", "5"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "c", "e": "SSC CHSL", "y": "2022", "t": "बीजगणित", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "x + y = 2z x + y - z = 2z - z ⇒ x - z = z - y Again , x + y - 2y = 2z - 2y x - y = 2 (z - y) ⇒ + = - x x − z y y − z x z − y y z − y = = = 2 x − y z − y² ( z − y ) z − y Short trick : Putting z = 0 , we get x = - y + = + x x − z y y − z x x − 0 y y − 0 = + = 1 + 1 = 2 x x y y"},
+{"id": "P0389", "q": "If (ab + bc + ca) = 0, then what is the value of ( ) ? 1 a² − bc + 1 b² − ac + 1 c² − ab", "o": ["2", "0", "1", "a + b + c"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "b", "e": "SSC CHSL", "y": "2022", "t": "बीजगणित", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "ab + bc + ca = 0 a(b + c) = - bc ⇒ Similarly , b(c + a) = - ca , c(a + b) = - ab = + + 1 a² − bc 1 b² − ca 1 c² − ab = + + 1 a² + a ( b + c )¹ b² + b ( c + a )¹ c² + c ( a + b ) = + + 1 a ( a + b + c )¹ b ( a + b + c ) = = 0¹ c ( a + b + c ) bc + ca + ab abc ( a + b + c )"},
+{"id": "P0390", "q": "If (x + 2) and ( x - 3) are the factors of x² + k¹ x + k² , then :", "o": ["k¹ = 1 and k² = -6", "k¹ = -1 and k² = -6", "k¹ = -1 and k² = 6", "k¹ = 1 and k² = 6"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "b", "e": "SSC CHSL", "y": "2022", "t": "बीजगणित", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "( + 2) and ( - 3) are the x x factors of + + . x² k¹ x k² ( + 2) × ( - 3) = x x x x² − − 6 Now, equate x and + + x² − − 6 x² k¹ x k² We get, = - 1 and = - 6 k¹ k²"},
+{"id": "P0391", "q": "If k + = 2, find the value of 8k¹ k k × × k", "o": ["8", "1", "4", "2"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "a", "e": "SSC CHSL", "y": "2022", "t": "बीजगणित", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "Putting k = 1, we get LHS = RHS i.e.2 = 2 So, 8 × k × k × k = 8 × = 8¹ 3"},
