+{"id": "P0393", "q": "If x + y + 3 = 0, then find the value of x³ + y³ − 9 xy + 9 .", "o": ["– 18", "– 36", "18", "36"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "a", "e": "SSC CGL", "y": "2022", "t": "बीजगणित", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "x + y + 3 = 0 x + y = – 3 ….(1) On cubing equation (1), we get = –27 x³ + y³ + 3 xy ( x + y ) = –27 x³ + y³ + 3 xy (− 3 ) = –27 …..(2) x³ + y³ − 9 xy Add 9 in equation (2) both side,we get = – = –18 ⇒ x³ + y³ − 9 xy + 9²7 + 9"},
+{"id": "P0394", "q": "If = 16⁴ x + 2 y ( )³ + 4 x − 2 y ( )³ , then what is the value of A x³ + B xy 2 ( ) ? 1² A² + B² ( )", "o": ["8", "3", "5", "7"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "c", "e": "SSC CGL", "y": "2022", "t": "बीजगणित", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "4 x + 2 y ( )³ + 4 x − 2 y ( )³ = 16( ) A x³ + B xy 2 [64 + 8 + 24 ( )] + ⇒ x³ y³ x y⁴ x + 2 y [64 - 8 - 24 ( )] x³ y³ x y⁴ x − 2 y = 16 A x³ + B xy 2 ( ) [64 + 8 + 96 ] + ⇒ x³ y³ x² y + 48 x y² [64 - 8 - 96 ] x³ y³ x² y + 48 x y² = 16( ) A x³ + B xy 2¹28 + = 16( ) ⇒ x³ 96 x y² A x³ + B xy 2¹6(8 + ) = 16 ⇒ x³ 6 x y² A x³ + B xy 2 ( )⁸ + = ⇒ x³ 6 x y"},
+{"id": "P0395", "q": "If x = 4 + , what is the value of 15 ( + ) ? x² 1 x²", "o": ["48", "54", "72", "62"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "d", "e": "SSC CGL", "y": "2022", "t": "बीजगणित", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "= 4 + x¹5 So, = 1 x¹ 4 + 15 × 4 − 15⁴ − 15 = 4 − 15 ( )² = + + 2 ⇒ x + 1 x x² 1 x² + = ( )² – 2 ⇒ x² 1 x² x + 1 x = – 2 ( 4 + 15 + 4 − 15 )² = – 2 = 64 – 2 = 62 ( 8 )²"},
+{"id": "P0396", "q": "If x + y + z = 11, xy + yz + zx = – 6, and + + = 1604, then the value of x³ y³ z³ xyz is:", "o": ["25", "4", "1", "5"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "a", "e": "SSC CGL", "y": "2022", "t": "बीजगणित", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "x³ + y³ + z³ − 3 xyz = ( x + y + z ) [ x² + y² + z² − xy − yz − zx ] ⇒ x³ + y³ + z³ − 3 xyz = ( x + y + z ) [ ( x + y + z )² − 3 ( xy + yz + zx )] = ⇒ 1604 − 3 xyz ( 11 )[( 11 )² − 3 (− 6 )] = ⇒ 1604 − 3 xyz ( 11 )[ 121 + 18 ] = ⇒ 1604 − 3 xyz ( 11 )[ 139 ] = – 1529 = 75 ⇒ 3 xyz 1604 ⇒ 3 xyz = 25 ⇒ xyz"},
+{"id": "P0397", "q": "If a² + b² + 49c² + 18 = 2 (b - 28c - a) then the value of (a + b - 7c) is", "o": ["4", "3", "2", "1"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "a", "e": "SSC CGL", "y": "2022", "t": "बीजगणित", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "a² + b² + 49 c² + 18 = 2 ( b − 28 c − a ) a² + b² + 49 c² + 18 = 2 b − 56 c − 2 a a² + 2 a + 1 + b² − 2 b⁰ + 1 + 49 c² + 56 c + 16 = = 0 ( a + 1 )² + ( b − 1 )² + ( 7 c + 4 )² So, = -1, = 1 and = - a b c⁴ 7 = -1 + 1 -7( - ) = 0 + 4 = 4 a + b − 7 c⁴ 7"},
+{"id": "P0398", "q": "If 8k ⁶ + 15k ³ - 2 = 0, then the positive value of (k + ) is: 1 k", "o": ["2", "2", "8", "8¹ 2¹ 8¹ 2¹ 8"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "a", "e": "SSC CGL", "y": "2022", "t": "बीजगणित", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "Let = x, k³ Now, 8k⁶ + 15k³ – 2 = 0 becomes + 15x – 2 = 0. 8 x² + 16x – x – 2 = 0⁸ x² (8x –1)(x + 2) = 0 x = or –2 ⇒ 1⁸ For positive value we take x = 1⁸ x = k³ = , k = 1⁸ 1² (k + ) = + 2 = 2¹ k¹ 2¹ 2"},
+{"id": "P0399", "q": "If x - y + z = 0 then find the value of - - y ² 2 xz x ² 2 yz z ² 2 xy", "o": ["- 6", "3² 1² − 3²"], "ol": ["c", "d"], "a": "a", "e": "SSC CGL", "y": "2022", "t": "बीजगणित", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "If then x − y + z = 0 = – ⇒ x³ − y³ + z³ 3 xyz – = – ⇒ (− x³ + y³ − z³ )³ xyz = …….(1) ⇒ y³ − x³ − z³ 3 xyz Now, - - = y ² 2 xz x ² 2 yz z ² 2 xy y³ − x³ − z³ 2 xyz = = 3 xyz 2 xyz 3²"},
+{"id": "P0400", "q": "If 2² x³ − 3³ y³ = ( 2 x − 3 y ) , then the value of ( Ax 2 − Bxy + Cy 2 ) is: ( A² + B² + C² )", "o": ["16", "11", "19", "18"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "c", "e": "SSC CGL", "y": "2022", "t": "बीजगणित", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "2² x³ − 3³ y³ = ( 2 x − 3 y ) ……(1) ( Ax 2 − Bxy + Cy 2 )²² x³ − 3³ y³ = ( 2 x − 3 y ) ……(2) ( 2 x² + 6 xy + 3 y² ) On comparing we get, A = 2, B = – and C = 3⁶ = + + A² + B² + C² 2² (− 6 )²³ 2 = 4 + 6 + 9 = 19"},
+{"id": "P0401", "q": "If and x + y + z = 18 , xyz = 81 , then find the value xy + yz + zx = 90 of 4 x³ + y³ + z³ + xyz", "o": ["6", "12", "9", "10"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "a", "e": "SSC CGL", "y": "2022", "t": "बीजगणित", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "- 3xyz = (x + y + z) x³ + y³ + z³ [ ( )] ( x + y + z )² − 3 xy + yz + zx - 3xyz ⇒ x³ + y³ + z³ = 18 × [ (90)] = 972 ( 18 )² − 3 - 3xyz + 4xyz = 972 + 4xyz ⇒ x³ + y³ + z³ + xyz = 972 + 4 × 81 ⇒ x³ + y³ + z³ + xyz = 972 + 324 = 1296 ⇒ x³ + y³ + z³ 306 = = 6⁴ x³ + y³ + z³ + xyz 4¹296"},
+{"id": "P0402", "q": "If a + b - c = 5 and ab - bc - ac = 10, then find the value of + + a² b² c²", "o": ["40", "5", "45", "15"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "b", "e": "SSC CGL", "y": "2022", "t": "बीजगणित", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "= ( a + b − c )² a² + b² + c² + 2 ( ab − bc − ac ) = ( 5 )² a² + b² + c² + 2 ( 10 ) = 25 – 20 = 5 a² + b² + c²"},
+{"id": "P0403", "q": "If = , then what is the x − 1 x³ value of + ? x⁴ 1 x⁴", "o": ["531", "721", "623", "527"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "d", "e": "SSC CGL", "y": "2022", "t": "बीजगणित", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "= x − 1 x³ On squaring, we get - 2 = 3 = 5 x + 1 x ⇒ x + 1 x On squaring, we get + 2 = 25 = 23 x² + 1 x² ⇒ x² + 1 x² On squaring, we get + 2 = 529 = 527 x⁴ + 1 x⁴ ⇒ x⁴ + 1 x⁴"},
+{"id": "P0404", "q": "If + = 218 and a + b = 2, then a³ b³ the value of √(1 - ab) is:", "o": ["5", "3", "4", "6"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "d", "e": "SSC CGL", "y": "2022", "t": "बीजगणित", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "Given, + = 218 and a + b = 2, a³ b³ (a + b)³ = + + 3ab(a + b) a³ b³ 2³ = 218 + 3ab × 2 – 210 = 6ab ab = –35 ⇒ ⇒ = = = 6 ( 1 − ab )¹ − (− 35 )³6 Short trick : by hit and trial method a = 7 and b = – 5 = = = 6 ( 1 − ab )¹ − (− 35 )³6"},
+{"id": "P0405", "q": "If - 5x - 1 = 0, what is the value x² of ? x⁶ − x⁴ + x² − 1 x³", "o": ["145", "140", "130", "135"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "d", "e": "SSC CGL", "y": "2022", "t": "बीजगणित", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "– 5x – 1 = 0 x² – 1 = 5x …… dividing both sides by x ⇒ x² x – = 5 ⇒ 1 x then = x³ – x + – ⇒ x⁶ − x⁴ + x² − 1 x³ 1 x¹ x ³ ( x³ – ) – (x – ) ⇒ 1 x ³ 1 x Used identity ( x³ – ) = (x – ) ³ + 3 × (x – )¹ x ³ 1 x¹ x Now, (5³ + 3 × 5) – 5 = 140 – 5 = 135 ⇒"},
+{"id": "P0406", "q": "If ( x + y )³ − ( x − y )³ − ) = then find the value 3 y ( 2 x² − 3 y² k y³ of k", "o": ["10.5", "8", "11", "10"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "c", "e": "SSC CGL", "y": "2022", "t": "बीजगणित", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "( )³ ( )³ ) = x + y − x − y − 3 y ( 2 x² − 3 y² k y³ x³ + y³ + 3x²y + 3xy² – (x³ – 3x²y + ⇒ 3xy² –y³) – 6x²y + 9y³ = k y³ x³ + y³ + 3x²y + 3xy² – x³ + 3x²y – 3xy² ⇒ + y³ – 6x²y + 9y³ = k y³ 11y³ = k = 11 ⇒ k y³ ⇒"},
+{"id": "P0407", "q": "If - = , x⁰ then what x¹ x⁵ ≠ is the value of . ( x⁴ + 1 x² ) ( x² + 1 )", "o": ["42", "44", "48", "46"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "d", "e": "SSC CGL", "y": "2022", "t": "बीजगणित", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "- = ……… squaring x¹ x⁵ both sides = ( )² + 2 = 7 x + 1 x⁵ dividing numerator and ( x⁴ + 1 x² ) ( x² + 1 ) denominator by x = = 46 ⇒ ( x³ + 1 x³ ) ( x + 1 x ) ( 7 ) ³ − 3 × 7⁷"},
+{"id": "P0408", "q": "If a + b + c = 6 , a² + b² + c². = 32, and a³ + b³ + c³ = 189, then the value of 4abc is :", "o": ["12", "16", "9", "8"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "a", "e": "SSC CGL", "y": "2022", "t": "बीजगणित", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "Given that a + b + c = 6 , a² + b² + c². = 32 and a³ + b³ + c³ = 189 now, (a + b + c)² = a² + b² + c² + 2(ab + bc + ca)⁶² = 32 + 2(ab + bc + ca ) ⇒ ab + bc + ca = 2 ⇒ now, a³ + b³ + c³ - 3abc = (a + b + c) [a² + b² + c² - (ab + bc + ca)]¹89 - 3abc = 6 × [32 - 2] ⇒ 3abc = 9 abc = 3⁴abc = 12 ⇒ ⇒ ⇒"},
+{"id": "P0409", "q": "If x⁴ - 79x² + 1= 0, then a value of x + x -1 can be :", "o": ["9", "5", "7", "8"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "a", "e": "SSC CGL", "y": "2022", "t": "बीजगणित", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "x⁴ - 79x² + 1 = 0 ⇒ x⁴ + 1 = 79x² …..divide eq by x² ⇒ x² + = 79 …… add 2 both sides 1 x ² ⇒ x² + + 2 = 81 … take square root 1 x ² both sides ⇒ x + = 9¹ x"},
+{"id": "P0410", "q": "If 4x - 3y = 12 and xy = 5, the find the value of 16 x² + 9 y² 8", "o": ["33", "18", "3", "44"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "a", "e": "SSC CGL", "y": "2022", "t": "बीजगणित", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "4x - 3y = 12 Squaring both sides 16x² + 9y² - 24xy = 144¹6x² + 9y² = 144 + 24×(5)¹6x² + 9y² = 144 + 120 = 264 = 33¹6 x ² + 9 y ² 8 = 264⁸"},
+{"id": "P0411", "q": "If = 16, where ( a + 1 a + 3 )² a is a non - zero real number, then find the value of + . a² 1 a²", "o": ["3", "47", "49", "7 SSC CGL 2020 Tier - 2"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "b", "e": "SSC CGL", "y": "2022", "t": "बीजगणित", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "= 16 ( a + 1 a + 3 )² a + 3 = 4 a = 1 or - 7 + 1 a ± ⇒ + 1 a For a = 1, + = - 2 = - 1 + 1 a a² 1 a² 1² (No option matches) For a = - 7, + + 1 a a² 1 a² = - 2 = 49 - 2 = 47 (− 7 )²"},
+{"id": "P0412", "q": "If a + b + c = 1,ab + bc + ca = − 22 and abc = − 40, then what is the value of ? a³ + b³ + c³", "o": ["- 51", "27", "67", "- 53"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "d", "e": "SSC CGL", "y": "2022", "t": "बीजगणित", "d": "कठिन", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "- 3abc a³ + b³ + c³ = (a + b + c)[ (ab+bc+ca)] ( a + b + c )² − 3 - 3 × (-40) ⇒ a³ + b³ + c³ = 1 × [ 3 × ( 22)]¹² − − + 120 = 67 a³ + b³ + c³ = 67 - 120 = - 53 a³ + b³ + c³"},
+{"id": "P0413", "q": "If 2 + 5x + 1 = 0, then one of the x² values of x - is: 1² x", "o": ["13", "2", "17", "2"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "b", "e": "SSC CGL", "y": "2022", "t": "बीजगणित", "d": "कठिन", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "2 + 5x + 1 = 0 x² On dividing by 2x, x + + = 0 x + = - 5² 1² x ⇒ 1² x⁵ 2 x - = 1² x x + 1² x ( )² − 4 × 1² x - = 1² x − 5² ( )² − 2 x - = = 1² x²5⁴ − 2¹7²"},
+{"id": "P0414", "q": "= a + with a, 22² 4² − 3 + 5⁵ b , b > 0,then what is the value of (ab) : (a + b)?", "o": ["7 : 8", "4 : 7", "7 : 4", "8 : 7"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "a", "e": "SSC CGL", "y": "2022", "t": "बीजगणित", "d": "कठिन", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": ", 22² 4² − 3 + 5 dividing numerator and denominator by , we get 2 = 22⁴ − 3 + 5² 22⁴ − 6 + 2⁵ 4 = 22⁴ − 5 + 1² ( )²²2⁴ − 5 + 1² ( ) = = 44⁷ − 5⁴4 ( 7 + 5 ) ( 7 − 5 )( 7 + 5 ) = 44 ( 7 + 5 )⁴4 = 7 + 7 + = a + 5 ⇒ 5⁵ b , On comparing, a =7 and b = 1 (ab) : (a + b) = 7 × 1 : 7 + 1 = 7 : 8"},
