+{"id": "P0420", "q": "If = 17 and x⁴ + y⁴ + x² y² 1¹6 = 5 , then one of the x² − xy + y² 1⁴ values of (x - y) is:", "o": ["5", "2", "3", "4"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "a", "e": "SSC CGL", "y": "2022", "t": "बीजगणित", "d": "कठिन", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "x⁴ + y⁴ + x² y² = ( )( ) x² − xy + y² x² + xy + y² = × ( ) ⇒ 273¹6²1⁴ x² + xy + y² ( ) = = … (i) x² + xy + y² 273¹6 × 4²1¹3⁴ = … (ii) (Given that ) x² − xy + y² 21⁴ From equation (i) and (ii) = = x² + y² 13⁴ + 21⁴ 2¹7⁴ xy = = - 1¹3⁴ − 21⁴ 2 = - 2xy = + 2 ( x − y )² x² + y² 17⁴ = ( x - y ) = ( x − y )²²5⁴ ⇒ 5²"},
+{"id": "P0421", "q": "If x and y are two numbers having opposite signs, and x² : y² = 16 : 81, then the value of ? 3 x + 4 y² x − 3 y", "o": ["-", "-", "12²5²7⁴0²4³5⁴8³5"], "ol": ["b", "c", "d"], "a": "c", "e": "SSC MTS", "y": "2021", "t": "बीजगणित", "d": "आसान", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "According to the question, let x be negative and y be positive. So, x : y = - 4 : 9 ______ (1)³ x + 4 y² x − 3 y In equation (1) dividing above by y in both numerator and denominator, we get = = 3 ( x y ) + 4² ( x y ) − 3³ ( − 4⁹ ) + 4² ( − 4⁹ ) − 3 = = = – − 12 + 36 − 8 − 27²4 − 35²4³5"},
+{"id": "P0422", "q": "If (11 a³ − 15 b³ ) : ( 10 a³ + 4 b³ ) then (9a + 5b) : (5a - 3b) is equal = 5 : 7 , to:", "o": ["10 : 7", "13 : 5", "15 : 4", "14 : 9 SSC CGL 2020 Tier - 1"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "c", "e": "SSC MTS", "y": "2021", "t": "बीजगणित", "d": "आसान", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "Given , = 11 a³ − 15 b³ 10 a³ + 4 b³ 5⁷ ⇒ 77 - 105 = 50 + 20 a³ b³ a³ b³ ⇒ 27 = 125 = a³ b³ ⇒ a b⁵ 3 (9a + 5b) : (5a - 3b) ⇒ ( 9 × 5 + 5 × 3) : ( 5 × 5 - 3 × 3) ⇒ (45 + 15) : ( 25 - 9) ⇒ 60 : 16 = 15 : 4."},
+{"id": "P0423", "q": "If x + y = 4 and + = , 1 x¹ y¹6¹5 then what is the value of (x³ + y³ ) ?", "o": ["18", "19", "21", "16"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "b", "e": "SSC CGL", "y": "2021", "t": "बीजगणित", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "+ = = = 1 x¹ y¹6¹5 x + y xy 16¹5 = , xy = 4 xy 16¹5¹5⁴ x³ + y³ = (x + y) (x² + y² - xy) = (x + y) [(x + y)² - 3xy] x³ + y³ = 4 (4² - 3 × ) = 19 ⇒ 15⁴"},
+{"id": "P0424", "q": "If x - y = 11 and - = 1 x¹ y¹1²4 , then what is the value of x³ - y³ + x²y²?", "o": ["1331", "1115", "1105", "1307"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "b", "e": "SSC CGL", "y": "2021", "t": "बीजगणित", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "Given that, - = 1 x¹ y¹1²4 = So, xy = - 24 y − x xy 11²4 x³ - y³ + x²y² = (x - y) {(x - y)² + 3xy} + x²y² x³ - y³ + x²y² = 11 (121 - 72) + (-24)² x³ - y³ + x²y² = 11 × 49 + 576 = 539 + 576 = 1115 Short-trick: Put x = 8 and y = -3 x - y = 11⁸ - (-3) = 11 xy = - 24 ⇒ ⇒ x³ - y³ + x²y² = 512 - (-27) + 64 × 9 = 512 + 27 + 576 = 1115"},
