+{"id": "P0426", "q": "If = 727, x > 1, then x⁴ + 1 x⁴ what is the value of ( ) ? x − 1 x", "o": ["6", "- 6", "- 5", "5"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "d", "e": "SSC CGL", "y": "2021", "t": "बीजगणित", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "x⁴ + = 727 adding 2 and 1 x⁴ taking root on both side x² + = 27 subtracting 2 from both ⇒ 1 x² side and taking root x - = 5 and - 5, But x > 1 So, x = 5 ⇒ 1 x"},
