+{"id": "P0430", "q": "If 4x⁴ - 37x² + 9 = 0, x > , 3² then what is the value of 8x³ - ? 27 x³", "o": ["215", "- 215", "35", "- 35"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "a", "e": "SSC CGL", "y": "2021", "t": "बीजगणित", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "4x⁴ - 37x² + 9 = 0 dividing both side by x² Then 4x² + = 37 subtracting 12 and 9 x² taking root from both side 2x - = 5 taking cube on both side 3 x⁸x³ - = 5³ + 3×5×2×3 = 125 + 90 = 215²7 x³"},
+{"id": "P0431", "q": "If x + y = 2 and , 1 x + 1 y = 18⁵ then the value of (x³ + y³ )", "o": ["4", "4", "3", "3² 3³ 5¹ 3¹ 5 Q. 467. If x² + 4y² = 53 and x - 2y = 5, then what is the value of x³ - 8y³ ? SSC CGL 16/08/2021 (Evening)", "- 85", "335", "155", "85"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d", "a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "a", "e": "SSC CGL", "y": "2021", "t": "बीजगणित", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "1 x + 1 y = 18⁵ = xy = x + y xy 18⁵ ⇒ 5⁹ x³ + y³ = (x + y) {(x + y)² - 3xy} x³ + y³ = 2(4 - ) = = 4⁵ 3¹4³ 2³"},
