+{"id": "P0434", "q": "If x² + 9y² + 4z² = 12(x - 2y + 2z) - 88, then the value of (x - 3y + z) is:", "o": ["10", "13", "11", "5"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "b", "e": "SSC CGL", "y": "2021", "t": "बीजगणित", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "x² + 9y² + 4z² = 12(x - 2y + 2z) - 88 x² - 12x + 9y² + 24y + 4z² - 24z + 88 = 0 x² - 12x + 36 + 9y² + 24y + 16 + 4z² - 24z + 36 = 0 (x - 6)² + (3y + 4)² + (2z - 6)² = 0 x = 6, y = - , z = 3⁴ 3 (x - 3y + z) = (6 + 4 + 3) = 13"},
