+{"id": "P0440", "q": "If ( 56⁷ x³ − 2² y ³ ) ÷ ( 2⁷ x − then find the 2 y ) = Ax ² + By ² − Cxy , value of A + B − 14 C .", "o": ["19", "10", "58", "38"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "c", "e": "SSC CGL", "y": "2021", "t": "बीजगणित", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "( 56⁷ x³ − 2² y ³ ) ÷ ( 2⁷ x − 2 y ) = Ax ² + By ² − Cxy , [ - ] ( 2⁷ x )³ ( 2 y )³ ÷ ( 2⁷ x − 2 y ) = Ax ² + By ² − Cxy 28 + 2 + 2 y = x² y² 14 x Ax ² + By ² − Cxy Comparing the above equation we get, A = 28, B = 2, C = -2¹4 = 28 + 2 + 28 = 58 A + B − 14 C"},
