+{"id": "P0446", "q": "If 2x + 3y + 1 = 0, then what is the value of (8x³ + 8 + 27y³ - 18xy) ?", "o": ["7", "- 9", "- 7", "9"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "a", "e": "SSC CGL", "y": "2021", "t": "बीजगणित", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "2 + 3y + 1 = 0 x² + 3y = - 1 x On cubing both sides, (2x + 3y)³ = (-1)³ 8 ³ + 27y³ + 3 × 2 × 3y (-1) = - 1 x x⁸ ³ + 27y³ - 18 y = -1 x x Adding 8 both sides, 8 ³ + 27y³ - 18 y + 8 = 7 x x"},
