+{"id": "P0448", "q": "If y = 2x + 1, then what is the value of (8x³ - y³ + 6xy)?", "o": ["- 15", "1", "- 1", "15"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "c", "e": "SSC CGL", "y": "2021", "t": "बीजगणित", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "y = 2 + 1, x y - 2 = 1 x Cubing both sides, y³ - 8³ - 3 × y × 2 (y - 2 ) = 1 x x x y³ - 8³ - 6 y = 1 x x⁸ 3 - y³ + 6 y = -1 x x"},
+{"id": "P0449", "q": "Given that x⁸ - 34x⁴ +1 = 0, x > 0. What is the value of (x³ - x - 3 ) ?", "o": ["12", "14", "18", "16 SSC CHSL 2020 Tier - 1"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "b", "e": "SSC CGL", "y": "2021", "t": "बीजगणित", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "x⁸ - 34x⁴ + 1 = 0 dividing both side by x⁴ x⁴ + = 34 adding 2 and taking root 1 x⁴ on both side x² + = 6 subtracting 2 and taking root 1 x² on both side x - = 2 taking cube on both side 1 x x³ - = 2³ + 2 × 3 = 8 + 6 = 14¹ x³"},
