+{"id": "P0454", "q": "If x³ + y³ = 468 and x + y = 12, then the value of x⁴ + y⁴ will be:", "o": ["3620", "2036", "3025", "3026"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "d", "e": "SSC CHSL", "y": "2021", "t": "बीजगणित", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "(x + y)³ = x³ + y³ + 3xy (x + y) (12)³ = 468 + 3xy × 12¹728 - 468 = 36 xy = xy, xy = 35¹260³6 (x + y)² = x² + y² +2xy x² + y² = 144 - 70 = 74 (x² + y² )² = x⁴ + y⁴ + 2 x² y² x⁴ + y⁴ = (74)² - 2(35)² = 5476 - 2450 = 3026"},
+{"id": "P0455", "q": "If a² + b² + c² + 170 = 2(8a + 5b - 9c), then the value of will 4 a + 8 b − c be.", "o": ["15", "12", "9", "8"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "c", "e": "SSC CHSL", "y": "2021", "t": "बीजगणित", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "a² + b² + c² + 170 = 2 (8a + 5b - 9c) a² + b² + c² +64+25+81-16a-10b + 18c = 0 (a - 8)² + (b - 5)² + (c + 9)² = 0 a = 8, b = 5 and c = - 9⁴a + 8b - c = 32 + 40 + 9 = 81 = 9 ⇒ 4 a + 8 b − c"},
+{"id": "P0456", "q": "If x + y + z = 5, , 1 x + 1 y + 1 z , xyz = 12 and x³ + y³ + z³ = 151, = 0 then the value of (x² + y² + z² ) is:", "o": ["24", "23", "22", "21"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "b", "e": "SSC CHSL", "y": "2021", "t": "बीजगणित", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "= 0¹ x + 1 y + 1 z (xy + yz + zx) = 0 ⇒ x³ + y³ + z³ - 3xyz = (x + y+z) [(x² + y² + z² ) - (xy + yz + zx) ]¹51 - 36 = 5 [(x² + y² + z² ) - 0] ⇒ × x² + y² + z² = 23"},
+{"id": "P0457", "q": "If x + y = 5 and 1 x + 1 y = 20⁹ , then the value of (x³ + y³ ) will be:", "o": ["205", "4", "635", "8"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "d", "e": "SSC CHSL", "y": "2021", "t": "बीजगणित", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "1 x + 1 y = 20⁹ xy = xy = ⇒ 9²0 × ( x + y ) ⇒ 9⁴ x³ + y³ = ( x + y )³ − 3 xy ( x + y ) = 125 - 3 × 9⁴ × 5 = 125 - = 135⁴ 365⁴"},
+{"id": "P0458", "q": "If (7x + 3)³ + (x - 2)³ + 27(2x - 5)³ = 9(7x + 3) (x - 2) (2x - 5) then the value of 5x + 3 is:", "o": ["8", "6", "10", "2"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "a", "e": "SSC CHSL", "y": "2021", "t": "बीजगणित", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "(7x + 3)³ + (x - 2)³ + 27(2x - 5)³ - 9 (7x + 3) (x - 2) (2x - 5) = 0⁷x + 3 + x - 2 + 6x - 15 = 0 ⇒ 14x = 14 x = 1 ⇒ So, (5x + 3) = 5 + 3 = 8"},
+{"id": "P0459", "q": "If ) = 7, then what is the ( x + 2 x value of ) ? ( 2 x² + 8 x²", "o": ["44", "94", "50", "90"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "d", "e": "SSC CHSL", "y": "2021", "t": "बीजगणित", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": ") = 7 ( x + 2 x Squaring both sides + 2 = 49 x² + 4 x² × x × 2 x + 4 = 49 = 45 x² + 4 x² ⇒ x² + 4 x² Multiply by 2 both sides ) = 90 ( 2 x² + 8 x²"},
+{"id": "P0460", "q": "If ( , then what is the x y + 1 ) = 4 value of ( ) ? x² + y² y²", "o": ["12", "22", "14", "10"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "d", "e": "SSC CHSL", "y": "2021", "t": "बीजगणित", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "( + 1) = 4 = 3 x y ⇒ x y Squaring both side , then we get = 9 x² y² Add 1 both side , then we get + 1 = 9 + 1 = 10 ⇒ x² y² ⇒ x² + y² y² Short-trick: Put, x = 3 and y = 1 = = 10 x² + y² y² 9 + 1¹"},
+{"id": "P0461", "q": "If a² + 4 b² + 25 c² + 18 = , then what is the value 2 ( a − 2 b + 20 c ) of (a + 2b + 5c) ?", "o": ["3", "4", "6", "5"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "b", "e": "SSC CHSL", "y": "2021", "t": "बीजगणित", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "a² + 4 b² + 25 c² + 18 = 2 ( a − 2 b + 20 c ) ⇒ ( a² − 2 a + 1 ) +( 4 b² + 4 b + 1 ) + ( 25 c² − 40 c + 16 ) = 0 ( a − 1 )² + ( 2 b + 1 )² + ( 5 c − 4 )² = 0 a = 1 , b = - 0.5 , c = 0.8 Now, a + 2b + 5c = 1 - 1 + 4 = 4"},
+{"id": "P0462", "q": "Simplify the following expression. 0 . 8 × 0 . 8 × 0 . 8 + 0 . 6 × 0 . 6 × 0 . 6⁰ . 08 × 0 . 08 + 0 . 06 × 0 . 06 − 0 . 08 × 0 . 06", "o": ["14", "1.4", "140", "160"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "c", "e": "SSC CHSL", "y": "2021", "t": "बीजगणित", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "0 . 8 × 0 . 8 × 0 . 8 + 0 . 6 × 0 . 6 × 0 . 6⁰ . 08 × 0 . 08 + 0 . 06 × 0 . 06 − 0 . 08 × 0 . 06 = 10000 × ( 8³ + 6³ )¹000 × ( 8² + 6² − 8 × 6 ) = = 140¹0 × ( 8 + 6 ) × ( 8² + 6² − 8 × 6 ) ( 8² + 6² − 8 × 6 )"},
+{"id": "P0463", "q": "If and x - y = 5 then x² + y² = 45 what is the value of ? x³ − y³", "o": ["150", "250", "- 25", "275"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "d", "e": "SSC CHSL", "y": "2021", "t": "बीजगणित", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "= - 2xy ( x − y )² x² + y² 25 = 45 - 2xy xy = 10 ⇒ Now, = - 3xy (x - y) ( x − y )³ x³ − y³ 125 = - x³ − y³ 3 × 10 × 5 = 275 ⇒ x³ − y³"},
+{"id": "P0464", "q": "If a + b + c = 4, ab + bc + ca = - 14 and abc = - 18, then the value of will be: 4 a³ + 4 b³ + 4 c³ − 36", "o": ["26", "24", "25", "18"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "a", "e": "SSC CHSL", "y": "2021", "t": "बीजगणित", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "a³ + b³ + c³ − 3 abc = c)² ( a + b + c )[( a + b + − 3 ( ab + bc + ca )] a³ + b³ + c³ + 54 = 4 [ 16 + 42 ] = 178 ⇒ a³ + b³ + c³ = 4 a³ + 4 b³ + 4 c³ − 36 = = 26⁴ ( 178 − 9 )⁴ × 169"},
