+{"id": "P0466", "q": "If a + b = p, ab = q the ( a⁴ + b⁴ ) is equal to:", "o": ["p⁴ − 2 p² q² + q² p⁴ − 4 p² q² + 2 q²", "p⁴ − 4 p² q + q² p⁴ − 4 p² q + 2 q²"], "ol": ["b", "d"], "a": "d", "e": "SSC CHSL", "y": "2021", "t": "बीजगणित", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "a + b = p Squaring both side + + 2ab = + = - 2q a² b² p² ⇒ a² b² p² Squaring both side + + 2 = + 4 - 4 q a⁴ b⁴ a² b² p⁴ q² p² + = a⁴ b⁴ p⁴ − 4 p² q + 2 q² Short trick : Let a = 1, b = 1 p = 2, q = 1 ⇒ ( ) = 2 ⇒ a⁴ + b⁴ Check option (d) = 2 p⁴ − 4 p² q + 2 q²"},
+{"id": "P0467", "q": "If + = then the value of x¹ x⁶ , will be: x⁶ + 1 x⁶", "o": ["2270", "2502", "2702", "2712"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "c", "e": "SSC CHSL", "y": "2021", "t": "बीजगणित", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "+ x¹ x = 6 Squaring both side x + = 4¹ x Squaring both side = 14 ------- (1) x² + 1 x² Taking cube both side = 14³ - 14 × 3 x⁶ + 1 x⁶ x⁶ + = 2702¹ x⁶"},
+{"id": "P0468", "q": "If x² + 1 - 2x = 0, x > 0, then x² (x² - 2) = _____.", "o": ["1", "- 1", "0²"], "ol": ["a", "c", "d"], "a": "c", "e": "SSC CHSL", "y": "2021", "t": "बीजगणित", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "+ 1 - 2x = 0 x² + 1 = 2x (On squaring both side) x² +1 + 2 = 4 ⇒ x⁴ x² x² + 1 = 2 ( - 2) = -1 ⇒ x⁴ x² ⇒ x² x²"},
+{"id": "P0469", "q": "If = x ² + 4 y ² + 3 z ² + 19⁴ , then the value of 2√3 ( x + y + z ) (x - 4y + 3z) = ?", "o": ["3", "3", "2", "3"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "c", "e": "SSC CHSL", "y": "2021", "t": "बीजगणित", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "x² + 4y² + 3z² + = 19⁴ 2√3 ( x + y + z ) - 2 x + 4 - 2 y + 3 - 2 z + ⇒ x ² √3 y ² √3 z ² √3 = 0¹9⁴ + + = 0 ( x − 3 )² ( 2 y − 3² )² ( 3 z − 1 )² (x - ) = 0, (2y - ) = 0, = 0³ 3² ( 3 z − 1 ) x = , y = , z = 3³ 4¹ 3 (x - 4y + 3z) = - 4 + 3 = 3 × 3⁴ × 1³ 3"},
+{"id": "P0470", "q": "If , then the 9 x² − 6 x + 1 = 0 value of will be: 27 x³ + ( 27 x³ ) − 1", "o": ["8", "4", "2", "1"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "c", "e": "SSC CHSL", "y": "2021", "t": "बीजगणित", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "9x² - 3x - 3x + 1 = 0³x (3x - 1) - 1(3x -1) = 0 (3x - 1) (3x - 1) = 0 x = ⇒ 1³ 27x³ + (27x³ ) -1 = 27( )³ + {27( )³ } -1¹ 3¹ 3 = 1 + 1 = 2"},
+{"id": "P0471", "q": "If (4x - 5)³ + (x - 2)³ + 27 (2x - 5)³ = 9(4x - 5)(x - 2)(2x - 5) then the value of ) will be: ( x + 3²", "o": ["3", "2", "1", "2"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "c", "e": "SSC CHSL", "y": "2021", "t": "बीजगणित", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "(4x - 5)³ + (x - 2)³ + 27(2x - 5)³ = 9(4x - 5)(x - 2)(2x - 5) (4x - 5)³ + (x - 2)³ + (6x - 15)³ - 3(4x - 5)(x - 2)(6x - 15) = 0 The given equation is the form of (a³ + b³ + c³ - 3abc = 0) If a³ + b³ + c³ - 3abc = 0, then a = b = c or a + b + c = 0 (4x - 5) + (x - 2) + (6x - 15) = 0¹1x = 22 x = 2 ⇒ = x + 3² 2 + 3² = 7²"},
+{"id": "P0472", "q": "If a + b - c = 0, then what is the value of + - ? ( b − c )²⁴ bc ( c − a )²⁴ ca ( a + b )²⁴ ab", "o": ["1", "2", "− 3", "4"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "b", "e": "SSC CHSL", "y": "2021", "t": "बीजगणित", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "If a + b - c = 0 then b - c = - a, c - a = b, a + b = c + - ⇒ ( b − c )²⁴ bc ( c − a )²⁴ ca ( a + b )²⁴ ab = + - (− a )²⁴ bc ( b )²⁴ ca ( c )²⁴ ab = = = a³ + b³ − c³ 4 abc − 3 abc 4 abc − 3⁴"},
+{"id": "P0473", "q": "Simplify the following expression: (2a - b - 3c)(4a² + b² + 9c² + 2ab + 6ac - 280³bc)", "o": ["− 8 a ³ + b ³ + 27 c ³", "8 a ³ + b ³ + 27 c ³", "8 a ³ − b ³ − 27 c ³ − 18 abc", "8a³ - b³ - 27c³ + 18abc"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "c", "e": "SSC CHSL", "y": "2021", "t": "बीजगणित", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "(2a - b - 3c)(4a² + b² + 9c² + 2ab + 6ac - 3bc) (2a - b - 3c){(2a)² + (b)² + (3c)² + 2ab + ⇒ 6ac - 3bc) We know, a³ - b³ - c³ - 3abc = (a - b - c)(a² + b² + c² + ab + ac - bc) On comparing, we get, (2a)³ - (b)³ - (3c)³ - 3(2a)(b)(3c) = 8a³ - b³ - 27c³ - 18abc"},
+{"id": "P0474", "q": "If ) = 15 then what ( x² + 1⁴9 x² 5⁷ is the value of ( ) ? x + 1⁷ x", "o": ["7", "7", "4", "4 ± ±"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "c", "e": "SSC CHSL", "y": "2021", "t": "बीजगणित", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "( + = 15 x² 1⁴9 x² )⁵⁷ ( )² = + x + 1⁷ x x ² + 1⁴9 x² 2 × x × 1⁷ x ( )² = 16 x + 1⁷ x = 110⁷ + 2⁷ = x + 1⁷ x ± 4"},
+{"id": "P0475", "q": "If (3x + 2y)³ + (3x - 2y)³ = 3kx(3x² + 4y² ), then the value of k will be:", "o": ["18", "9", "3", "6"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "d", "e": "SSC CHSL", "y": "2021", "t": "बीजगणित", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "(3x + 2y)³ + (3x - 2y)³ = (3x)³ + (2y)³ + 3.(3x)².(2y) + 3(3x)(2y)² + (3x)³ - (2y)³ - 3.(3x)².(2y) + 3(3x)(2y)² = (3x + 2y)³ + (3x - 2y)³ = 54x³ + 72xy² = (3x + 2y)³ + (3x - 2y)³ = 18 (3 ² + 4y²) x x³k (3x² + 4y²) = 18 (3 ² + 4y²) x x x On comparing, 3k = 18 k = 6 ⇒"},
+{"id": "P0476", "q": "If = 425 x + y = 27 and x² + y² then the value of will be: ( x − y )²", "o": ["225", "169", "121", "144"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "c", "e": "SSC CHSL", "y": "2021", "t": "बीजगणित", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "x + y = 27 Squaring both side + 2xy = 729 ⇒ x² + y² 2xy = 729 - 425 = 304 ⇒ = - 2xy ⇒ ( x − y )² x² + y² = - 304 = 121⁴25"},
+{"id": "P0477", "q": "If = 3, then the value of x + 1¹5 x will be: 9 x³ + 1³75 x³", "o": ["237.6", "376.2", "273.6", "367.2"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "a", "e": "SSC CHSL", "y": "2021", "t": "बीजगणित", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "= 3 x + 1¹5 x Multiplying both sides by '3' = 9³ x + 1⁵ x = 729 - 16.2²7 x³ + 1¹25 x³ = 712.8²7 x³ + 1¹25 x³ Divide both side by 3 = 237.6⁹ x³ + 1³75 x³"},
+{"id": "P0478", "q": "If 2x + 3y + 4z = 11, 8x³ + 27y³ + 64z³ = 105, and xyz = 1, then the value of 4x² + 9y² + 16z² - 6xy - 12yz - 8xz is:", "o": ["3", "4", "5", "6"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "a", "e": "SSC CHSL", "y": "2021", "t": "बीजगणित", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "We know, + + - 3abc a³ b³ c³ = (a + b + c) × ( + + - ab - bc - ca) a² b² c² Here, a = 2x, b = 3y, c = 4z + + - 72xyz ⇒ 8 x³ 27 y³ 64 z³ = ( ) ( 2 x + 3 y + 4 z⁴ x² + 9 y² + 16 z² − )⁶ xy − 12 yz − 8 xz 105 - 72 = 11 ( ⇒ 4 x² + 9 y² + 16 z² − )⁶ xy − 12 yz − 8 xz = 3⁴ x² + 9 y² + 16 z² − 6 xy − 12 yz − 8 xz"},
+{"id": "P0479", "q": "If ( x − 1 . 5 )³ + ( x − 4 )³ + ( x − 3 . 5 )³ = 3 ( x − 1 . 5 )( x − 4 )( x − 3 . 5 ), then what is the value of x ?", "o": ["1", "3", "6", "9"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "b", "e": "SSC CHSL", "y": "2021", "t": "बीजगणित", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "+ + = 3abc a + b + c = 0 a³ b³ c³ ⇒ + + x - 3.5 = 0 x − 1 . 5 x − 4³x = 9 x = 3 ⇒"},
+{"id": "P0480", "q": "If then the x⁴ + x − 4 = 47 , x > 0 , value of is: ( 2 x − 3 )²", "o": ["9", "3", "5", "7"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "c", "e": "SSC CHSL", "y": "2021", "t": "बीजगणित", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "x⁴ + x − 4 = 47 + 2 = 49 = 7 x⁴ + 1 x⁴ ⇒ x² + 1 x² + 2 = 9 x + = 3 ⇒ x² + 1 x² ⇒ 1 x - 3x = -1⁴ - 12x = - 4 ⇒ x² ⇒ x² = 4 - 12x + 9 = - 4 + 9 = 5 ⇒ ( 2 x − 3 )² x²"},
+{"id": "P0481", "q": "If a² + b² + c² + 48 = 8 ( a + b then the value of ? + c ) , 3 a³ − b³ + c³", "o": ["6", "4", "3", "2"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "b", "e": "SSC CHSL", "y": "2021", "t": "बीजगणित", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "a² + b² + c² + 48 = 8 ( a + b + c ) - 8a+ 16 + - 8b + 16 + - 8c + 16 = 0 ⇒ a² b² c² + + = 0 ⇒ ( a − 4 )² ( b − 4 )² ( c − 4 )² a = 4,b = 4, c = 4 = = 4³ a³ − b³ + c³ 3⁴ 3 − 4³ + 4³"},
+{"id": "P0482", "q": "If a - = 5, where a > 0, then the 24 a value of is: a² + 64 a²", "o": ["45", "56", "60", "65"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "d", "e": "SSC CHSL", "y": "2021", "t": "बीजगणित", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "a - = 5²4 a - 5a - 24 = 0 - 8a + 3a - 24 = 0 ⇒ a² ⇒ a² (a - 8 ) ( a + 3) = 0 ⇒ a = 8, - 3 = + = 65 a² + 64 a² 8² 64⁸ 2"},
+{"id": "P0483", "q": "If 3x - 2y + 3 = 0 , then what will be the value of ? 27 x³ + 54 xy + 30 − 8 y³", "o": ["- 27", "57", "- 57", "3"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "d", "e": "SSC CHSL", "y": "2021", "t": "बीजगणित", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "3x - 2y + 3 = 0 , 3x - 2y = - 3 After cubing both sides, 27 x³ − 8 y³ − 18 xy ( 3 x − 2 y ) = − 27²7 x³ − 8 y³ + 54 xy = − 27²7 x³ − 8 y³ + 54 xy + 30 = 3"},
+{"id": "P0484", "q": "If a = and b = , 5 + 2⁵ − 2⁵ − 2⁵ + 2 then the value of is 2 a² + 2 b² − 5 ab equal to:", "o": ["693", "649", "635", "639"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "d", "e": "SSC CHSL", "y": "2021", "t": "बीजगणित", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "On rationalizing, a = × 5 + 2⁵ − 2⁵ + 2⁵ + 2 = ( + 2)² = 9 + 4⁵ 5 Similarly b = 9 - 4 and ab = 1⁵ = 2(9 + 4 )² + 2(9 -4² a² + 2 b² − 5 ab 5 )² - 5⁵ 2(81 + 80 +72 ) + 2(81 + 80 -72 ) -5 ⇒ 5⁵ 2 × 161 + 2 × 161 - 5 = 644 - 5 = 639 ⇒"},
+{"id": "P0485", "q": "If then x² + ( 4 − 3 ) x − 1 = 0 , what is the value of ? x² + 1 x²", "o": ["9 − 8³ 21 − 12³", "21 − 8³ 17 − 8³ SSC CPO 2020 Tier - 1"], "ol": ["b", "d"], "a": "c", "e": "SSC CHSL", "y": "2021", "t": "बीजगणित", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "x² + ( 4 − 3 ) x − 1 = 0 , x − 1 x = − ( 4 − 3 ) On squaring both sides, = x² + 1 x² 21 − 8³"},
+{"id": "P0486", "q": "If × a² + b² + c² + 216 = 12 then is: ( a + b − 2 c ) ab − bc + ca", "o": ["6", "4", "3", "8"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "a", "e": "SSC CPO", "y": "2020", "t": "बीजगणित", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "a² + b² + c² + 216 = 12(a + b - 2c) Taking all to LHS and rearranging all we get a² - 12a + 36 + b² - 12b + 36 + c² + 24c + ⇒ 144 = 0 (a - 6)² + (b - 6)² + (c + 12)² = 0 ⇒ Now we can easily say that a = 6, b = 6, and c = - 12, Now we have to find out ab − bc + ca Putting the values of a,b and c we get = 6³6 + 72 − 72 = 36"},
+{"id": "P0487", "q": "If x² + 8 y² − 12 y − 4 xy + 9 = 0 , then the value of (7x - 8y) is:", "o": ["12", "5", "9", "21"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "c", "e": "SSC CPO", "y": "2020", "t": "बीजगणित", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "x² + 8 y² − 12 y − 4 xy + 9 = 0 , (x - 2y)² + (2y - 3)² = 0 ⇒ x = 2y and y = then, x = 3 Now, 3² 7x - 8y = 21¹2 = 9 ⇒ −"},
+{"id": "P0488", "q": "If x + y + z = 19 , x² + y² + and , what z² = 133 xz = y² , x > z > 0 is the value of (x - z) ?", "o": ["- 2", "0", "- 5", "5 SSC CGL 2019 Tier - 2"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "d", "e": "SSC CPO", "y": "2020", "t": "बीजगणित", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": ", x + y + z = 19¹33 and x² + y² + z² = xz = y² Using(x + y + z)² = x² + y² + z² + 2xy + 2yz + 2xz And putting the values we get 361 = 133 + 2(xy + yz + xz)²28 = 2(xy + yz + xz) (xy + yz + xz) = 114 ⇒ Now putting and taking out y xz = y² common simultaneously We get y( ) = 114 x + y + z Putting = 19 we get y = 6 x + y + z Now x + z = 13 and x² + z² = 97 Solving thes"},
+{"id": "P0489", "q": "Given that 0 x⁸ − 34 x⁴ + 1 = What is the value of ( ) ? x > 0 , x³ + x − 3", "o": ["5", "8", "6", "6"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "a", "e": "SSC CGL", "y": "2020", "t": "बीजगणित", "d": "कठिन", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "dividing both side by x⁸ + 1 = 34 x⁴ x⁴ = 34 adding 2 to both side x⁴ + 1 x⁴ = 36 taking root on both side x⁴ + 1 x⁴ + 2 = 6 again applying above process x² + 1 x² = taking cube on both side x + 1 x² 2 = = x³ + 1 x³ 8⁸ − 3⁸ ⇒ x³ + 1 x³ 5⁸"},
