+{"id": "P0500", "q": "Find the value + 1 ( 9 − 4⁵ )²¹ ( 9 + 4⁵ )²", "o": ["322", "424", "246", "286"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "a", "e": "SSC CHSL", "y": "2020", "t": "बीजगणित", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "+ 1 ( 9 − 4⁵ )²¹ ( 9 + 4⁵ )² = + 1 ( a − b )²¹ ( a + b )² {a = 9, b = 4 } 5 = = ( a + b )² + ( a − b )² ( a − b )² ( a + b )²² ( a² + b² ) ( a² − b² )² = = 322² 9² + 4⁵ ( )² ⎡⎢⎣ ⎤⎥⎦ 9² − 4⁵ ( )² ⎡⎢⎣ ⎤⎥⎦ 2"},
+{"id": "P0501", "q": "If x⁴ + = , then find 1 x⁴ 257¹6 (x³ + ), where x > 0. 8¹3¹ x³", "o": ["5", "4", "6", "8"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "a", "e": "SSC CHSL", "y": "2020", "t": "बीजगणित", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "x⁴ + = 1 x⁴ 257¹6 + + 2 = ⇒ x⁴ 1 x⁴ 257¹6 + 2 + = ⇒ x² 1 x² 17⁴ x + + 2 = + 2 = ⇒ 1 x¹7⁴ 25⁴ x + = ⇒ 1 x⁵ 2 Put x = 2 ( ) = = 5⁸ 13² 3 + 1² 3⁸ 1³ × 65⁸"},
+{"id": "P0502", "q": "If a + b = 8 and a + a² b + b + ab 2 = 128, then the positive value of a³ + b³ is:", "o": ["96", "224", "344", "152"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "d", "e": "SSC CHSL", "y": "2020", "t": "बीजगणित", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "a + a² b + b + ab 2 = 128 ⇒ a + b + ab ( a + b ) = 128 ⇒ ( a + b )( 1 + ab ) = 128⁸(1 + ab) = 128 ab = 15 ⇒ ⇒ = ( a + b )² a² + b² + 2 ab 64 = + 30 ⇒ a² + b² 312 = 34 ⇒ a² + b² a³ + b³ = ( a + b )( a² + b² − ab ) = 8(34¹5) = 152 a³ + b³ − ⇒ a³ + b³ Short-trick: Put a = 5, b = 3 = 5³ + 3³ = 152 a³ + b³"},
+{"id": "P0503", "q": "Find the factors of the expression 3x² - 5x - 8.", "o": ["(x - 1) and (3x - 8)", "(x + 1) and (3x - 8)", "(x + 1) and (3x + 8)", "(x - 1) and (3x + 8)"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "b", "e": "SSC CHSL", "y": "2020", "t": "बीजगणित", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "- 5x - 8³ x² - 8x + 3x - 8 = 0 ⇒ 3 x² x(3x - 8) + 1(3x - 8) = 0 ⇒ (x + 1)(3x - 8) ⇒"},
+{"id": "P0504", "q": "is equal to: ( a + 2 b )² − ( a − 2 b )²", "o": ["10ab", "6ab", "8ab", "4ab"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "c", "e": "SSC CHSL", "y": "2020", "t": "बीजगणित", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "( a + 2 b )² − ( a − 2 b )² = a² + 4 b² + 4 ab − a² − 4 b² + 4 ab = 8ab"},
