+{"id": "P0508", "q": "If x = 2 + then find the value of 3 , . x⁴ − 8 x³ + 16 x²", "o": ["- 1", "1", "0", "2"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "b", "e": "SSC CHSL", "y": "2020", "t": "बीजगणित", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "x = 2 + 3 x - 2 = 3 After squaring both sides = 3 ⇒ x² − 4 x + 4 = - 1 ⇒ x² − 4 x Again after squaring both sides = 1 ⇒ x⁴ − 8 x³ + 16 x²"},
+{"id": "P0509", "q": "If x + y = 4 and then x³ + y³ = 12 , the value of x⁴ + y⁴ = ?", "o": ["146", "9", "146", "3"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "a", "e": "SSC CHSL", "y": "2020", "t": "बीजगणित", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "= (x + y) { x³ + y³ ( x + y )² − 3 xy } 12 = 4( ⇒ 16 − 3 xy )³ = 16 - 3xy ⇒ xy = = ⇒ 13³ ⇒ x² y² 169⁹ = (x + y){ x³ + y³ ( x² + y² − xy } 12 = 4( ) = ⇒ x² + y² − 13³ ⇒ x² + y² 22³ x⁴ + y⁴ = ( x² )² + ( y² )² = ⇒ ( x² )² + ( y² )² ( x² + y² )² − 2 x² y² = ⇒ ( x² )² + ( y² )²⁴84⁹ − 338⁹ = = ⇒ ( x² )² + ( y² )²¹46⁹ ⇒ x⁴ + y⁴ 146⁹"},
+{"id": "P0510", "q": "If x = 3 + , then the value of 2² + is: x² 1 x²", "o": ["30", "36", "32", "34"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "d", "e": "SSC CHSL", "y": "2020", "t": "बीजगणित", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "x = 3 + 2² = 17 + = 17 - x² 12² ⇒ 1 x² 12² = 17 + + 17 - = 34 x² + 1 x² 12² 12² Alternate method: x = 3 + then, = 3 - 2² 1 x² 2 = 6 then, = 6² - 2 = 34 x + 1 x x² + 1 x²"},
+{"id": "P0511", "q": "If + = 0, then the value x⁴ x − 4 of is equal to: x² − 4", "o": ["2", "4", "0", "1"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "c", "e": "SSC CHSL", "y": "2020", "t": "बीजगणित", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "+ = 0 x⁴ x − 4 x = 0 ⇒ x² + 4 − 4 (x - 2)² x = 2 ⇒ = 0 ⇒ So, = = 4 - 4 = 0 x² − 4² 2 − 4"},
+{"id": "P0512", "q": "If = 36xyz, x³ + 27 y³ + 64 z³ then the relationship between x, y and z is:", "o": ["x + y + z = 0", "x - 3y + 4z = 0", "x + 3y = 4z", "x + 3y + 4z = 0"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "d", "e": "SSC CHSL", "y": "2020", "t": "बीजगणित", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "When, = a³ + b³ + c³ 3 abc Then, a = b = c or a + b + c = 0 = x³ + ( 3 y )³ + ( 4 z )³³ ( x )( 3 y )( 4 z ) Therefore, + 3y + 4z = 0 x"},
+{"id": "P0513", "q": "If ) = , then the value x ( 5 − 2 x⁵ x of + is equal to: x² 1 x²", "o": ["2", "4", "25", "2"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "a", "e": "SSC CHSL", "y": "2020", "t": "बीजगणित", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": ") = x ( 5 − 2 x⁵ x⁵( ) = 2 ( ) = x − 1 x ⇒ x − 1 x² 5 Square both sides, we get = 2 x² + 1 x² 4²5"},
+{"id": "P0514", "q": "If , then the value of x = 3 − 5 is: x² − 16 x + 6", "o": ["0", "4", "2", "- 2"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "c", "e": "SSC CHSL", "y": "2020", "t": "बीजगणित", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "= x³ − 5 Square both sides, we get x = 8 x - 8 = - − 2¹5 ⇒ 2¹5 Again square both sides, we get = 60 = 0 x² − 16 x + 64 ⇒ x² − 16 x + 4 = 2 ⇒ x² − 16 x + 6"},
+{"id": "P0515", "q": "If = , then the value of x³ 2 is equal to: 1 + x + 1 − x¹ + x − 1 − x", "o": ["3", "2", "3²"], "ol": ["a", "c", "d"], "a": "b", "e": "SSC CHSL", "y": "2020", "t": "बीजगणित", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "= x³ 2¹ + x = = ( 2 + 3 )² ( 4 + 2³ )⁴ = ⇒ 1 + x ( 3 + 1 )²¹ - x = = ( 2 − 3 )² ( 4 − 2³ )⁴ = ⇒ 1 − x ( 3 − 1 )² Now, put both values = = 1 + x + 1 − x¹ + x − 1 − x³ 1³"},
+{"id": "P0516", "q": "if = , then the value of x + 1 x³ is: x¹8 + x¹2 + x⁶ + 1", "o": ["0", "2", "3", "1"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "a", "e": "SSC CHSL", "y": "2020", "t": "बीजगणित", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "if = then, = - 1 x + 1 x³ x⁶ Put this value in , x¹8 + x¹2 + x⁶ + 1 we get, - 1 + 1 - 1 + 1 = 0"},
+{"id": "P0517", "q": "If = 0, then a² + b² + 2 b + 4 a + 5 the value of is equal to: 2 a − 3 b² a + 3 b", "o": ["1", "7", "2", "7"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "a", "e": "SSC CHSL", "y": "2020", "t": "बीजगणित", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "= 0 a² + b² + 2 b + 4 a + 5 = 0 ⇒ ( a + 2 )² + ( b + 1 )² a = - 2, b = - 1 ⇒ Put the value of a and b, we get = 2 a − 3 b² a + 3 b = (− 4 + 3 ) (− 4 − 3 )¹⁷"},
+{"id": "P0518", "q": "If = 4, then the value of 2 a + 1 a + is: a² 1⁴ a²", "o": ["3", "4", "5", "12"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "a", "e": "SSC CHSL", "y": "2020", "t": "बीजगणित", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "= 4, 2 a + 1 a Divide both sides by 2, we get = 2, a + 1² a Squaring both sides, we get = 4 - 1 = 3 a² + 1⁴ a²"},
+{"id": "P0519", "q": "If A = and B = 1 + 2 x¹ − 2 x¹ − 2 x¹ + 2 x , then the value of is: A + B A − B", "o": ["+", "x¹ 4 x x − 1⁴ x", "+ 1⁴ x − x x² 1⁴ x²"], "ol": ["a", "b", "d"], "a": "a", "e": "SSC CHSL", "y": "2020", "t": "बीजगणित", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "Given:- A = and B = 1 + 2 x¹ − 2 x¹ − 2 x¹ + 2 x A + B = + 1 + 2 x¹ − 2 x¹ − 2 x¹ + 2 x = ( 1 + 2 x )² + ( 1 − 2 x )²¹ − 4 x² = = 1 + 4 x² + 4 x + 1 + 4 x² − 4 x¹ − 4 x² 2 + 8 x² 1 − 4 x² A - B = - 1 + 2 x¹ − 2 x¹ − 2 x¹ + 2 x = ( 1 + 2 x )² − ( 1 − 2 x )²¹ − 4 x² = = 1 + 4 x² + 4 x − 1 − 4 x² + 4 x¹ − 4 x² 8 x¹ − 4 x² = A + B A − B² + 8 x² 1 − 4 "},
