+{"id": "P0521", "q": "If a + b + c = 0, then ( ) is equal to: 2 a² 3 bc + 2 b² 3 ca + 2 c² 3 ab", "o": ["3", "4", "1", "2"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "d", "e": "SSC CHSL", "y": "2020", "t": "बीजगणित", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "Given:- a + b + c = 0 Let a = 2, b = -1 and c = -1 Then , 2 a² 3 bc + 2 b² 3 ca + 2 c² 3 ab 2 ( 2 )²³ (− 1 )(− 1 ) + 2 (− 1 )²³ (− 1 )( 2 ) + 2 (− 1 )²³ ( 2 )(− 1 ) = = 8³ − 1³ − 1³ 8 − 1 − 1³ = = 2⁶ 3"},
+{"id": "P0522", "q": "If the value of is same 3 x y + 2 y x³ x y − 2 y x − 3 x y − 2 y x³ x y + 2 y x as that of , then which of the x y following relations between x and y is correct ?", "o": ["9x - 4y = 36", "9x + 4y = 24", "9x + 4y = 36", "9x - 4y = 24"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "d", "e": "SSC CHSL", "y": "2020", "t": "बीजगणित", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "= 3 x y + 2 y x³ x y − 2 y x − 3 x y − 2 y x³ x y + 2 y x x y ⇒ ( 3 x y + 2 y x )² − ( 3 x y − 2 y x )² ( 3 x y − 2 y x )( 3 x y + 2 y x ) = x y = 9x - 4y = 24 ⇒ 4 ( 3 x y )( 2 y x )⁹ x² y − 4 y² x x y ⇒"},
+{"id": "P0523", "q": "The value of 1 + 3 + 5 + 7 + ……………. (2n - 1) is:", "o": ["(2n - 1) (2n - 1)", "× n²", "n × n n ( n + 1 )²"], "ol": ["a", "b", "d"], "a": "c", "e": "SSC CHSL", "y": "2020", "t": "बीजगणित", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "We know, The sum of odd numbers = (no. of terms)² In 1 + 3 + 5 + 7 + ……………. (2n - 1); let the no. of terms = x²n - 1 = 1 + (x -1)2²n - 2 = (x - 1)2 n - 1 = x - 1 x = n ⇒ Therefore, no. of terms, x = n¹ + 3 + 5 + 7 + ……………."},
+{"id": "P0524", "q": "If 2( then, a² + b² ) = ( a + b )²", "o": ["b = 2a", "a = - b", "a = b", "a = 2b"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "c", "e": "SSC CHSL", "y": "2020", "t": "बीजगणित", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "2( a² + b² ) = ( a + b )²² = a² + b² + 2ab ⇒ a² + 2 b² 2 - a² - b² - 2ab = 0 ⇒ a² + 2 b² - 2ab = 0 = 0 a = b ⇒ a² + b² ⇒ ( a − b )² ⇒"},
+{"id": "P0525", "q": "Find the value of x, if 21 + 20 = 29 , x x x", "o": ["4", "3", "0", "2"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "a", "e": "SSC CHSL", "y": "2020", "t": "बीजगणित", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "21 x + 20 x = 29 x We know triplet :- 29² = 21² + 20² Therefore, = 2, x = 4 x"},
+{"id": "P0526", "q": "The value of [ + + ( a² − b² )³ ( b² − c² )³ ( c² − a² )³ ] ÷ [ is equal ( a − b )³ +( b − c )³ + ( c − a )³ ]²82 to:(Given a ≠ b ≠ c )", "o": ["(a + b)(b + c)(c + a)", "+ + ( a² − b² ) ( b² − c² ) ( c² − a² )", "+ + ( a² + b² ) ( b² + c² ) ( c² + a² )", "(a - b)(b - c)(c - a)"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "a", "e": "SSC CHSL", "y": "2020", "t": "बीजगणित", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "Put a = 1, b = -1 and c = 0 in [ + + ⇒ ( a² − b² )³ ( b² − c² )³ ( c² − a² )³ ] ÷ [ ( a − b )³ + ( b − c )³ + ( c − a )³ ] [ + + ⇒ ( 1² − (− 1 )² )³ ((− 1 )² − 0² )³ [ ( 0² − 1² )³ ] ÷ ( 1 − (− 1 ))³ + ((− 1 ) − 0 )³ + ( 0 − 1 )³ ] [ + + [ ⇒ ( 0 )³ ( 1 )³ (− 1 )³ ] ÷ ( 2 )³ + (− 1 )³ + (− 1 )³ ] [ + [ ⇒ ( 1 )³ (− 1 )³ ] ÷ 8 + (− 1 − 1 ) ] [0] [ ="},
+{"id": "P0527", "q": "If A = then, the value of x − 1 x + 1 is : A − 1 A", "o": ["x² − 1 − 4 ( 2 x + 1 ) − 4 x x² − 1", "x² − 1 − 4 ( 2 x − 1 ) − 4 ( 2 x − 1 ) x² − 1 SSC CGL 2019 Tier - 1"], "ol": ["b", "d"], "a": "b", "e": "SSC CHSL", "y": "2020", "t": "बीजगणित", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "A = x − 1 x + 1 = 1 A x + 1 x − 1 = A − 1 A x − 1 x + 1 − x + 1 x − 1 = A − 1 A ( x − 1 )² −( x + 1 )² ( x + 1 )( x − 1 ) = A − 1 A x² + 1 − 2 x − x² − 1 − 2 x x² − 1 = A − 1 A − 4 x x² − 1"},
+{"id": "P0528", "q": "If x, y and z are three integers such that x + y = 8, y + z = 13 and z + x = 17, then the value of is: x² yz", "o": ["1", "0", "18¹1⁷ 5"], "ol": ["a", "b", "d"], "a": "c", "e": "SSC CGL", "y": "2020", "t": "बीजगणित", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "x + y = 8, y + z = 13 and z + x = 17 On adding above equations, 2(x + y + z) = 38 x + y + z = 19 ⇒ x = 6, y = 2, z = 11 = = x² yz 6 × 6² × 11¹8¹1"},
+{"id": "P0529", "q": "The expression (a + b - c)³ + (a - b + c)³ - 8a³ is equal to:", "o": ["6a(a - b + c)(c - a - b)", "3a(a + b - c)(a - b + c)", "6a(a + b - c)(a - b + c)", "3a(a - b + c)(c - a - b)"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "a", "e": "SSC CGL", "y": "2020", "t": "बीजगणित", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "(a + b - c)³ + (a - b + c)³ - 8a³ (a + b - c)³ + (a - b + c)³ + ( - 2a)³ ⇒ We know that if x + y + z = 0 Then x³ + y³ + z³ = 3xyz Here, x = a + b - c ,y = a - b + c , z = - 2a So, (a + b - c)³ + (a - b + c)³ - 8a³ = 6a(a - b + c)(c - a - b) Short trick : Put a = 1 and b = c = 0 (a + b - c)³ + ( a - b + c)³ - 8a³ (1 + 0 - 0)³ + (1 - 0 + 0)³ - 8(1)³ ⇒ = 1 + 1 - "},
+{"id": "P0530", "q": "(a + b - c + d)² - (a - b + c - d)² = ?", "o": ["4a(b + d - c)", "4a(b - d + c)", "2a(b + c - d)", "2a(a + b - c)"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "a", "e": "SSC CGL", "y": "2020", "t": "बीजगणित", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "In the equation: (a + b - c + d)² - (a - b + c - d)² Use formula : x² - y² = (x - y)(x + y) (a + b - c + d)² - (a - b + c - d)² = (a+b-c+d+a-b+c-d)(a+b-c+d-a+b-c+d) = (2a)[2(b - c + d)] = 4a(b - c + d)"},
+{"id": "P0531", "q": "The value of 27a³ - 2 b³ is equal to: 2", "o": ["(3a - b)(9a² - 2b² - 3 ab)²²", "(3a - b)(9a² - 2b² + 6 ab)²²", "(3a - b)(9a² + 2b² + 3 ab)²²", "(3a + b)(9a² + 2b² + 3 ab)²²"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "c", "e": "SSC CGL", "y": "2020", "t": "बीजगणित", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "We know, x³ - y³ = (x - y)(x² + y² + xy)²7a³ - 2 b³ = (3a)³ - ( )³² 2 b = (3a - b)(9a² + 2b² + 3 ab)²²"},
