+{"id": "P0533", "q": "On simplification, x³ − y³ x [( x + y )² − 3 xy ] ÷ y [( x − y )² + 3 xy ] x³ + y³ is equal to: × ( x + y )² −( x − y )² x² − y²", "o": ["4", "1", "1² 1⁴"], "ol": ["a", "b", "d"], "a": "a", "e": "SSC CGL", "y": "2020", "t": "बीजगणित", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "x³ − y³ x [( x + y )² − 3 xy ] ÷ y [( x − y )² + 3 xy ] x³ + y³ × ( x + y )² −( x − y )² x² − y² ⇒ x³ − y³ x [( x + y )² − 3 xy ] × x³ + y³ y [( x − y )² + 3 xy ] × ( x + y )² −( x − y )² x² − y² = 4 ⇒ x − y x × x + y y × 4 xy ( x − y )( x + y )"},
+{"id": "P0534", "q": "If 12x² - 21x + 1 = 0, then what is the value of 9x² + (16x² ) -1 ?", "o": ["429", "8", "465", "16"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "c", "e": "SSC CGL", "y": "2020", "t": "बीजगणित", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "12x² - 21x + 1 = 0¹2x² + 1 = 21x x + = 7 ⇒ ⇒ 4¹ 3 x On multiplying both sides by ( )³⁴ x⁹x + = 3⁴ x⁶3⁴ 3x + = -------(i)¹⁴ x²1⁴ squaring equation (i), 9x² + (16x² ) -1 + 2 × 3 × = ⇒ x¹ 4 x⁴41¹6⁹x² + (16x² ) -1."},
+{"id": "P0535", "q": "If P = , Q = x³ + y³ ( x − y )² + 3 xy and R = ( x + y )² − 3 xy x³ − y³ ( x + y )² + ( x − y )² x² − y² , then what is the value of (P ) R ? ÷ Q ×", "o": ["2( )", "4xy x² + y²", "2xy x² + y²"], "ol": ["a", "b", "d"], "a": "a", "e": "SSC CGL", "y": "2020", "t": "बीजगणित", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "P = , x³ + y³ ( x − y )² + 3 xy Q = and ( x + y )² − 3 xy x³ − y³ R = ( x + y )² +( x − y )² x² − y² = ( ( P ÷ Q ) × R x³ + y³ ( x − y )² + 3 xy ÷ ) ( x + y )² − 3 xy x³ − y³ × ( x + y )² +( x − y )² x² − y² = x³ + y³ x² + y² + xy × x³ − y³ x² + y² − xy × 2 ( x² + y² ) x² − y² = 2 ( x² + y² )"},
+{"id": "P0536", "q": "Find the value of . x² ( x − 4 )² ( x + 4 )² − 4 x ÷ ( x² − 4 x )³ ( x + 4 )² × 64 − x³ 16 − x²", "o": ["x + 4 x − 4 x + 4 x ( x − 4 )", "x + 4 x ( 4 − x ) x − 4 x + 4"], "ol": ["b", "d"], "a": "b", "e": "SSC CGL", "y": "2020", "t": "बीजगणित", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "x² ( x − 4 )² ( x + 4 )² − 4 x ÷ ( x² − 4 x )³ ( x + 4 )² × 64 − x³ 16 − x² = x² ( x − 4 )² ( x + 4 )² − 4 x × ( x + 4 )² ( x² − 4 x )³ × 64 − x³ 16 − x² = ( x² − 4 x )² x² + 16 + 4 x × ( x + 4 )² ( x² − 4 x )³ × 4³ − x³ 4² − x² = x + 4 x ( x − 4 )"},
+{"id": "P0537", "q": "If = = and abc = 144, 3 a²7 b⁸1 c then the value of 12 ( ) is: 1 a + 1² b + 1⁵ c", "o": ["17", "120", "18", "10"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "d", "e": "SSC CGL", "y": "2020", "t": "बीजगणित", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "3 a = 3³b = 3⁴c a = 3b = 4 c ⇒ a : b : c = 12 : 4 : 3 ⇒ Given : abc = 144 Thus, a = 12; b = 4; c = 3³14 Put values in 12( )¹ a + 1² b + 1⁵ c = 12( ) = 1¹2 + 1⁸ + 1¹5³3¹0"},
+{"id": "P0538", "q": "If the value of (a + b - 2)² + (b + c - 5)² + (c + a - 5)² = 0, then the value of is: ( b + c ) a + ( c + a ) b − 1", "o": ["2", "1", "3", "0"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "c", "e": "SSC CGL", "y": "2020", "t": "बीजगणित", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "( a + b − 2 )² + ( b + c − 5 )² = 0 + ( c + a − 5 )² Square of any number is always positive and their sum can be 0 only when they are themselves zero."},
+{"id": "P0539", "q": "If a³ + = 52, then the value of 1 a³ 2(a + ) is: 1 a", "o": ["6", "2", "8", "4"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "c", "e": "SSC CGL", "y": "2020", "t": "बीजगणित", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "a³ + = 52¹ a³ a + = 4²(a + ) = 8 ⇒ 1 a ⇒ 1 a"},
+{"id": "P0540", "q": "If b + c = ax, c + a = by and a + b = cz, then the value of is: 1⁹ [ 1 x + 1 + 1 y + 1 + 1 z + 1 ]", "o": ["0", "1¹ 3¹ 9"], "ol": ["b", "d"], "a": "c", "e": "SSC CGL", "y": "2020", "t": "बीजगणित", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "b + c = ax, a + c = by, a + b= cz a + b + c = a + ax, b + a + c = b + by, ⇒ c + a + b = c + cz = 1 + x , = 1 + y , ⇒ a + b + c a a + b + c b = 1 + z a + b + c c [ ] = 1⁹ 1 x + 1 + 1 y + 1 + 1 z + 1¹ 9"},
+{"id": "P0541", "q": "If a⁴ + = 50, a > 0, then find 1 a⁴ the value of a³ + 1 a³", "o": ["2 ( 1 + 13 )(− 1 + 2¹3 )", "2 ( 1 − 13 )(− 1 + 2¹3 )", "2 ( 1 + 13 )(− 1 − 2¹3 )", "2 ( 1 + 13 ) + (− 1 + 2¹3 )"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "a", "e": "SSC CGL", "y": "2020", "t": "बीजगणित", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "a⁴ + = 50¹ a⁴ a² + = 1 a² 52 a + = 1 a² 13 + 2 a³ + + 3( ) ⇒ 1 a³ 2¹3 + 2 = ( ) × ( )²¹3 + 2² 13 + 2 = 2 + 2( )¹3 ( 2¹3 + 2 )²¹3 + 2 a³ + = 2 ⇒ 1 a³ 13 ( 2¹3 + 2 ) ( ) − 2¹3 + 2 a³ + = 1 a³ 2 ( 1 + 13 )(− 1 + 2¹3 )"},
+{"id": "P0542", "q": "Find the product of (a + b + 2c)(a² + b² + 4c² - ab - 2bc - 2ca).", "o": ["a³ +b³ +8c³ -6abc", "a³ +b³ +6c³ -6abc", "a³ +b³ +8c³ -2abc", "a³ +b³ +8c³ -abc"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "a", "e": "SSC CGL", "y": "2020", "t": "बीजगणित", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "a³ + b³ + c³ - 3abc = (a + b + c)(a² + b² + c² - ab - bc - ca) Similarly, (a + b + 2c)(a² + b² + 4c² - ab - 2bc - 2ca) = a³ + b³ + 8c³ - 6abc"},
+{"id": "P0543", "q": "If a² + b² - c² = 0, then the value of is: 2 ( a⁶ + b⁶ − c⁶ )³ a² b² c²", "o": ["2", "0", "1", "3"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "a", "e": "SSC CGL", "y": "2020", "t": "बीजगणित", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "if x + y + z = 0, then x³ + y³ + z³ = 3xyz Similarly, a² + b² - c² = 0 Therefore, a⁶ + b⁶ - c⁶ = 3a² b² c² = 2² ( a⁶ + b⁶ − c⁶ )³ a² b² c²"},
+{"id": "P0544", "q": "If a = 2b = 8c and a + b + c = 13 then the value of is: a² + b² + c² 2 c", "o": ["-", "- 9² 5⁶ 9² 5⁶"], "ol": ["c", "d"], "a": "a", "e": "SSC CGL", "y": "2020", "t": "बीजगणित", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "a = 2b = 8c a : b : c = 8 : 4 : 1 a + b + c = 13 Thus, a = 8; b = 4 and c = 1 = = = a² + b² + c² 2 c⁶4 + 16 + 1² 81² 9²"},
+{"id": "P0545", "q": "If x, y and z are three numbers such that x + y = 13, y + z = 15 and z + x = 16, then the value of is: xy + xz xyz", "o": ["5", "18", "5", "36"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "a", "e": "SSC CGL", "y": "2020", "t": "बीजगणित", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "x + y = 13, y + z = 15, z + x = 16²(x + y + z) = 13 + 15 + 16 = 44 ⇒ x + y + z = 22 x = 7, y = 6, z = 9 = = = xy + xz xyz y + z yz 15⁵4⁵ 18"},
+{"id": "P0546", "q": "If x + 3y + 2 = 0 then the value of x³ + 27y³ + 8 - 18xy is:", "o": ["- 2", "2", "0", "1 SSC CPO 2019 Tier - 1"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "c", "e": "SSC CGL", "y": "2020", "t": "बीजगणित", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "x + 3y + 2 = 0 x + 3y = - 2 x³ + 27y³ - 18xy = - 8 ⇒ x³ + 27y³ - 18xy + 8 = 0 ⇒"},
+{"id": "P0547", "q": "What is the simplified value of : {(x + )² - (x - )² } 1⁸ 1 y¹ y", "o": ["x", "2", "y", "x"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "a", "e": "SSC CPO", "y": "2019", "t": "बीजगणित", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "{( )² - ( )² } 1⁸ x + 1 y x − 1 y = {( + + ) - ( + - } 1⁸ x² 1 y² 2 x y x² 1 y² 2 x y = { + } = { } = 1⁸ 2 x y² x y¹ 8⁴ x y x² y"},
+{"id": "P0548", "q": "What is the value of ? 0 . 74 × 1 . 23 × 0 . 13 ( 0 . 37 )³ + ( 0 . 41 )³ − 8 ( 0 . 39 )³", "o": ["1", "- 1", "− 1³ 1³"], "ol": ["b", "c", "d"], "a": "a", "e": "SSC CPO", "y": "2019", "t": "बीजगणित", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "0 . 74 × 1 . 23 × 0 . 13 ( 0 . 37 )³ + ( 0 . 41 )³ − 8 ( 0 . 39 )³ We can write 0.74 = 2⁰.37 × 1.23 = 3⁰.41 and 0.13 as it is × On substituting these values in the given equation we get, = ( 2 × 0 . 37 ) × ( 3 × 0 . 41 ) × 0 . 13 ( 0 . 37 )³ + ( 0 . 41 )³ − [ 2 ( 0 . 39 )]³ = ( 0 . 37 ) × ( 0 . 41 ) × 0 . 78 ( 0 . 37 )³ + ( 0 . 41 )³ −[ ( 0 ."},
+{"id": "P0549", "q": "If a + b + c = 6 and + + = 38, a² b² c² then what is the value of - a( + ) + b( + ) + c( + ) + 3abc b² c² c² a² a² b²", "o": ["3", "- 3", "6", "- 6"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "d", "e": "SSC CPO", "y": "2019", "t": "बीजगणित", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "In such cases, let's assume the values of a = 5, b = 3 and c = - 2 as a + b + c = 6 in order to get the answer easily On putting these values in the given equation we get a( + ) + b( + )+ c( + ) +3abc b² c² c² a² a² b² = 5(9 + 4) + 3(4 + 25) - 2 (25 + 9) + (3⁵ × 3 - 2) × × on solving = 84 - 90 = - 6"},
+{"id": "P0550", "q": "If = 3, x > 0, then x + 1 x = ? x² ( x² − 47 )²83", "o": ["0", "2", "- 2", "- 1"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "d", "e": "SSC CPO", "y": "2019", "t": "बीजगणित", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "= 3 x + 1 x Now squaring both sides of the equation we get, x + = 9 - 2 x + = 7¹ x ⇒ 1 x On squaring again = x² + 1 x² = 47 ⇒ ( x² − 47 ) − 1 x² Now, x² ( x² − 47 ) = − 1"},
+{"id": "P0551", "q": "If x and y are real numbers, then the least possible value of is: 4 ( x − 2 )² + ( y − 3 )² − 2 ( x − 3 )²", "o": ["3", "- 4", "1", "- 8"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "b", "e": "SSC CPO", "y": "2019", "t": "बीजगणित", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "4 ( x − 2 )² + ( y − 3 )² − 2 ( x − 3 )² ……...(1) In order to get least value of , we ( y − 3 )² need to put y = 3 Now, 4 ( x − 2 )² − 2 ( x − 3 )² After differentiation we get, 8(x - 2) - 4(x - 3) = 0⁸x - 16 - 4x + 12 = 0 x = 1 ⇒ Now putting x = 1 and y = 3 in eq (1) = 4(1) + 0 - 2⁴ = - 4 ×"},
+{"id": "P0552", "q": "The value of is 4 . 669 × 4 . 669 − 9 × ( 0 . 777 )² ( 4 . 669 )² +( 2 . 331 )² + 14 ( 0 . 667 )( 2 . 331 ) (1 - k), where k = ?", "o": ["0.666", "0.334", "1", "2.338"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "a", "e": "SSC CPO", "y": "2019", "t": "बीजगणित", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "= 1 - K⁴ . 669 × 4 . 669 − 9 ×( 0 . 777 )² ( 4 . 669 )² +( 2 . 331 )² + 14 ( 0 . 667 )( 2 . 331 ) = 1 - K ( 4 . 669 )² − ( 2 . 331 )² ( 4 . 669 )² + ( 2 . 331 )² + 2 ( 4 . 669 ) ( 2 . 331 ) = 1 - K⁴ . 669 − 2 . 331⁴ . 669 + 2 . 331 = 1 - K⁰.334 = 1 - K ⇒ 2 ."},
+{"id": "P0553", "q": "If = 1, x > 0, then 8 x² x² + 7 x − 2 what is the value of x + 3¹ x³", "o": ["3⁸ 17³ 4¹7", "5⁸ 17⁵ 4¹7"], "ol": ["b", "d"], "a": "c", "e": "SSC CPO", "y": "2019", "t": "बीजगणित", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "= 1⁸ x² x² + 7 x − 2 Dividing both numerator and denominator by ‘x’ = 1 = 1⁸ 2 x + 7 − 2 x ⇒ 8⁷ + 2 [ x − 1 x ] = [ - ] .."},
+{"id": "P0554", "q": "If + + (x + ( x³ 1 x³ − k )²¹ x where k and p are real − p )² = 0 , numbers and x , the is equal to: ≠ 0 k p", "o": ["p", "2", "+", "1"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "d", "e": "SSC CPO", "y": "2019", "t": "बीजगणित", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "( )² )² x³ + 1 x³ − k + ( x + 1 x − p = 0 = 0 ……...eq(i) x³ + 1 x³ − k - P = 0 , p = x + 1 x x + 1 x = x³ + 1 x³ p³ − 3 p Putting the above value in eq(i) - k = 0 ⇒ p³ − 3 p p[ = ⇒ p² − 3 ] = k ⇒ k p p² − 3"},
+{"id": "P0555", "q": "If = x⁶ − 512 y⁶ ( x² + A y² ) , then what is the ( x⁴ − B x² y² + C y⁴ ) value of (A + B - C) ?", "o": ["- 72", "72", "- 80", "48"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "c", "e": "SSC CPO", "y": "2019", "t": "बीजगणित", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "x⁶ - 512y⁶ = (x² + Ay 2 )(x⁴ - Bx 2 y² + Cy 4 ) ……(1) x⁶ - 512y⁶ . = (x² - 8y² )(x⁴ + 64y⁴ + 8x² y² ) ……(2) comparing (1) and (2), we get A = - 8, B = - 8, C = 64 A + B - C = - 16 - 64 = - 80"},
+{"id": "P0556", "q": "Solve the following (a + b + c)(ab + bc + ca) - abc = ?", "o": ["(a + b)(b + c)(c - a)", "(a - b)(b - c)(c - a)", "(a + b)(b - c)(c + a)", "(a + b)(b + c)(c + a)"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "d", "e": "SSC CPO", "y": "2019", "t": "बीजगणित", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "Short-trick: Put a = b = c = 1 (a + b + c)(ab + bc + ca) - abc = (1 + 1 + 1)(1 + 1 + 1) - 1 = 9 - 1 = 8 Now, Put a = b = c = 1 in all options and check which option gives 8."},
+{"id": "P0557", "q": "If - = 216 and a - b = 6, then a³ b³ - ab is equal to: ( a + b )²", "o": ["38", "42", "52", "36"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "d", "e": "SSC CPO", "y": "2019", "t": "बीजगणित", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "- ab = = = ( a + b )² a³ − b³ a − b²16⁶ 36"},
+{"id": "P0558", "q": "If = 432 and a + b = 12, a³ + b³ then (a + b)² - 3ab is equal to:", "o": ["42", "52", "36", "38 SSC CGL 2018 Tier - 2"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "c", "e": "SSC CPO", "y": "2019", "t": "बीजगणित", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "- 3ab = + 2ab - 3ab ( a + b )² a² + b² We know that = (a + b)( - ab) a³ + b³ a² + b² 432 = 12( - ab) a² + b² 36 = ( - ab) a² + b²"},
+{"id": "P0559", "q": "If a² + b² + c² + 96 = 8 ( a , then is equal + b − 2 c ) ab − bc + ca to :", "o": ["6", "2", "4", "2² 3"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "c", "e": "SSC CGL", "y": "2019", "t": "बीजगणित", "d": "कठिन", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "Given , a² + b² + c² + 96 = 8 ( a + b − 2 c ) = 0 ⇒ a² + b² + c² + 96 − 8 ( a + b − 2 c ) + 16 - 8a + + 16 - 8b + + ⇒ a² b² c² 64 + 16b = 0 = 0 ⇒ ( a − 4 )² + ( b − 4 )² + ( c + 8 )² Sum of the square of the terms is equal to zero only if the terms themselves are zero."},
+{"id": "P0560", "q": "If x = - , 1 + 3² 1 − 3² then the value of will be closest 2 − x² + x to :", "o": ["0.17", "0.12", "1.4", "1.2"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "a", "e": "SSC CGL", "y": "2019", "t": "बीजगणित", "d": "कठिन", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "Given , x = - 1 + 3² 1 − 3² x = - ⇒ 2 + 3² 2 − 3² Multiply and divide by 2 x = - ⇒ 4 + 2³ 4⁴ − 2³ 4 = - ( 3 + 1² )² ( 3 − 1² )² = - = 1³ + 1² 3 − 1² Now, = 2 − x² + x² − 1² + 1 = = 3 - 2⁰.17² − 1² + 1 × 2 − 1² − 1² ≈"},
+{"id": "P0561", "q": "If x + = 3, then the value of 1¹6 x¹6 + is : x³ 1²56 x³", "o": ["423", "441", "432", "414"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "a", "e": "SSC CGL", "y": "2019", "t": "बीजगणित", "d": "कठिन", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "Given , x + = 3¹ 16 x Multiplying both sides by 4⁴x + =12 ⇒ 1⁴ x⁶4 + = ( ) = 1692 x³ 1⁶4 x³ 1² 3 − 3 × 12 (If a + = k, then = )¹ a a³ + 1 a³ k³ − 3 k Exploring question term 16 + = x³ 1²56 x³ 1⁴ × 4 × (16 + ) = (64 + ) x³ 1²56 x³ 1⁴ x³ 1⁶4 x³ 1692 = 423 ⇒ 1⁴ ×"},
