+{"id": "P0593", "q": "Solve the given set of three equations to get the value of the unknowns: x + 2z = 3 x + 2y + 3z = 5³x - 5z = -13", "o": ["x = 0,y = -1,z = 2", "x = -1,y = 0,z = 2", "x = -1,y = 2,z = 0", "x = 2,y = 0,z = -1"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "b", "e": "SSC CGL", "y": "2024", "t": "बीजगणित", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "Given :- x + 2z = 3 x + 2y + 3z = 5³x - 5z = -13 By checking all options one by one, only option (b) satisfies, hence, x = -1, y = 0, z = 2"},
+{"id": "P0594", "q": "If x + = 3, then the value of 9x² 1⁹ x + is: 1⁹ x²", "o": ["87", "81", "77", "79"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "d", "e": "SSC CGL", "y": "2024", "t": "बीजगणित", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "x + = 3¹ 9 x Multiplying both side by 3, we have ; 3x + = 9¹ 3 x Then, 9x² + = - 2 = 81 - 2 = 79¹ 9 x² 9²"},
