+{"id": "P0596", "q": "If + = 15, then the value of x¹ x is : 7 x² − 9 x + 7 x² − x + 1", "o": ["-", "-", "48⁷ 22⁷ 48⁷ 22⁷"], "ol": ["a", "b", "d"], "a": "c", "e": "SSC CGL", "y": "2024", "t": "बीजगणित", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "= 7 x² − 9 x + 7 x² − x + 1⁷ x − 9 + 7 x x − 1 + 1 x = = = 7 ( x + 1 x ) − 9 ( x + 1 x ) − 1⁷ × 15 − 9¹5 − 1⁹6¹4 = 48⁷"},
+{"id": "P0597", "q": "For the following equations, what are the values of a and b to have infinitely many solutions? ax + by = 2³x - (5 - 2a)y = 6", "o": ["a = - 1, b = - 1", "a = - 1, b = 1", "a = 1, b = - 1", "a = 1, b = 1"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "c", "e": "SSC CGL", "y": "2024", "t": "बीजगणित", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "For many solutions = = a³ b −( 5 − 2 a )²⁶ = a = 1 ⇒ a³ 2⁶ ⇒ And = 3b = - 5 + 2a b − ( 5 − 2 a )²⁶ ⇒ 3b = - 5 + 2 b = -1 ⇒ ⇒"},
+{"id": "P0598", "q": "If m + n = 24, then (m -16)³ + (n - 8)³ is __________.", "o": ["0", "40", "576", "320"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "a", "e": "SSC CGL", "y": "2024", "t": "बीजगणित", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "m + n = 24 Let m = 12 n = 12 (m -16)³ + (n - 8)³ = (12 -16)³ + (12 - 8)³ ⇒ = + = 0 (− 4 )³ ( 4 )³"},
+{"id": "P0599", "q": "Which of the following is the sum of the values of a and b if the equations 2x + y = a, 8x + by = 12 have infinite solutions?", "o": ["16", "9", "7", "18"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "c", "e": "SSC CGL", "y": "2024", "t": "बीजगणित", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "Given Equation : 2x + y = a and 8x + by = 12 For infinite solution = = …(i) a¹ a² b¹ b² c¹ c² Here = 2 , = 8, = 1, = b , = - a , a¹ a² b¹ b² c¹ , = -12 c² Put this value in eqn( i) = = 2⁸ 1 b − a − 12 By equating this equation , a = 3 , b = 4 Now , Sum of a and b = 4 + 3 = 7"},
+{"id": "P0600", "q": "If a² + b² + c² = 2(a + c -1), then the value of a³ + b³ + c³ = ?", "o": ["0", "2", "4", "1"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "b", "e": "SSC CGL", "y": "2024", "t": "बीजगणित", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "Given , a² + b² + c² = 2(a + c -1) Here , a² + b² + c² - 2a - 2c + 2 = 0 a² - 2a + 1 + b² + c² - 2c + 1 = 0 ⇒ + b² + = 0 ⇒ ( a − 1 )² ( c − 1 )² Now , = 0 , a = 1 ( a − 1 )² b² = 0 , b =0 and = 0 , c = 1 ( c − 1 )² ∴ a³ + b³ + c³ = 2"},
+{"id": "P0601", "q": "Let a + b = 1, then the value of ( 1 a² + + ) is: 1 b² 2 ab", "o": ["1", "a", "2", "b"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "a", "e": "SSC CGL", "y": "2024", "t": "बीजगणित", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "Given :- a + b = 1 + + = = 1 a² 1 b² 2 ab a² + b² + 2 ab a² b² ( a + b )² a² b² = 1 a² b²"},
+{"id": "P0602", "q": "If m = a secA and y = b tan A then find the value of b² m² - a² y² + + a² y² b² m² cos 2 A.", "o": ["a² b²", "1- a² b²", "a² b² + 2", "a² b² + 1"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "d", "e": "SSC CGL", "y": "2024", "t": "बीजगणित", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "Given: m = a secA and y = b tan A b² m² - a² y² + + cos 2 A a² y² b² m² = - + + b² a² sec 2 A a² b² tan 2 A a² b² tan 2 A b² a² sec 2 A cos 2 A = ( - ) + + cos 2 A a² b² sec 2 A tan 2 A tan 2 A sec 2 A = (1) + + cos 2 A a² b² Sin 2 A × cos 2 A cos 2 A = + 1 a² b²"},
+{"id": "P0603", "q": "For what value of k, the system of equations k - 15y + 7 = 0 and 7 - 21y - x x¹9 = 0 has NO solution?", "o": ["5", "12", "25", "6"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "a", "e": "SSC CGL", "y": "2024", "t": "बीजगणित", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "Given equation, kx - 15y + 7 = 0 and 7x - 21y - 19 = 0 There is no solution = = a¹ a² b¹ b² ≠ c¹ c² Then, = k = 5 ⇒ k⁷ − 15 − 21 ⇒"},
+{"id": "P0604", "q": "If > 1 and + = 83, X x² 1 x² then - is: x³ 1 x³", "o": ["884", "876", "754", "756"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "d", "e": "SSC CGL", "y": "2024", "t": "बीजगणित", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "+ = 83 x² 1 x² Subtract both side by 2 in above equation, + - 2 = 83 - 2 (x - )² = 81 ⇒ x² 1 x² ⇒ 1 x - = = 9 ⇒ x¹ x⁸1 We know that, - = + 3 x³ 1 x³ a³ = + 3 × 9 = 729 + 27 = 756⁹ 3"},
+{"id": "P0605", "q": "If x is an integer such that x + = 1 x , then find the value of x - . 65⁸ 1 x", "o": ["63", "6", "63", "8"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "b", "e": "SSC CGL", "y": "2024", "t": "बीजगणित", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "+ = x¹ x⁶5⁸ - = ⇒ x¹ x ( x + 1 x )² − 4 = = ( 65⁸ )² − 4⁴225⁶4 − 4 = = = 4225 − 256⁶4³969⁶4⁶3⁸"},
+{"id": "P0606", "q": "The sum of five consecutive numbers is 80. Find the largest number.", "o": ["18", "15", "19", "14"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "a", "e": "SSC CGL", "y": "2024", "t": "बीजगणित", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "Let the five consecutive numbers are x - 2 , x -1 , x , x + 1 , x + 2 According to question x - 2 + x -1 + x + x + 1 + x + 2 = 80⁵x = 80 x = 16 ⇒ ⇒ Largest number = x + 2 = 16 + 2 = 18 Search on TG: @apna_pdf"},
