+{"id": "P0608", "q": "If + = 2, then find the value of x¹ x ( 2723 + ). x¹ x³356", "o": ["1", "2", "0", "-1"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "b", "e": "SSC CGL", "y": "2024", "t": "बीजगणित", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "Given : + = 2 x¹ x Put the value of = 1 satisfies the x equation, + = 1 + = 2 ⇒ x¹ x¹ 1 LHS = RHS ⇒ Now, (x²723 + ) = (1)²723 + 1 x³356¹ ( 1 )³356 = 1 + 1 = 2"},
+{"id": "P0609", "q": "If 3a + 2b = 27 and 27 + 8 = a³ b³ 1458, then find 2ab.", "o": ["72", "70", "77", "75"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "d", "e": "SSC CGL", "y": "2024", "t": "बीजगणित", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "3a + 2b = 27 On cubing both side we get (3 + (2 + 3 ( + )= a )³ b )³ × 3 a × 2 b³ a² b² 7³ 27 + 8 + ( + ) = a³ b³ 18 ab 3 a² b² 7³ 1458 + 18²7 = 19683 ab × 18²7 = 19683 - 1458 ab × 2 = = 75 ab 18225⁹ × 27"},
+{"id": "P0610", "q": "If (a + ) = 7 then what is the 1 a³ value of (a⁶ + a -6 )?", "o": ["3048190", "3048542", "3048132", "3048625"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "a", "e": "SSC CGL", "y": "2024", "t": "बीजगणित", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "(a + ) = 7¹ a³ a² + = - 2 = 49 × 3 - 2 =145¹ a² ( 7³ )² (a⁶ + ) = - 3 × 145¹ a⁶ 145³ = 3048625 - 435 = 3048190"},
+{"id": "P0611", "q": "If (x + ) = 7, x > 0. The positive 1 x value of (x - ) is : 1 x", "o": ["5", "5", "3", "4⁴ 5⁵ 5"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "c", "e": "SSC CGL", "y": "2024", "t": "बीजगणित", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "(x + ) = 7¹ x (x - ) = = 1 x⁷ 2 − 4⁴9 − 4 = = 45³ 5"},
+{"id": "P0612", "q": "For the equations ax + (a² + 1)y = 4 and 4x + ay = a² , which of the following statements is TRUE ?", "o": ["If a = 6, then x = , y = - are 325²8²5²8 the solutions.", "If a = 6, then x = 48, y = 4 are the solutions.", "If a = -12, then x = , y = - are 325²8²5²8 Search on TG: @apna_pdf the solutions.", "If a = -12, then x = 48, y = 4 are the solutions"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "d", "e": "SSC CGL", "y": "2024", "t": "बीजगणित", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "Given , ax + (a² + 1)y = 4 and 4x + ay = a² After checking all options one by one, only option (d) satisfies, a = -12, then x = 48, y=4 ax + (a² + 1)y = 4 ⇒ LHS = ax + (a² + 1)y = -12 × 48 + [(-12)² + 1]4 = - 576 + 145 × 4 = - 576 + 580 = 4 = RHS 4x + ay = a² ⇒ LHS = 4x + ay = 4 × 48 - 12 × 4 = 192 - 48 = 144 RHS = a² = (-12)² = 144 LHS = RHS"},
+{"id": "P0613", "q": "If a + b + c = 0, then the value of (a² + b² + 2ab) is equal to:", "o": ["c²", "- c²", "c", "- c"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "a", "e": "SSC CGL", "y": "2024", "t": "बीजगणित", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "Given : a + b + c = 0 + = a b − c On squaring both side we get, + + 2 = a² b² ab (− c )² + + 2 = a² b² ab c²"},
+{"id": "P0614", "q": "Let 3t – = 3, then which of the 1³ t following expressions has the value equal to 12 ?", "o": ["9 + + 2", "9 + - 2 t² 1⁹ t² t² 1⁹ t²", "9 + + 1", "9 + t² 1⁹ t² t² 1⁹ t²"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "c", "e": "SSC CGL", "y": "2024", "t": "बीजगणित", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "3t – = 3¹ 3 t Taking square both side, + - 2 = 9 + = 11 ⇒ 9 t² 1⁹ t² ⇒ 9 t² 1⁹ t² adding 1 to both sides + + 1 = 11 + 1 ⇒ 9 t² 1⁹ t² + + 1 = 12 ⇒ 9 t² 1⁹ t²"},
+{"id": "P0615", "q": "If 3x + 2y = 10 and 2xy = 7, then find the value of 3x - 2y (if 3x – 2y > 0).", "o": ["4", "10", "8", "6"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "a", "e": "SSC CGL", "y": "2024", "t": "बीजगणित", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "Given : 3x + 2y = 10 and 2xy = 7 We know that, (a - b) = ( a + b )² − 4 × a × b (3x - 2y) = ( 3 x + 2 y )² − 4 × 3 x × 2 y So, (3x - 2y) = ( 10 )² − 12 × 7 = = = 4¹00 − 84¹6"},
+{"id": "P0616", "q": "What conclusion can be drawn about the solution of the following system of linear equations in two variables: 3 + 2 = 7 , 2 + 3 = 7 x y x y", "o": ["No solution", "Unique solution", "Infinite solutions", "More than two solution"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "b", "e": "SSC CGL", "y": "2024", "t": "बीजगणित", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "Given , 3 + 2 = 7 …. (i) x y² + 3 = 7 …..(ii) x y If , then these equations have a¹ a² ≠ b¹ b² a unique Solution Here , = 3 , = 2 , = 2 , = 3 a¹ a² b¹ b² 3² ≠ 2³ ∴ it has unique solution"},
+{"id": "P0617", "q": "Simplify the following expression. (3 + 17 - 2 )(3 - 17 - 2 ) x y x y", "o": ["9² - 12 + 4² + 289 x x y y", "9² + 12 + 4² - 289 x x y y", "9² - 12 + 4² - 289 x x y y", "9² - 6 + 4² - 289 x x y y"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "c", "e": "SSC CGL", "y": "2024", "t": "बीजगणित", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "(3 + 17 - 2 )(3 - 17 - 2 ) x y x y After rearranging we can write it, = [(3 - 2 ) + 17 ] [ ( 3 - 2 ) - 17) x y x y = (a + b )(a - b) = a² − b² = - ( 3 x − 2 y )²¹7² = 9² - 12 + 4² - 289 x x y y"},
+{"id": "P0618", "q": "If a³ + = 2 (a > 0), then the 1 a³ value of a + is: 1 a", "o": ["1", "3", "2", "4"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "c", "e": "SSC CGL", "y": "2024", "t": "बीजगणित", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "+ = 2 a³ 1 a³ Let = 1 a L.H.S. = + = + = 2 = R.H.S. a³ 1 a³ 1³ 1¹ 3 Therefore, + = 1 + = 2 a¹ a¹ 1"},
+{"id": "P0619", "q": "If x² + 7x + 8 = 0, then find the value of 4 x x² − 5 x + 8", "o": ["1", "2", "− 1", "4"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "c", "e": "SSC CGL", "y": "2024", "t": "बीजगणित", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "+ 7 + 8 = 0 x² x On dividing by we get, x + 7 + = 0 + = -7 …. (i) x⁸ x ⇒ x⁸ x Now, 4 x x² − 5 x + 8 On dividing by we get, x = = 4 x + 8 x − 5 ⇒ 4 − 7 − 5⁴ − 12 − 1³"},
+{"id": "P0620", "q": "Find the values of 'a' and 'b' for which the system of equations 3x + y = 3 and (a - b)x + (a + b)y = 3a + b - 3 has infinite solutions.", "o": ["a = 3, b = -", "a = - , b = 2² 3³ 2", "a = 3, b = -", "a = 2, b = - 3² 3²"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "c", "e": "SSC CGL", "y": "2024", "t": "बीजगणित", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "= 3 , = 1, = -3 a¹ b¹ c¹ = a-b , = , = -3 - + 3 a² b² a + b c¹ a b For infinite solution = = a¹ a² b¹ b² c¹ c² Hence, = = 3 a − b¹ a + b − 3 − 3 a − b + 3 = 1 a + b − 3 − 3 a − b + 3 = -3 - 3 − 3 a − b + 3 a b² = -3 or = … (i) b b − 3² Now, = 3 + 3 = - 3 a − b¹ a + b ⇒ a b a b² + 4 = 0² + 4 = 0 a b ⇒ a × − 3² 2 = 6 = 3 a ⇒ a hence, = 3 and = a b − 3²"},
+{"id": "P0621", "q": "The value of (x + y)² + (x - y)² is equal to :", "o": ["2(x + y)²", "2(x² + y² )", "(2x + 2y)²", "4xy"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "b", "e": "SSC CGL", "y": "2024", "t": "बीजगणित", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "( x + y )² + ( x − y )² x² + y² + 2 xy + x² + y² − 2 xy 2( ) x² + y²"},
+{"id": "P0622", "q": "If a² + b² = 148 and ab = 54, then find the value of . a + b a − b", "o": ["8", "5⁸ 10² 10⁷ 3"], "ol": ["c", "d"], "a": "a", "e": "SSC CGL", "y": "2024", "t": "बीजगणित", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "+ = 148 a² b² Then + = a b¹48 + 2 ab = = = 16¹48 + 108²56 and - = = a b¹48 − 2 ab 148 − 108 = = 40² 10 now, = = a + b a − b¹6² 10⁸ 10"},
+{"id": "P0623", "q": "If 2a - b = 3 and 8a³ - b³ = 999, then find the value of 4a² - b² ?", "o": ["63", "65", "61", "67 SSC CHSL 2024 Tier - 1"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "a", "e": "SSC CGL", "y": "2024", "t": "बीजगणित", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "2 - = 3 …. (i) a b On cubing both side we get, 8 - - 3² (2 - ) = 27 a³ b³ × ab a b⁸ - - 6³ = 27 a³ b³ ab × 999 - 18 = 27 - 18 = - 972 ab ⇒ ab = 54 ab = 9 × 6 ab ⇒ Take the value of a = 6 and b = 9² - = 3 a b LHS = 2a - b = 2 × 6 - 9 = 3 = RHS 8 - = 999 a³ b³ LHS = 8 - a³ b³ = 8 × 216 - 729 = 999 Value of a and b satisfies the given equation, So, 4 - = 4 × 36 - 81 = 6"},
