+{"id": "P0632", "q": "If a + 2b + 3c = 0, then what is the value of (a³ + 8b³ + 27c³ ) ?", "o": ["18 abc", "12 abc", "0", "6 abc"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "a", "e": "SSC CPO", "y": "2024", "t": "बीजगणित", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "a + 2b + 3c = 0 We know that when x + y + z = 0 then x³ + y³ + z³ = 3 xyz Hence, a³ + 8b³ + 27c³ = 3 × a × 2b × 3c = 18abc"},
