+{"id": "P0638", "q": "What must be added to ( to obtain a x³ − 3 x² + 4 x − 75 ) polynomial that is exactly divisible by (x⁵) ? −", "o": ["5", "6", "4", "2"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "a", "e": "SSC CPO", "y": "2024", "t": "बीजगणित", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "p( ) = ( x x³ − 3 x² + 4 x − 75 ) g( ) = (x⁵) x − Put g( ) = 0 - 5 = 0 = 5 x ⇒ x ⇒ x Put value of in p( ) x x p( ) = ( x⁵ 3 − 3 × 5² + 4 × 5 − 75 ) = (125³ 25 + 20⁷5) − × − = (125⁷5 + 20⁷5) = -5 − − 5 must be added to p( )."},
+{"id": "P0639", "q": "If a + b + c = 13 and ab + bc + ca = 22, then the value of a³ + b³ + c³ - 3abc is ______.", "o": ["1911", "1225", "1625", "1339"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "d", "e": "SSC CPO", "y": "2024", "t": "बीजगणित", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "a³ + b³ + c³ - 3abc = (a + b + c) [(a + b + c)² - 3(ab + bc + ca)] = 13 [(13)² - 3(22)] × = 13 [169 - 66] = 13¹03 = 1339 × ×"},
+{"id": "P0640", "q": "If + 4 ² + 2 + 1 = 0, then find x² y x the value of + 36 x³9 y", "o": ["-1", "-2", "2", "1"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "a", "e": "SSC CPO", "y": "2024", "t": "बीजगणित", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "+ 4 ² + 2 + 1 = 0 x² y x Let, = -1 and = 0 then, x y LHS = + 4 ² + 2x + 1 x² y = (-1)² + 4(0)² + 2(-1) + 1 = 0 = RHS (satisfy) Now, + 36 = (-1)³9 + (0)³6 = -1 x³9 y"},
+{"id": "P0641", "q": "If 2 - 6 - 1 = 0, then find the value x x of 2 + - 8. x¹ x²", "o": ["30", "32", "28", "34"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "a", "e": "SSC CPO", "y": "2024", "t": "बीजगणित", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "2 - 6 - 1 = 0 x x On Dividing by , we get x - 6 - = 0 ⇒ - = 6 x¹ x x¹ x On squaring both side + = 36 + 2 ⇒ + = 38 x² 1 x² x² 1 x² Now, + - 8 = 38 - 8 = 30 x² 1 x²"},
