+{"id": "P0644", "q": "If x³ = 184 + y³ and x = 4 + y, then the value of (x + y) is (given that x > 0 and y > 0): Higher Secondary 21/06/2024 (Shift - 2)", "o": ["-2", "2", "-2", "2¹1¹4¹4¹1"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "b", "e": "SSC", "y": "2024", "t": "बीजगणित", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "Given: = 4 + y x - y = 4 ⇒ x + - 2 y = 16 …………(i) ⇒ x² y² x and 3 = 184 + y³ 3 - y³ = 184 x ⇒ x ( - y) ( + + y) = 184 ⇒ x x² y² x (4)( + + y) = 184 ⇒ x² y² x ( + + y) = 46 …………(ii) ⇒ x² y² x On solving eq ."},
