+{"id": "P0647", "q": "If for a non-zero x, 7² + 5 + 7 = 0, x x then the x³ + is ______ . 1 x³ Higher Secondary 24/06/2024 (Shift - 2)", "o": ["343", "610", "420", "343"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "d", "e": "SSC", "y": "2024", "t": "बीजगणित", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "Given, 7² + 5 + 7 = 0 x x Dividing both sides by , we get x⁷ + 5 + = 0 x + = x⁷ x ⇒ 1 x − 5⁷ Taking cube both sides (x + )³ = ( )³¹ x − 5⁷ + + 3.x."},
