+{"id": "P0649", "q": "If x + y = 10 and xy = 12, find the value of x² − xy + y² Graduate Level 21/06/2024 (Shift - 3)", "o": ["74", "82", "64", "78"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "c", "e": "SSC", "y": "2024", "t": "बीजगणित", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "(x + y = + + 2xy )² x² y² Subtracting both side by 3xy, we get ; (x + y - 3xy = + - xy )² x² y² - 3 × 12 = + - xy 1⁰ 2 x² y² 100 - 36 = + - xy + - xy = 64 x² y² ⇒ x² y²"},
+{"id": "P0650", "q": "If (x - ) = 3, then the value 1 x − 1 of (x - 1)² + is: 1 ( x − 1 )² Graduate Level 24/06/2024 (Shift - 3)", "o": ["3", "5", "6", "4"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "c", "e": "SSC", "y": "2024", "t": "बीजगणित", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "(x - ) = 3¹ x − 1 Subtracting both side by 1, we have ; (x - 1 - ) = 2¹ x − 1 Let , ( - 1) = k k - = 2 x ⇒ 1 k + = + 2 = 6 k² 1 k² 2² So, + = 6 ( x − 1 )²¹ ( x − 1 )²"},
+{"id": "P0651", "q": "If p = 106, q = 105 and r = 104, then value of p² + q² + r² - pq - qr - rp is: Graduate Level 25/06/2024 (Shift - 3)", "o": ["0", "1", "2", "3"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "d", "e": "SSC", "y": "2024", "t": "बीजगणित", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "Formula used : + + - ab - bc - ca a² b² c² = 1² ( a − b )² + ( b − c )² + ( c − a )² [ ] Then, p² + q² + r² - pq - qr - rp = [ (106 - 105)² + (105 - 104)² + (104 - 106)² ]¹² = × 6 = 3¹ 2¹ 2 + 1² + (− 2 )² [ ] ⇒ 1²"},
+{"id": "P0652", "q": "If = 5, then the value 1 + x³ 9 of x is equal to: Graduate Level 26/06/2024 (Shift - 3)", "o": ["9", "8", "6", "4"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "c", "e": "SSC", "y": "2024", "t": "बीजगणित", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "= 5¹ + x³ 9¹ + = 25 = 24 x³ 9 ⇒ x³ 9 = 24 × 9 = 216 x = 6 ⇒ x³ ⇒"},
+{"id": "P0653", "q": "If x + = 15, then the value of 1 x (x² + ) is: 1 x² Graduate Level 26/06/2024 (Shift - 3)", "o": ["225", "223", "17", "13 SSC CHSL 2023 Tier - 2"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "b", "e": "SSC", "y": "2024", "t": "बीजगणित", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "x + = 15¹ x On squaring both side, we get; + + 2 = 225 x² 1 x² + = 225 - 2 = 223 ⇒ x² 1 x²"},
+{"id": "P0654", "q": "If a + b + c = 5 and ab + bc + ca = 7, then the value of a³ + b³ + c³ − 3 abc is:", "o": ["20", "25", "15", "30"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "a", "e": "SSC CPO", "y": "2023", "t": "बीजगणित", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "……..(1) a + b + c = 5 and …………(2) ab + bc + ca = 7 Squaring both side in equation (1) ( a + b + c )² = a² + b² + c² + 2 ( ab + bc + ca )] ⇒ a² + b² + c² = 25 − 14 = 11 Then, a³ + b³ + c³ − 3 abc = ( a + b + c )[ a² + b² + c² − ( ab + bc + ca )] ⇒ a³ + b³ + c³ − 3 abc = 5 ( 11 − 7 ) = 20"},
