+{"id": "P0672", "q": "If x + y = 10, 2xy = 48 and x > y, then find 2x - y.", "o": ["6", "8", "4", "3"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "b", "e": "SSC CPO", "y": "2022", "t": "बीजगणित", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "The best approach to solve his question is the value putting method. By putting x = 6 and y = 4, we get : x + y = 6 + 4 = 10 and 2xy = 2 × 6 × 4 = 48(satisfied) So, 2x – y = 2 × 6 – 4 = 8"},
