+{"id": "P0684", "q": "If 4x⁴ - 37x² + 9 = 0, x > , 3² then what is the value of 8x³ - ? 27 x³ Search on TG: @apna_pdf", "o": ["215", "- 215", "35", "- 35"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "a", "e": "SSC CGL", "y": "2021", "t": "बीजगणित", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "4x⁴ - 37x² + 9 = 0 dividing both side by x² Then 4x² + = 37 subtracting 12 and 9 x² taking root from both side 2x - = 5 taking cube on both side 3 x⁸x³ - = 5³ + 3×5×2×3 = 125 + 90 = 215²7 x³"},
+{"id": "P0685", "q": "If x + = , x > 1, then what is 1 x¹7⁴ the value of x - ? 1 x", "o": ["9", "4", "3", "2"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "d", "e": "SSC CGL", "y": "2021", "t": "बीजगणित", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "x + = 1 x¹7⁴ Squaring both side, + = - 2 x² 1 x² 289¹6 + - 2 = x - = x² 1 x² 225¹6 ⇒ 1 x¹5⁴ Search on TG: @apna_pdf Short-Trick: x + = 1 x¹7⁴ x = 4, satisfy x - = 4 - = 1 x¹ 4¹5⁴"},
+{"id": "P0686", "q": "If x + y + z = 5, , 1 x + 1 y + 1 z , xyz = 12 and x³ + y³ + z³ = 151, then = 0 the value of (x² + y² + z² ) is:", "o": ["24", "23", "22", "21"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "b", "e": "SSC CHSL", "y": "2021", "t": "बीजगणित", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "= 0¹ x + 1 y + 1 z (xy + yz + zx) = 0 ⇒ x³ + y³ + z³ - 3xyz = (x + y+z) [(x² + y² + z² ) - (xy + yz + zx) ]¹51 - 36 = 5 [(x² + y² + z² ) - 0] ⇒ × x² + y² + z² = 23"},
+{"id": "P0687", "q": "If ( , then what is the x y + 1 ) = 4 Search on TG: @apna_pdf value of ( ) ? x² + y² y²", "o": ["12", "22", "14", "10"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "d", "e": "SSC CHSL", "y": "2021", "t": "बीजगणित", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "( + 1) = 4 = 3 x y ⇒ x y Squaring both side , then we get = 9 x² y² Add 1 both side , then we get + 1 = 9 + 1 = 10 ⇒ x² y² ⇒ x² + y² y² Short-trick: Put, x = 3 and y = 1 = = 10 x² + y² y² 9 + 1¹"},
+{"id": "P0688", "q": "Simplify the following expression: (2a - b - 3c)(4a² + b² + 9c² + 2ab + 6ac - 3bc)", "o": ["− 8 a ³ + b ³ + 27 c ³", "8 a ³ + b ³ + 27 c ³", "8 a ³ − b ³ − 27 c ³ − 18 abc", "8a³ - b³ - 27c³ + 18abc"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "c", "e": "SSC CHSL", "y": "2021", "t": "बीजगणित", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "(2a - b - 3c)(4a² + b² + 9c² + 2ab + 6ac - 3bc) (2a - b - 3c){(2a)² + (b)² + (3c)² + 2ab + ⇒ 6ac - 3bc) We know, a³ - b³ - c³ - 3abc = (a - b - c)(a² + b² + c² + ab + ac - bc) On comparing, we get, (2a)³ - (b)³ - (3c)³ - 3(2a)(b)(3c) = 8a³ - b³ - 27c³ - 18abc"},
+{"id": "P0689", "q": "If x + y + z = 19 , x² + y² + and , what z² = 133 xz = y² , x > z > 0 is the value of (x - z) ? Search on TG: @apna_pdf", "o": ["- 2", "0", "- 5", "5"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "d", "e": "SSC CPO", "y": "2020", "t": "बीजगणित", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": ", x + y + z = 19¹33 and x² + y² + z² = xz = y² Using(x + y + z)² = x² + y² + z² + 2xy + 2yz + 2xz And putting the values we get 361 = 133 + 2(xy + yz + xz)²28 = 2(xy + yz + xz) (xy + yz + xz) = 114 ⇒ Now putting and taking out y xz = y² common simultaneously We get y( ) = 114 x + y + z Putting = 19 we get y = 6 x + y + z Now x + z = 13 and x² + z² = 97 Solving thes"},
