+{"id": "P0832", "q": "O is the centre of a circle and A is a point on a major arc BC of the circle. ∠BOC and ∠BAC are the angles made by the minor arc BC on the centre and circumference, respectively. If ∠ABO = 40° and ∠ACO = 30°, then find ∠BOC.", "o": ["130°", "140°", "120°", "150°"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "b", "e": "SSC CHSL", "y": "2023", "t": "ज्यामिति", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "∠ABO + ∠ACO + ∠BAC = ∠BOC 40° + 30° + x° = 2x° x° = 70° ∠BOC (2x°) = 140° ⇒"},
