+{"id": "P0870", "q": "In the given figure, O is the centre of the circle and ∠AOB = 130°. Find ∠APB", "o": ["110°", "115°", "100°", "95°"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "b", "e": "SSC CGL", "y": "2023", "t": "ज्यामिति", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "According to the figure, {angle made by arc at the centre is double to the angle made by same arc at the circumference of the circle} ∠AQB = ∠AOB = 65° 1² Now, ∠AQB + ∠APB = 180° {By the properties of cyclic quadrilateral } Hence , 65 + ∠APB = 180° ∠APB = 115° ⇒"},
