+{"id": "P0895", "q": "In figure, XYZ is a secant and ZT is a tangent to the circle at point T. If TZ = 12 cm and YZ = 8 cm, then find the length of XY.", "o": ["8 cm", "9 cm", "6 cm", "10 cm"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "d", "e": "SSC CGL", "y": "2022", "t": "ज्यामिति", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "Using tangent secant theorem, we have : = 8(8 + x)¹² 2¹44 = 64 + 8x⁸0 = 8x x = 10 cm ⇒ ⇒"},
