+{"id": "P1258", "q": "Two wires of lengths 10 m⁵4 cm and 11 m⁵6 cm are both cut into pieces 31 of length x cm each, where x is an integer. Find the maximum value of x.", "o": ["42", "56", "34", "28"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "c", "e": "SSC MTS", "y": "2022", "t": "HCF-LCM", "d": "आसान", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "wires in cm = 1054cm and 1156cm HCF of 1054 and 1156 = 34 Therefore, maximum value of x = 34"},
