+{"id": "P1319", "q": "An airplane in level flight at an altitude of 3 km from the ground is observed at an angle of elevation of 60°. After 20 seconds, its angle of elevation is observed to be 30°. The speed of the airplane in km/hr is: Higher Secondary 29/08/2025 (Shift - 2)", "o": ["190", "360⁵40³ 3³60³ 3"], "ol": ["b", "d"], "a": "d", "e": "SSC", "y": "2025", "t": "ऊँचाई-दूरी", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "Height ( ) = 3 km 1 unit = km 3 ⇒ 3² unit = 2 km 3 Speed of the airplane in km/hr = × 3600 = 360 km/hr 2³ km 20 ℎr³"},
