+{"id": "P1321", "q": "A hot-air balloon directly above point P is rising vertically at 4 m/s. An observer at point Q, 400 m due east of P, watches the balloon. At the moment when the angle of elevation is 45°, how long until it reaches an angle of elevation of 60°? (Assume no horizontal drift.) Graduate Level 25/07/2025 (Shift - 3)", "o": ["73.2 s", "25.8 s", "55.2 s", "78.5 s"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "a", "e": "SSC", "y": "2025", "t": "ऊँचाई-दूरी", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "In APQ, ∆ tan 45° = 1 = ⇒ AP 400 ⇒ AP 400 AP = 400 m ⇒ In BPQ, ∆ tan 60° = = ⇒ PB 400 ⇒ 3 AB + AP 400⁴00 =400 + AB ⇒ 3 AB = 400 - 400 = 400( - 1) ⇒ 3³ = 400(1.732 - 1) = 292.8 m So, Required time = = 73.2 seconds 292 ."},
+{"id": "P1322", "q": "From the summit of a²00 m high cliff, the angles of depression to two boats situated on the same side of the cliff are measured at 45° and 60° respectively. The boats are moving towards the cliff in a straight line. After 10 minutes, the angle of depression to the first boat becomes 60°, while the angle to the second boat becomes 75°. If both boats move at constant but different speeds, determine the initial distance between the two boats. Graduate Level 25/07/2025 (Shift - 3)", "o": ["200( ) m", "200( ) m³ − 1³ 3 + 1³", "100( ) m", "100( ) m³ − 1³ 3 + 1³"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "a", "e": "SSC", "y": "2025", "t": "ऊँचाई-दूरी", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "In ABD, ∆ tan 45° = ⇒ 200 BD 1 = BD = 200 m ⇒ 200 BD ⇒ In ABC, ∆ tan 60° = ⇒ 200 BC = BC = ⇒ 3²00 BC ⇒ 200³ Now, Distance between two boats (CD) = BD - BC CD = 200 - = 200( ) m ⇒ 200³ 3 − 1³"},
+{"id": "P1323", "q": "From the top of a¹80 m high cliff, an observer notices a car moving away from the base of the cliff. The angle of depression of the car changes from 60° to 45° in 15 seconds. What is the approximate speed of the car ? Graduate Level 29/07/2025 (Shift - 3)", "o": ["6.03 m/s", "7.08 m/s", "5.07 m/s", "8.05 m/s"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "c", "e": "SSC", "y": "2025", "t": "ऊँचाई-दूरी", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "tan60° = ⇒ d¹ = = 103.92¹80 d¹ 180³ tan 45° = ⇒ d² = 180 m¹80 d² d² - d¹ = 180 - 103.92 = 76.08 Speed = = 5.072m/s⁷6 ."},
+{"id": "P1324", "q": "A man on a lighthouse that stands 60 meters tall is observing a boat 3 moving away from it. Over the course of 15 seconds, the angle of depression to the boat shifts from 60° to 30°. What is speed of the boat? Graduate Level 02/08/2025 (Shift - 3)", "o": ["5 m/s", "8 m/s", "6 m/s", "7 m/s"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "b", "e": "SSC", "y": "2025", "t": "ऊँचाई-दूरी", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "Now , A/Q unit = 60³ 3² unit = = 120 m⁶0³ × 2³ Speed = = = 8 m/s Distance Time 120¹5"},
