+{"id": "P1363", "q": "A swimming pool is 40 m in length, 30 m in breadth and 2.2 m in depth. The cost of cementing its floor and the four sides at Rs. 25/ is: m²", "o": ["Rs.43,980", "Rs.37540", "Rs.34260", "Rs.37700"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "d", "e": "SSC CPO", "y": "2019", "t": "क्षेत्रमिति", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "Total area to be painted = 40 × 30 + 2(40².2 + 30².2) = 1508 × × Total cost = 1508²5 = 37700 ×"},
