+{"id": "P1365", "q": "The liquid in a container is suﬃcient to paint an area of 11.28 . m² How many boxes of dimension 30cm × 25cm 12cm can be painted with the × liquid in this container.", "o": ["40", "24", "32", "12"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "a", "e": "SSC CPO", "y": "2019", "t": "क्षेत्रमिति", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "No. of boxes that can be painted = = 11 . 28 × 10000² × ( 30 × 25 + 25 × 12 + 12 × 30 )⁴0"},
+{"id": "P1366", "q": "If the area of a regular hexagon is 108 , its perimeter (in cm) is: 3 cm 2", "o": ["36", "42", "28", "24² 3³"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "a", "e": "SSC CPO", "y": "2019", "t": "क्षेत्रमिति", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "ATQ, 3³ 2 × a² = 108³ ⇒ a = 6² ∴ Perimeter = 6 × = 36 cm 6² 2"},
+{"id": "P1367", "q": "A square piece of cardboard with side 12 cm has a small square of 2 cm cut out from each of the corners. The resulting flaps are turned up to make a box 2 cm deep. The volume (in ) of cm 3 the box is:", "o": ["128", "94", "102", "11"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "a", "e": "SSC CPO", "y": "2019", "t": "क्षेत्रमिति 3D", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "Volume = (12 - 4) × (12- 4) × 2 = 8 × 8 × 2 = 128 cu.cm"},
+{"id": "P1368", "q": "The area (in )of a right angled cm 2 triangle having base 24 cm and hypotenuse 25 cm is :", "o": ["72", "108", "92", "84"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "d", "e": "SSC CPO", "y": "2019", "t": "क्षेत्रमिति", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "Given, in a right angle triangle Hypotenuse = 25, Base = 24 Then, Height = 7 ∴ Area = cm 2¹ 2 × 24 × 7 = 84"},
