+{"id": "P1371", "q": "The dimensions of a swimming pool are 66m . How many × 35 m × 3 m hours will it take to fill the pool by a pipe of diameter 35 cm with water flowing at speed 8 m/s ?", "o": ["2.75 h", "3.5 h", "2.5 h", "3.2 h"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "c", "e": "SSC CPO", "y": "2019", "t": "क्षेत्रमिति", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "Required time = 66 × 35 × 3²2⁷ × 35²00 × 35²00 × 8 = 9000 sec = 2.5 h"},
+{"id": "P1372", "q": "The area of each square of a chessboard having 64 squares is 4 . cm 2 If there is a border on all the sides of the chessboard of 2 cm, then the perimeter of the chessboard is:", "o": ["128cm", "80cm", "70cm", "256cm"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "b", "e": "SSC CPO", "y": "2019", "t": "क्षेत्रमिति", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "Since the chessboard is composed of 64 squares of side 2cm and the border is of thickness 2 cm. Therefore, the length of each side of chessboard = 2 × 8 + 4 = 20 So, the perimeter = 4 × 20 = 80 cm 153"},
+{"id": "P1373", "q": "The ratio of the length, width and height of a closed cuboid is given as 6 : 3 : 2. The total surface area of this cuboid is given as 1800 cm 2 . Find the volume (in cm 3 ) of this cuboid.", "o": ["4650", "4800", "4500", "4200"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "c", "e": "SSC CGL", "y": "2023", "t": "क्षेत्रमिति 3D", "d": "कठिन", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "Let the length = 6x, width = 3x ,height =2x ATQ, 2(LB + BH + HL) = 1800²(6x × 3x + 3x × 2x + 2x × 6x) = 1800²×36 = 1800 = 25 x = 5 x² ⇒ x² ⇒ Now, volume of cuboid = L × B × H = 6x × = 3x × 2x = 36 = 36 × = 4500 x³ 5³"},
