+{"id": "P1413", "q": "Melting a hemisphere of radius 7 cm, four small identical spheres are made. What is the radius of these spheres ? 127 Higher Secondary 27/06/2023 (Shift - 3)", "o": ["3 cm", "3.5 cm", "4 cm", "4.5 cm"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "b", "e": "SSC", "y": "2023", "t": "क्षेत्रमिति 3D", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "Volume of hemisphere = 2³ π r³ Let the radius of the hemisphere be R and radius of sphere be r. According to question, = 4 ⇒ = 4² 3 π R³ 4³ π r³ 7 × 7 × 7² r³ = r³ 7 × 7 × 7⁸ r (radius of sphere) = 3.5 cm 160"},
