+{"id": "P1415", "q": "The area of the triangle whose sides are 3 cm, 5 cm, and 6 cm is: Higher Secondary 30/06/2023 (Shift - 2)", "o": ["2¹4 cm 2¹4 cm 2", "4", "3¹4 cm 2¹4 cm 2"], "ol": ["b", "c", "d"], "a": "b", "e": "SSC", "y": "2023", "t": "क्षेत्रमिति", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "S = a + b + c² Area of triangle = S ( S − a )( S − b )( S − c ) According to question, S = = 7³ + 5 + 6² Area of triangle = 7 ( 7 − 3 )( 7 − 5 )( 7 − 6 ) = = = 2⁷× 4 × 2 × 1⁵6¹4 cm 2"},
+{"id": "P1416", "q": "The diagonal (in cm) of a cuboid with dimensions 9cm 12cm 20cm is: × × Higher Secondary 30/06/2023 (Shift - 2)", "o": ["9", "12", "25", "20"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "c", "e": "SSC", "y": "2023", "t": "क्षेत्रमिति 3D", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "Diagonal of Cuboid = l² + b² + ℎ 2 According to question, Diagonal of Cuboid = 9² + 12² + 20² = = 25 cm 625"},
