+{"id": "P1428", "q": "Length of a rectangle is 58 meters, while its breadth is 30 meters. What is the total cost of covering it with grass bed if cost is Rs. 20 per m² ?", "o": ["Rs. 34800", "Rs. 32400", "Rs. 28500", "Rs. 17400"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "a", "e": "SSC MTS", "y": "2023", "t": "क्षेत्रमिति", "d": "आसान", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "Area of rectangle = 58 × 30 = 1740 m² Required cost = 1740 × 20 = ₹34800"},
