+{"id": "P1497", "q": "The area of a triangle is 96 cm 2 and the length of one of its sides is 24 cm. What is the length of the perpendicular drawn to this side of the triangle from the opposite vertex?", "o": ["16 cm", "8 cm", "4 cm", "12 cm"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "b", "e": "SSC CHSL", "y": "2022", "t": "क्षेत्रमिति", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "Let the base of the triangle = 24cm Area of = × 24 × height ∆ 1² 96 = 12 × height H = = 8 cm ⇒ 96¹2"},
+{"id": "P1498", "q": "Find the volume(in ) of the cm 3 cuboid, if its length is twice more than its breadth and its breadth is 8 cm, which is twice its height.", "o": ["768", "769", "767", "766"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "a", "e": "SSC CHSL", "y": "2022", "t": "क्षेत्रमिति 3D", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "According to the question, Length = Breadth + 2(Breadth) = 8 + 2(8) = 8 + 16 = 24 cm Breadth = 2(Height)⁸ = 2(Height), Height = 4 cm Volume of cuboid = Length Breadth × × Height = 24⁸ 4 = 768 × × c m³"},
+{"id": "P1499", "q": "If the volume of a cube is 64 , cm 3 then find its total surface area . ( cm 2 )", "o": ["96", "82", "88", "64"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "a", "e": "SSC CHSL", "y": "2022", "t": "क्षेत्रमिति 3D", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "Volume of a cube = a³ 64 = a = 4 cm a³ ⇒ T.S.A of cube = 6 × 4 × 4 = 96 c m²"},
