+{"id": "P1669", "q": "The length of a side of an equilateral triangle is 18 cm. The area (in cm 2 ) of the region lying between the circumcircle and the incircle of the triangle is [ use = ] π 22⁷", "o": ["254", "254³ 7¹ 7", "254", "254² 7⁴ 7"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "d", "e": "SSC CPO", "y": "2024", "t": "क्षेत्रमिति", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "Area of equilateral triangle = 3⁴ × a² = 18¹8 = 3⁴ × × 81³ c m² Relation between area of circumcircle, equilateral triangle and incircle Circumcircle : equilateral triangle : incircle = 4 : : π 3³ π Area of circumcircle - area of incircle = - = 3 unit = 4 π π π ⇒ 3³ 81³ c m² 1 unit = 27 c m² 3 unit = 3 = 254 π 27¹ × × 22⁷ 4⁷ c m²"},
