+{"id": "P1698", "q": "If the radius of the right circular cone is increased by 20% and its height is decreased by 25%, then the volume of the right circular cone will be increased by: Graduate Level 26/06/2024 (Shift - 4)", "o": ["15%", "12%", "10%", "8%"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "d", "e": "SSC", "y": "2024", "t": "क्षेत्रमिति 3D", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "Volume of cone = h¹ 3 π r² Volume of cone h ∝ r² (As is constant)¹³ π According to the question, Volume of cone = × Height Radiu s² Original 100 = × 4 → 5² New 108 = × 3 → 6² % Change in volume = × 100 = 8% 108 − 100¹00"},
+{"id": "P1699", "q": "Half the perimeter of a rectangular garden, whose length is 8 cm more than its width, is 42 cm. Find the area of the rectangular garden. Graduate Level 26/06/2024 (Shift - 4)", "o": ["524 cm 2", "425 cm 2", "254 cm 2", "542 cm 2"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "b", "e": "SSC", "y": "2024", "t": "क्षेत्रमिति", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "Let the width of rectangular garden be x Then, length = ( + 8) cm x Perimeter of garden = 42 × 2 = 84 cm 2( + + 8) = 84 x x²(2 + 8) = 84² + 8 = 42 x ⇒ x + 4 = 21 = 17 x ⇒ x So, the area of rectangular garden = 17 × 25 = 425 c m²"},
+{"id": "P1700", "q": "The volume of a cube is 64 cm 3 . The total surface area of the cube is: Graduate Level 26/06/2024 (Shift - 4)", "o": ["16 cm 2", "64 cm 2", "96 cm 2", "128 cm 2 SSC CHSL 2023 Tier - 2"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "c", "e": "SSC", "y": "2024", "t": "क्षेत्रमिति 3D", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "Volume of cube = 64 c m³ = 64 a = 4 a³ ⇒ TSA of cube = 6 = 6 × = 96 a² 4² c m²"},
