+{"id": "P1702", "q": "Aman wants to get his spherical overhead water tank having a diameter of 7 m, painted. If the cost of painting is ₹13 per square metre, find the cost of painting Aman’s spherical overhead water tank. (Use ) π = 22⁷", "o": ["₹1,872", "₹1,984", "₹2,002", "₹1,926"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "c", "e": "SSC CHSL", "y": "2023", "t": "क्षेत्रमिति", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "Surface area of spherical water tank = 4 π r² = 4 × × 3.5 × 3.5 ⇒ 88 ×.5 × 3.5²2⁷ = 44 × 3.5 = 154 m² Required cost = 154 × 13 = 2002 Rs."},
