+{"id": "P1705", "q": "In the following figure, the length of arc AB is equal to five times of the radius r of the circle. Find the area of Search on TG: @apna_pdf sector AOB ?", "o": ["2.5", "3", "2 r² 1² r² r² r²"], "ol": ["a", "c", "d"], "a": "a", "e": "SSC CGL", "y": "2023", "t": "क्षेत्रमिति", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "l = r θ 5r = r = 5 c = 5 × θ ⇒ θ 180° π Area of sector AOB = × θ 360° π r² = × × = 2.5⁵ × 180° 360° × π π r² r²"},
+{"id": "P1706", "q": "The difference between the length and breadth of a rectangle is 40 metres. If its perimeter is 96 metres, then what will be the area of rectangle? Search on TG: @apna_pdf", "o": ["254 metre²", "110 metre²", "176 metre²", "152 metre²"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "c", "e": "SSC MTS", "y": "2023", "t": "क्षेत्रमिति", "d": "आसान", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "According to the question, = 40 l − b Now, perimeter of rectangle = 96² ( l + b ) + = 48 l b Then = 44 and = 4 l b Area of rectangle = 44⁴ = 176 × m²"},
+{"id": "P1707", "q": "If the square of product of three sides of the triangle is 1024 units and the area of its circumcircle is 16π, what is Search on TG: @apna_pdf the area of the given triangle ?", "o": ["2 sq . units", "3 sq . units", "2.5 sq . units", "4 sq . units"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "a", "e": "SSC CHSL", "y": "2023", "t": "क्षेत्रमिति", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "= 1024 units a × b × c ( )² a × b × c = 32 Area of its circumcircle = 16π πR² = 16π R = 4 ⇒ circumradius(R) = abc 4 × area of ∆ 4 = 32⁴ × area of ∆ Area of given triangle = 2 sq ."},
