+{"id": "P1743", "q": "A cylinder and hemisphere have the same radius. Their combined height is 35 cm. If the cylinder and hemisphere have equal volumes, find the radius.", "o": ["14 cm", "13 cm", "10 cm", "21 cm"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "d", "e": "SSC CGL", "y": "2025", "t": "क्षेत्रमिति 3D", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "Let the common radius= r cm and cylinder height = (35 - r)cm A/Q, ⇒ r² h = r³ π 2³ π ⇒ h = r (35 - r) = r² 3 ⇒ 2³ ⇒ 35 = r ⇒ r = 21cm 5³"},
+{"id": "P1744", "q": "The cost of building a wall around a circular field at the rate of ₹120 per metre is ₹3,768. Find the diameter of the field.", "o": ["5 m", "10 m", "15 m", "20 m"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "b", "e": "SSC CGL", "y": "2025", "t": "क्षेत्रमिति", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "perimeter of circle (2 r) = π 3768¹20 = 31.4² × 22 × r⁷ Radius = = 5³1 . 4⁶ . 28 Diameter = 2r = 10 m"},
