+{"id": "P1746", "q": "The volume of a hemisphere is numerically equal to five times its curved surface area. Find its radius.", "o": ["13 cm", "15 cm", "20 cm", "11 cm"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "b", "e": "SSC CGL", "y": "2025", "t": "क्षेत्रमिति 3D", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "According to question = 5 × 2 r = 15 cm ⇒ 2³ π r³ π r² ⇒"},
+{"id": "P1747", "q": "A sector of a circle has a central angle of 90° and a radius of 10 cm. Another sector of the same circle has a central angle of radians. What is the π 2 ratio of the area of the first sector to the area of the second sector ?", "o": ["2 : 3", "1 : 2", "1 : 1", "1 : 3"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "c", "e": "SSC CGL", "y": "2025", "t": "क्षेत्रमिति", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "area of sector area of sector in radian = = 1⁴ π r² 1² r² × π 2¹ 1 Ratio 1 : 1 →"},
+{"id": "P1748", "q": "A hollow hemisphere has uniform thickness. Its inner radius is r, and outer radius is R. If R = 4r, find the ratio of outer to inner curved surface areas.", "o": ["16 : 1", "8 : 5", "6 : 5", "2 : 5"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "a", "e": "SSC CGL", "y": "2025", "t": "क्षेत्रमिति 3D", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "CSA of hemisphere = 2 r² π Outer curved surface area of hemisphere = 2 R² = 2 (4r)² π π Outer curved surface area of hemisphere = 32 r² π Inner curved surface area = 2 r² π Ratio of outer to inner surface area = 32 r² : 2 r² = 16 : 1 π π"},
+{"id": "P1749", "q": "A square pyramid has its lateral surface area equal to twice the area of its base. If the side of the base is 8 cm, find its slant height.", "o": ["8 cm", "9 cm", "5 cm", "2 cm"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "a", "e": "SSC CGL", "y": "2025", "t": "क्षेत्रमिति", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "LSA = 2 × Base area Base area = (8)² = 64cm 2 LSA = 2 × 64 = 128cm 2 LSA of square pyramid = 2a l²a = 128 = = 8 cm l ⇒ l¹28²×8"},
