+{"id": "P1900", "q": "The length of a side of an equilateral triangle is 18 cm. The area (in cm 2 ) of the region lying between the TG: @ikunal_x circumcircle and the incircle of the triangle is [ use = ] π 22⁷", "o": ["254", "254³ 7¹ 7", "254", "254² 7⁴ 7"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "d", "e": "SSC", "y": "2025", "t": "क्षेत्रमिति", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "Area of equilateral triangle = 3⁴ × a² = 18¹8 = 3⁴ × × 81³ c m² Relation between area of circumcircle, equilateral triangle and incircle Circumcircle : equilateral triangle : incircle = 4 : : π 3³ π Area of circumcircle - area of incircle = - = 3 unit = 4 π π π ⇒ 3³ 81³ c m² 1 unit = 27 c m² 3 unit = 3 = 254 π 27¹ × × 22⁷ 4⁷ c m²"},
+{"id": "P1901", "q": "If the cylinder height is 9 cm and the base area is 25 cm², then find the π total surface area.", "o": ["240 cm 2", "140 cm 2", "440 cm 2", "340 cm 2"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "c", "e": "SSC", "y": "2025", "t": "क्षेत्रमिति 3D", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "Given, Height of cylinder = 9 cm the base area = 25 cm² π = 25 cm² r = 5 cm ⇒ π r² π ⇒ Now, Total Surface Area = 2 rh + 2 π π r² TSA of cylinder = 2⁵ 9 + 2²5 × 22⁷ × × × 22⁷ × = 2⁵ (9 + 5) × 22⁷ × = 2⁵ 14 = 440 cm² × 22⁷ × ×"},
+{"id": "P1902", "q": "There is a large cone with a diameter of 14 m and height of 12 m. It is being filled with water at a rate of 2 m³ in every 20 seconds. How long will it take to fill the cone?", "o": ["313 sec", "6160 sec", "616 sec", "12320 sec"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "b", "e": "SSC", "y": "2025", "t": "क्षेत्रमिति 3D", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "Radius of cone = = 7 m¹4² Volume of cone = × × × 12 = 616¹ 3²2⁷ 7² m³ Required time taken to fill the cone = × 20 = 6160 sec 616²"},
+{"id": "P1903", "q": "The dimensions of a rectangular field when extended by 6 metres are in the ratio of 4 : 3 and when decreased by 6 metres are in the ratio of 2 : 1. Find the dimensions of the field.", "o": ["16 metres, 12 metres", "10 metres, 6 metres", "18 metres, 12 metres", "14 metres, 10 metres"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "c", "e": "SSC", "y": "2025", "t": "क्षेत्रमिति", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "Let length of rectangle = meter l Breadth of rectangle = meter b According to question, = 3 - 4 = 6 ------------- (i) l + 6 b + 6⁴ 3 ⇒ l b And = - 2 = -6 ------------ (ii) l − 6 b − 6² 1 ⇒ l b On solving equations (i) and (ii) we get, = 18 meter , = 12 meter l b"},
