+{"id": "P1926", "q": "A juice vendor mixes water with pure mango juice. If he sells the mixture at the cost price of pure mango juice and makes a profit of 20%, what is the ratio of water to pure mango juice in the mixture, respectively ?", "o": ["3 : 2", "1 : 5", "2 : 3", "5 : 1"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "b", "e": "SSC CGL", "y": "2025", "t": "मिश्रण", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "Profit % = × 100 Quantity of Water Quantity of Pure Mango Juice 20 = × 100 Water Mango Juice = = or 1 : 5 Water Mango Juice 20¹00¹ 5"},
+{"id": "P1927", "q": "A⁷0 litre mixture contains milk and water in the ratio 4 : 3. If 7 litres of this mixture is removed and 10 litres of pure milk is added in its place, what will be the TG: @ikunal_x new ratio of milk and water in the mixture?", "o": ["23 : 18", "46 : 27", "46 : 21", "43 : 27"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "b", "e": "SSC CGL", "y": "2025", "t": "मिश्रण", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "Ratio of milk(M) to water(W) = 4 : 3 Total mixture = 70 liters → 7 unit Hence, new ratio of milk and water = 46 : 27"},
+{"id": "P1928", "q": "A³0-litres solution of alcohol and water has 20% water. How many litres of alcohol must be added to the solution to make the water content 15% ?", "o": ["10 litres", "20 litres", "30 litres", "40 litres"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "a", "e": "SSC CGL", "y": "2025", "t": "मिश्रण", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "Ratio Alcohol : Water → Initial 80 : 20 → (4 : 1 )× 3¹2 : 3 Final 85 : 15 → 17 : 3 A/Q , (12 + 3) unit = 30 liters (17 - 12) unit = × 5 = 10 liters 30¹5"},
+{"id": "P1929", "q": "Two containers of the same volume are 30% and 50% full of milk, respectively. They are then filled completely with water. If the contents of both containers are mixed in a larger vessel, what is the percentage of water in the final mixture ?", "o": ["45%", "50%", "55%", "60%"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "d", "e": "SSC CGL", "y": "2025", "t": "मिश्रण", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "first containers : second container Milk 30⁵0 → water 70⁵0 → ________________________________________ Total volume of both container = 200 unit Total water in both container = 120 unit Water percentage of final mixture = × 100 = 60% 120²00"},
+{"id": "P1930", "q": "A cistern contains 200 liters of pure syrup. 10 liters of syrup are drawn out and replaced by water. Then, 10 liters of the mixture are drawn out and replaced by water again. What is the ratio of water to syrup in the final mixture ?", "o": ["19 : 1", "19 : 14", "19 : 81", "18 : 19"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "c", "e": "SSC CGL", "y": "2025", "t": "मिश्रण", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "Final quantity of syrup = 200(1 - )²¹ 10 = 200 × = 162L⁸1¹00 Quantity of water = 200 - 162 = 38L Ratio of Water to Syrup = 38L : 162L = 19 : 81"},
+{"id": "P1931", "q": "Two distinct varieties of wheat, valued at ₹80 per kilogram and ₹120 per kilogram respectively, are combined in an unknown ratio. The resulting mixture is sold at ₹130 per kilogram, yielding a profit of 25% on the aggregate cost price. Determine the ratio in which the two wheat varieties were blended.", "o": ["1 : 3", "3 : 4", "2 : 3", "4 : 1"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "c", "e": "SSC CGL", "y": "2025", "t": "मिश्रण", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "Cost price of mixture = 130 × 100¹25 = ₹104 per kg. Ratio = 2 : 3"},
+{"id": "P1932", "q": "A¹20 - litre mixture contains milk and water in the ratio 5 : 3. If 'x' litres of milk and 'x' litres of water are added to the mixture, the new ratio of milk to water becomes 3 : 2. What is the value of 'x' ?", "o": ["12.33 litres", "11.54 litres", "15 litres", "30 litres"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "c", "e": "SSC CGL", "y": "2025", "t": "मिश्रण", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "Initial milk = 120 = 75 litres. × 5⁸ Initial water = 120 = 45 litres. × 3⁸ According to the question, = x = 15 litres 75 + x⁴5 + x³ 2 ⇒"},
+{"id": "P1933", "q": "Two containers of equal capacity filled with juice and water. The first contains juice and water in the ratio 2 : 3, and the second in the ratio 3 : 2. The mixtures are then combined. What is the ratio of juice to water in the resulting mixture ?", "o": ["1 : 1", "3 : 4", "4 : 3", "5 : 4"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "a", "e": "SSC CGL", "y": "2025", "t": "मिश्रण", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "Ratio → Juice : Water 2 : 3³ : 2 ---------------------------- On mixing → 5 : 5 or 1 : 1"},
+{"id": "P1934", "q": "In a⁶0-liter mixture of apple juice and water, the amount of water is 20 liters. How many liters of water should be added to make the ratio of juice to water 2 : 3 ?", "o": ["50 L", "30 L", "40 L", "80 L"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "c", "e": "SSC CGL", "y": "2025", "t": "मिश्रण", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "Total mixture = 60 ltr Juice : Water = 40 : 20 = = ⇒ Juice Water 2³ ⇒ 40²0 + x² 3¹20 = 40 + 2x = 2x = 80 = x = 40 ⇒"},
