+{"id": "P1982", "q": "Mohan divides 18935 by a certain number. If the quotient and the remainder he gets are 102 and 65, respectively, then the divisor is: Higher Secondary 27/06/2023 (Shift - 3)", "o": ["155", "165", "175", "185"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "d", "e": "SSC", "y": "2023", "t": "शेषफल", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "Dividend = Divisor × Quotient + Remainder According to question, Divisor = = 185¹8935 − 65¹02"},
+{"id": "P1983", "q": "Find the least value of ‘@’ to make the number7@5471perfectly divisible by 9. Higher Secondary 28/06/2023 (Shift - 2)", "o": ["6", "1", "3", "4"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "c", "e": "SSC", "y": "2023", "t": "संख्या पद्धति", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "Sum of digits of the given number must be divisible by 9. 7 + @ + 5 + 4 + 7 + 1 = 24 + @ Possible least values of @ = 3"},
+{"id": "P1984", "q": "What is the least value of * so that the number 457643*4 is divisible by 18 ? Higher Secondary 28/06/2023 (Shift - 2)", "o": ["9", "3", "4", "5"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "b", "e": "SSC", "y": "2023", "t": "संख्या पद्धति", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "co-prime factor of 18 = 9 and 2 , Given no. must be divisible by both 9 and 2⁴ + 5 + 7 + 6 + 4 + 3 + * + 4 = 33 + * Possible values of * = 3"},
+{"id": "P1985", "q": "Which of the following numbers will completely divide ( ) ? 6⁶1 + 6⁶2 + 6⁶3 + 6⁶4 Higher Secondary 30/06/2023 (Shift - 2)", "o": ["10", "13", "7", "11"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "c", "e": "SSC", "y": "2023", "t": "संख्या पद्धति", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "( 6⁶1 + 6⁶2 + 6⁶3 + 6⁶4 ) = (1 + 6 + )⁶⁶1⁶ 2 + 6³ = (1 + 6 + 36 + 216) = (259)⁶⁶1⁶ 61 Here, by checking all the options, 259 is divisible by 7."},
+{"id": "P1986", "q": "Which of the following is perfectly divisible by 11 ? Higher Secondary 30/06/2023 (Shift - 2)", "o": ["57464054", "57464044", "57463822", "57463823"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "b", "e": "SSC", "y": "2023", "t": "संख्या पद्धति", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "Divisibility of 11 : the given number is divisible by 11 only when the difference of sum of odd place digits and sum of even place digits is 0 or 11."},
+{"id": "P1987", "q": "Which of the following numbers is NOT divisible by 72 ? Matriculation Level 27/06/2023 (Shift - 1)", "o": ["359784", "426816", "486280", "754344"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "c", "e": "SSC", "y": "2023", "t": "संख्या पद्धति", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "Co-prime factor of 72 = 8 and 9 Clearly , 486280 is not divisible by 9 , Hence 486280 is also not divisible by 72."},
+{"id": "P1988", "q": "The sum of two numbers 10373 + 24871 is divisible by : Matriculation Level 27/06/2023 (Shift - 1)", "o": ["7", "8", "6", "13"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "c", "e": "SSC", "y": "2023", "t": "संख्या पद्धति", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "10373 + 24871 = 35244 Clearly , it is divisible by 6."},
