+{"id": "P2255", "q": "P, Q, and R invested in a business in the ratio 4 : 3 : 5. After a year, the total profit is Rs.6,00,000. What is Q's share?", "o": ["Rs. 150,000", "Rs. 250,000", "Rs. 200,000", "Rs. 400,000"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "a", "e": "SSC CGL", "y": "2025", "t": "साझेदारी", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "According to question, 4 + 3 + 5 = 600000 x x x¹2 = 600000 = Rs. 50000 ⇒ x ⇒ x Share of Q = 50000 × 3 = Rs.150000"},
