+{"id": "P2257", "q": "If the ratio of capital of A and B is 4 : 2 and the time for which they invested is in the ratio 2 : 4, then the profit ratio is:", "o": ["1 : 1", "4 : 1", "5 : 2", "3 : 1"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "a", "e": "SSC CGL", "y": "2025", "t": "साझेदारी", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "Profit of A = Invest. × time = 4 × 2 = 8 Profit of B = Invest. × time 2 × 4 = 8 profit ratio of A and B = 8 : 8 = 1 : 1"},
