+{"id": "P2281", "q": "Three partners decided to start a business. They decided to donate 10% of the profit to a charity organisation and then the remaining profit would be shared among first, second and third partner in the ratio 1 : 2 : 2. The total profit received was ₹1,80,000. Find the share of the first partner.", "o": ["₹32,400", "₹31,800", "₹33,200", "₹29,600"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "a", "e": "SSC", "y": "2025", "t": "साझेदारी", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "Total profit distributed among partners in business = 1,80,000 × 90% = ₹1,62,000 Share of the 1st partner = ( ) × 1,62,000¹ 1 + 2 + 2 = = ₹32,400¹ , 62 , 000⁵"},
