+{"id": "P2283", "q": "A starts a business with ₹45,000 and was joined afterwards by B with ₹30,000. When did B join if the profit at the end of the year was divided in the ratio 2 : 1 ?", "o": ["After 6 months", "After 12 months", "After 3 months", "After 9 months"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "c", "e": "SSC", "y": "2025", "t": "साझेदारी", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "Ratio A : B → Investment 3 : 2 → Time 12 : → x ---------------------------------------------- Profit 2 : 1 → (time for which B invested ) x = = 9 month 12 × 3² × 2 Required time after which B invested = 12⁹ = 3 months −"},
+{"id": "P2284", "q": "The concentration of three wines A, B and C are 10%, 20% and 30%, respectively. They are mixed in the ratio 2 : 3 : x resulting in a²3% concentration solution. Find the value of x.", "o": ["6", "8", "5"], "ol": ["b", "c", "d"], "a": "d", "e": "SSC CHSL", "y": "2023", "t": "अनुपात", "d": "कठिन", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "Ratio of their concentration = 10 : 20 : 30 Ratio of their quantity = 2 : 3 : x ∴ Concentration of mixed solution = = 23¹0×2 + 20×3 + 30× x⁵ + x²0+60+30 = 115+23 x x⁷ = 35, = 5 x x"},
+{"id": "P2285", "q": "Find the fourth proportional to ( a + b )² × ( a³ − b³ ), ( a³ + b³ ), ( a² − b² ).", "o": ["( a² − ab + b² ) ( a + b ) ( a² + ab + b² ) ( a − b )", "( a² − ab + b² ) ( a² + ab + b² ) ( a² + ab + b² ) ( a² − b² )"], "ol": ["b", "d"], "a": "c", "e": "SSC MTS", "y": "2023", "t": "अनुपात", "d": "आसान", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "Fourth proportional = ( a³ + b³ ) × ( a² − b² ) ( a + b )² × ( a³ − b³ ) = ( a + b ) ( a² − ab + b² ) × ( a + b ) ( a − b ) ( a + b )² ( a − b ) ( a² + ab + b² ) = ( a² − ab + b² ) ( a² + ab + b² )"},
+{"id": "P2286", "q": "The mean proportional of (a + b) , (a - b) is: ( a − b )³ ( a + b )³", "o": ["(a b) ( a + b )² ( a − b )² ( a + b )² −", "(a + b)", "( a − b )² a² − b²"], "ol": ["b", "c", "d"], "a": "a", "e": "SSC CGL", "y": "2023", "t": "अनुपात", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "Mean proportional = ( a + b ) a − b ( )³ × ( a − b ) a + b ( )³ = a − b ( )⁴ × a + b ( )⁴ = a − b ( )² × a + b ( )²"},
