+{"id": "P2289", "q": "The ratio between the divisor and remainder is 3 : 2 and the ratio between the divisor and the quotient is 7 : 12. If the remainder is 14, then find the remainder when the dividend is divided by 9.", "o": ["3", "6", "4", "5"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "d", "e": "SSC MTS", "y": "2019", "t": "अनुपात", "d": "आसान", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "Ratio Divisor : Quotient : Remainder → 7 : 12³ : 2 ------------------------------------------ 21 : 36 : 14 According to the question 14 unit = 14 ⇒ 1 unit = 1²1 unit (Divisor) = 21 Required remainder = 21 × 36 + 14⁹ = 5 (Rem.)"},
