+{"id": "P2301", "q": "The ratio between the monthly income and the expenditure of Vaidic is 8: 5. If his income increases by 20% and his expenditure increases by 30%, then find the percentage increase or decrease in his monthly savings.", "o": ["5 % increase", "5 % decrease 2³ 2³", "3 % increase", "3 % decrease 1³ 1³"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "c", "e": "SSC CGL", "y": "2023", "t": "अनुपात", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "Ratio - Income = expenditure + savings Initial - 80 = 50 + 30 Final - 96 = 65 + 31 Change % in savings = 1³0 × 100 = 3 % increased 1³"},
