+{"id": "P2433", "q": "Given that W : X = 3 : 5, X : Y = 5 : 7, and Y : Z = 7 : 9, find the compound ratio W : X : Y : Z.", "o": ["20 : 24 : 56 : 63", "3 : 5 : 7 : 9", "5 : 6 : 14 : 9", "20 : 24 : 42 : 63"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "b", "e": "SSC CGL", "y": "2025", "t": "अनुपात", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "Ratio W : X : Y : Z → 3 : 5 : 5 : 5⁵ : 5 : 7 : 7⁷ : 7 : 7 : 9 _____________________________ 105 : 175 : 245 : 315 or 3 : 5 :7 : 9"},
+{"id": "P2434", "q": "If 40% of (P + Q) = 60% of (P – Q), then find the ratio P: Q .", "o": ["5 : 1", "2 : 3", "2 : 5", "3 : 2"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "a", "e": "SSC CGL", "y": "2025", "t": "अनुपात", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "A/Q, = = ⇒ ( P + Q ) ( P − Q )⁶0⁴0³ 2 = = ⇒ 2 P² Q³ + 2³ − 2⁵ 1 P : Q = 5 : 1 ⇒"},
+{"id": "P2435", "q": "If 20% of (A + B) = 60% of (A - B), TG: @ikunal_x then find the ratio A: B.", "o": ["1 : 2", "2 : 1", "1 : 3", "3 : 1"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "b", "e": "SSC CGL", "y": "2025", "t": "अनुपात", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "20% of (A + B) = 60% of (A - B) (A + B) = (A - B) × 3 A + B = 3A - 3B ⇒ ⇒ 2A = 4B A : B = 2 : 1 ⇒ ⇒"},
+{"id": "P2436", "q": "If 75% of P = 60% of Q = 30% of R, find P : Q : R.", "o": ["4 : 5 : 10", "10 : 5 : 4", "5 : 4 : 10", "2 : 3 : 5"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "a", "e": "SSC CGL", "y": "2025", "t": "अनुपात", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "P × 75 = Q × 60 = R × 30 P × 5 = Q × 4 = R × 2 ⇒ P : Q : R = 4 : 5 : 10"},
+{"id": "P2437", "q": "If (A + B) : (A - B) = 7 : 3, find (A³ + B³) : (A³ - B³)", "o": ["195 : 148", "125 : 137", "133 : 117", "123 : 117"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "c", "e": "SSC CGL", "y": "2025", "t": "अनुपात", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "A + B = 7 - - - - - - (i) A - B = 3 - - - - - - (ii) On solving both equations A = 5, B = 2 A³ + B³ = 5³ + 2³ = 125 + 8 = 133 A³ - B³ = 5³ - 2³ = 125 - 8 = 117 (A³ + B³) : (A³ - B³) = 133 : 117"},
+{"id": "P2438", "q": "Two numbers are in the ratio 3 : 5. If the difference between them is 16, find the numbers.", "o": ["24 and 40", "18 and 35", "15 and 35", "18 and 25"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "a", "e": "SSC CGL", "y": "2025", "t": "अनुपात", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "Ratio First : Second → 3 : 5 A/Q, (5 - 3) unit = 16¹ unit = 8 Numbers are 24 , 40 →"},
+{"id": "P2439", "q": "A³0-liter solution contains acid and water in the ratio 2 : 1. How much water must be added to make the ratio 1 : 1?", "o": ["11 L", "10 L", "12 L", "21 L"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "b", "e": "SSC CGL", "y": "2025", "t": "अनुपात", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "According to question, (2 + 1) = 3 units = 30 litres ⇒ 1 units = 10 litres ⇒"},
+{"id": "P2440", "q": "P and Q share profit in 9 : 7. If P gets Rs. 27,000, how much did Q receive?", "o": ["Rs. 21,500", "Rs. 10,000", "Rs. 21,000", "Rs. 22,000"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "c", "e": "SSC CGL", "y": "2025", "t": "अनुपात", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "P : Q = 9 : 7⁹ units = 27000¹ unit = 3000 ⇒ Q’s share (7) = 7 × 3000 = Rs. 21000"},
