+{"id": "P2444", "q": "Jupiter and Saturn take 9 hours 50 minutes and 11 hours 40 minutes respectively to complete one rotation. What is the ratio of their rotation times in the lowest form? Matriculation Level 26/07/2025(Shift - 1)", "o": ["59 : 70", "49 : 58", "59 : 69", "50 : 68"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "a", "e": "SSC", "y": "2025", "t": "अनुपात", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "Convert times to minutes: Jupiter : 9 hr 50 min = 9 × 60 + 50 = 590 Saturn : 11 hours 40 minutes = 11 × 60 + 40 = 700 Required ratio = 590: 700 = 59 : 70"},
+{"id": "P2445", "q": "Rahim earns ₹16,000 per month, and Ami earns ₹2,04,000 per annum. If both spend ₹12,000 per month, what is the ratio of their savings? Matriculation Level 28/07/2025(Shift - 1)", "o": ["1 : 2", "2 : 3", "1 : 3", "4 : 5"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "d", "e": "SSC", "y": "2025", "t": "अनुपात", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "Saving of Rahim = 16000 - 12000 = ₹ 4000 Saving of Ami = - 12000 = ₹ 204000¹2⁵000 Required ratio 4000 : 5000 or 4 : 5 →"},
