+{"id": "P2454", "q": "Two numbers are in ratio 3 : 7. If the sum is 80, find the numbers. Higher Secondary 26/07/2025 (Shift - 2)", "o": ["24:56", "27:53", "21:56", "38:42"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "a", "e": "SSC", "y": "2025", "t": "अनुपात", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "Let the two numbers be 3x and 7x. 3x + 7x = 80 x = 8 ⇒ ⇒ Therefore, the numbers = 3 × 8 = 24 , 7 × 8 = 56"},
+{"id": "P2455", "q": "In a factory, the ratio of skilled to unskilled workers was 8 : 5 . After a recruitment drive, the number of skilled workers increased by 15% , while the number of unskilled workers increased by 20% . What is the new ratio of skilled to unskilled workers? Higher Secondary 28/07/2025 (Shift - 2)", "o": ["21 : 12", "23 : 15", "8 : 5", "21 : 25"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "b", "e": "SSC", "y": "2025", "t": "अनुपात", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "Required ratio: 8 × : 5 × 115¹00¹20¹00 = 9.2 : 6 = 23 : 15"},
