+{"id": "P2465", "q": "The third proportional to (5² - 3² ) and (5 - 3) is:", "o": ["1", "3", "1", "8"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "d", "e": "SSC", "y": "2025", "t": "अनुपात", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "(5² -3² ) = 16, 5 - 3 =2 Third proportional to 16 and 2 = = 2 × 2¹6¹ 4"},
+{"id": "P2466", "q": "The sum of the four numbers A, B, C and D is 875. If the ratio of A to B is 1 : 2, the ratio of B to C is 3 : 1 and the ratio of C to D is 2 : 3, find the value of C.", "o": ["120", "130", "125", "135"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "c", "e": "SSC", "y": "2025", "t": "अनुपात", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "According to question, we have given ratio; A B C D¹ : 2 : 2 : 2³ : 3 : 1 : 1² : 2 : 2 : 3 ______________________ 6 : 12 : 4 : 6 = 3 : 6 : 2 : 3 Value of C = × 875² 3 + 6 + 2 + 3 = = 125¹750¹4"},
+{"id": "P2467", "q": "A certain sum is to be divided between A, B, and C in the ratio 2 : 5 : 7. But by mistake, it was divided in the ratio 5 : 2 : 7. Thus B loses by ₹150. Find the TG: @ikunal_x sum.", "o": ["₹700", "₹850", "₹900", "₹625"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "a", "e": "SSC", "y": "2025", "t": "अनुपात", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "According to the question, 5 = ₹150 ⇒ = ₹50 x − 2 x x Hence, total sum = (2 + 5 + 7 ) = 14 x x x x = ₹700"},
