+{"id": "P2469", "q": "The ratio of marks obtained by Rajesh, Rakesh and Ramesh in an exam is 2 : 4 : 9. What are the marks obtained TG: @ikunal_x by Rakesh and Ramesh, if Rajesh scored 30 marks in the exam?", "o": ["Rakesh = 40 , Ramesh = 90", "Rakesh = 60 , Ramesh = 135", "Rakesh = 120 , Ramesh = 180", "Rakesh = 90 , Ramesh = 40"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "b", "e": "SSC", "y": "2025", "t": "अनुपात", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "Ratio of their marks 2 : 4 : 9 → According to the question , Marks obtained by Rajesh (2 units) = 30 Marks obtained by Rakesh (4 units) = 60 Marks obtained by Ramesh (9 units) = 135"},
