+{"id": "P2779", "q": "If and sin θ + tan θ = p tan θ − , then which of the relation sin θ = q satisfies for given values of p and q ?", "o": ["p² − q² = 4 pq p² − q² = 8 pq", "p² + q² = 4 pq p² + q² = 4 pq"], "ol": ["b", "d"], "a": "a", "e": "SSC CHSL", "y": "2023", "t": "त्रिकोणमिति", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "Put = 45° θ Now, ………. (1) sin θ + tan θ = p ⇒ 1² + 1 = p ⇒ 1 + 2² = p And , …….. (2) tan θ − sin θ = q ⇒ 1 − 1² = q ⇒ 2 − 1² = q Now, checking through options, (a) satisfies the value of p and q ."},
