+{"id": "P2789", "q": "If A is an acute angle, the simplified form of cos ( π − A ). cot ( 𝝅 2 + A ) cos (− A ) tan ( π + А ) tan ( 3𝝅 2 + А ) sin ( 2π − A )", "o": ["Cos²A", "Sin A", "Sin²A", "Cos A"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "d", "e": "SSC CGL", "y": "2022", "t": "त्रिकोणमिति", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "cos (π − A ). cot ( π 2 + A ) cos (− A ) tan (π + A ) tan ( 3 π 2 + A ) sin ( 2 π − A ) = = − cosA .(− tanA ) cosA tanA .(− cotA ).(− sinA ) co s² A sinAcotA = cosA"},
