+{"id": "P3003", "q": "Solve the following to find its value in terms of trigonometric ratios. (sin A + cos A)(1 − sin A cosA)", "o": ["sin³ A + cos³A", "sin 2 A - cos 2 A", "[cosA - sin A] [sin² A + cos²A]", "sin³ A - cos³A"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "a", "e": "SSC CGL", "y": "2022", "t": "त्रिकोणमिति", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "Formula :- = a³ + b³ a + b ( ) a² + b² − ab ( ) sinA + cosA ( )¹ − sinAcosA ( ) = sinA + cosA ( ) sin 2 A + cos 2 A − sinAcosA ( ) = sin 3 A + cos 3 A"},
+{"id": "P3004", "q": "If secθ - 2cosθ = , where θ is a⁷ 2 positive acute angle, then the value of secθ is:", "o": ["6", "8", "5", "4"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "d", "e": "SSC CGL", "y": "2022", "t": "त्रिकोणमिति", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "secθ - 2cosθ = 7² = sec θ − 2 sec θ = 7² = sec 2 θ − 2 = 7² sec θ = 2 sec 2 θ − 7 sec θ − 4 = 0 = 2 sec 2 θ − 8 sec θ + sec θ − 4 = 0 = ( sec θ − 4 )( 2 sec θ + 1 ) = 0 = sec θ = 4"},
