+{"id": "P3017", "q": "In the given figure, ABC is an isosceles triangle with BC = 8 cm and AB = AC = 5 cm. The value of tan C - cot B is _______.", "o": ["-", "-", "5¹2⁷ 12⁷ 12⁵ 12"], "ol": ["a", "b", "d"], "a": "b", "e": "SSC CGL", "y": "2022", "t": "त्रिकोणमिति", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "Since, ABC is an isosceles triangle △ then, AD(median) divides BC in the ratio of 1 : 1. By the given figure, tanC = , cotB = 3⁴ 4³ So, tanC - cotB = - = = 3⁴ 4³ 9 − 16¹2 − 7¹2"},
