+{"id": "P3025", "q": "If sec + = 2, find the value θ 1 cos θ of sec 55 + θ 1 sec 55 θ", "o": ["2", "0", "1", "55"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "a", "e": "SSC CGL", "y": "2022", "t": "त्रिकोणमिति", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "sec + = 2 θ 1 cos θ sec + sec = 2 θ θ 2sec = 2 sec = 1 = sec0° = 0° θ ⇒ θ ⇒ θ So, + = + se c⁵5 θ 1 se c⁵5 θ se c⁵5⁰° 1 se c⁵5⁰° = 1 + 1 = 2"},
+{"id": "P3026", "q": "If tan40° = a, then find = tan 320° − tan 310° 1 + tan 320° . tan 310°", "o": ["1 − a² a¹ + a² 2 a", "1 − a² 2 a¹ + a² a"], "ol": ["b", "d"], "a": "c", "e": "SSC CGL", "y": "2022", "t": "त्रिकोणमिति", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "tan40° = cot50° = a So, tan 320° − tan 310° 1 + tan 320° . tan 310° = tan ( 360° − 40° ) − tan ( 360° − 50° )¹ + tan ( 360° − 40° )."},
+{"id": "P3027", "q": "If = then the x² sin θ ( 1 + cos θ + sin θ ) value of is: 1 − cos θ + sin θ ( 1 + sin θ )", "o": ["x", "( 1", "+", "x )"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "b", "e": "SSC CPO", "y": "2022", "t": "त्रिकोणमिति", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "Short trick : Putting = 45°, we have , θ = = x² sin 45° 1 + cos 45° + sin 45° 2¹ + 1² + 1² = = 2² + 2² 1 + 2 Now, = 1 − cos θ + sin θ 1 + sin θ 1 − cos 45° + sin 45° 1 + sin 45° = = 1 − 1² + 1² 1 + 1² 2 − 1 + 1² + 1 = = 2² + 1 x"},
