+{"id": "P3029", "q": "The value of (2 cos 2 θ -1) + ] is ; [ 1 + tan θ 1 − tan θ 1 − tan θ 1 + tan θ", "o": ["2", "0", "1 √3²"], "ol": ["a", "b", "d"], "a": "a", "e": "SSC CPO", "y": "2022", "t": "त्रिकोणमिति", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "(2 - 1) [ ] co s² θ 1 + tan θ 1 − tan θ + 1 − tan θ 1 + tan θ = cos2 [ ] θ ( 1 + tan θ)² + ( 1 − tan θ)²¹ − ta n² θ (∵cos2 = - ) θ co s² θ si n² θ = 2 co s² θ − 1 = cos2 [ ] θ 2 ( 1 + ta n² θ)¹ − ta n² θ = cos2 [ ] θ 2 ( co s² θ + si n² θ) co s² θ − si n² θ = cos2 × = 2 θ 2 cos 2 θ"},
+{"id": "P3030", "q": "Simplify. sin 8 θ cos θ − sin 6 θ cos 3 θ cos 2 θ cos θ − sin 3 θ sin 4 θ", "o": ["cot", "cot2", "tan", "tan2 θ θ θ θ"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "d", "e": "SSC CPO", "y": "2022", "t": "त्रिकोणमिति", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "sin 8 θ cos θ − sin 6 θ cos 3 θ cos 2 θ cos θ − sin 3 θ sin 4 θ Multiplying by 2 in numerator and denominator, 2 sin 8 θ cos θ − 2 sin 6 θ cos 3 θ 2 cos 2 θ cos θ − 2 sin 3 θ sin 4 θ = sin 9 θ + sin 7 θ − ( sin 9 θ + sin 3 θ) cos 3 θ + cos θ − ( cos θ − cos 7 θ) = = = tan2 sin 7 θ − sin 3 θ cos 3 θ + cos 7 θ 2 cos 5 θ. sin 2 θ 2 cos 5 θ."},
+{"id": "P3031", "q": "Given that A and B are second quadrant angles, sinA = and sinB = , 1³ 1⁵ then find the value of cos(A - B).", "o": ["4√3 + 1¹5⁸√3 − 1¹5", "8√3 + 1¹5⁴√3 − 1¹5"], "ol": ["b", "d"], "a": "c", "e": "SSC CPO", "y": "2022", "t": "त्रिकोणमिति", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "As we know that, + = 1 co s² θ si n² θ Then, cosA = = 1 − ( 1³ )²⁸ 9 = – and cosB = 2² 3¹ − ( 1⁵ )² = = – 24²5² 6⁵ ( A and B are in second quadrant) ∵ cos(A – B) = cosA.cosB + sinAsinB = (- × (- + × 2² 3 )²⁶ 5 )¹³ 1⁵ = 8³ + 1¹5"},
+{"id": "P3032", "q": "The value of the expression cos² 45° + cos² 135° + cos² 225° + cos 2³15° is:", "o": ["2", "1¹ 2³ 2"], "ol": ["a", "d"], "a": "a", "e": "SSC CPO", "y": "2022", "t": "त्रिकोणमिति", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "+ + co s² 45° co s² 135° + co s² 225° co s² 315° = + (90°+45°) + (270° – ( 1² )² co s² co s² 45°) + (360° - 45°) co s² 94 = + + + ( 1² )² (− 1² )² (− 1² )² = + + + = 2 ( 1² )²¹ 2¹ 2¹ 2¹ 2"},
+{"id": "P3033", "q": "The value of is: 2 cos 3 θ − cos θ sin θ − 2 sin 3 θ", "o": ["secθ", "sinθ", "cotθ", "tanθ"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "c", "e": "SSC CPO", "y": "2022", "t": "त्रिकोणमिति", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "Formula used : cos2 = 2 - 1 or 1 - 2 θ co s² θ si n² θ Now , = 2 co s³ θ − cos θ sin θ − 2 si n³ θ cos θ( 2 co s² θ − 1 ) sin θ( 1 − 2 si n² θ) = = cot cos θ. cos 2 θ sin θ."},
+{"id": "P3034", "q": "If cos48° = , then sec 48° - cot m n⁴2° is equal to:", "o": ["m − n² − m² m m − n² − m² n", "n − n² − m² n n − n² − m² m"], "ol": ["b", "d"], "a": "d", "e": "SSC CPO", "y": "2022", "t": "त्रिकोणमिति", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "Sec48° = and cot 42° = n m n² − m² m So, Sec 48° – cot 42° = - n m n² − m² m = n − n² − m² m"},
