+{"id": "P3036", "q": "If cosθ + secθ = 2, then the value of θ + is: sin 6 co s⁶ θ", "o": ["0", "1", "1³ 1²"], "ol": ["b", "c", "d"], "a": "c", "e": "SSC CPO", "y": "2022", "t": "त्रिकोणमिति", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "cos + sec = 2 θ θ Putting = 0°, we get : θ cos0° + sec0° = 2¹ + 1 = 2 ⇒ 2 = 2 LHS = RHS ⇒ Now, + = 0° + cos 6⁰° = 0 + 1 = 1 si n⁶ θ co s⁶ θ si n⁶"},
+{"id": "P3037", "q": "If 4 Cosθ + 3 Sinθ = x and 4 Sinθ - 3 Cos θ = y, find the value of x² + y².", "o": ["16", "9", "25", "1"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "c", "e": "SSC CPO", "y": "2022", "t": "त्रिकोणमिति", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "4 Cos θ + 3 Sin θ = x ......... ( 1 )⁴ Sin θ − 3 Cos θ = y ......... ( 1 ) Squaring eq .(1) and (2), we get 16 cos 2 θ + 9 sin 2 θ + 24 Sin θ. Cos θ = x² ........ ( 3 )¹6 sin 2 θ + 9 cos 2 θ − 24 Sin θ. Cos θ = y² ......... ( 4 ) Adding eq ."},
+{"id": "P3038", "q": "Simplify. cos 4 θ − sin 4 θ sin 2 θ", "o": ["1 - tan 2", "tan 2 - 1 θ θ", "cot 2 - 1", "1 - cot 2 θ θ"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "c", "e": "SSC CPO", "y": "2022", "t": "त्रिकोणमिति", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "cos 4 θ − sin 4 θ sin 2 θ = ( cos 2 θ − sin 2 θ)( sin 2 θ + cos 2 θ) sin 2 θ = cot 2 - 1 θ"},
+{"id": "P3039", "q": "The value of - sin A cot A + cosec A¹ is? sin A cot A − cosec A +", "o": ["3", "0", "2¹ 2"], "ol": ["b", "c", "d"], "a": "b", "e": "SSC CPO", "y": "2022", "t": "त्रिकोणमिति", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "– sin A cot A + cosec A sin A cot A − cosec A + 1 = sin AcotA − 1 − sinAcotA − 1 cot 2 A − cosec 2 A + 1 = − 2 − 1 + 1 = 3"},
