+{"id": "P3041", "q": "What is the value of cos 50° sin 40° + - 2cos50°.cosec 40°? 3 cosec 80° sec 10°", "o": ["3", "2", "5", "4"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "b", "e": "SSC CGL", "y": "2022", "t": "त्रिकोणमिति", "d": "कठिन", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "+ - 2cos50°.cosec 40° cos 50° sin 40° 3 cosec 80° sec 10° = - 2sin40°.cosec 40° sin 40° sin 40° + 3 sec 10° sec 10° = 1 + 3 - 2( ) sin 40° × 1 sin 40° = 1 + 3 - 2(1) = 4 - 2 = 2"},
