+{"id": "P3043", "q": "Which of the following is equal to + tan ? 1 tan θ θ", "o": ["sec .cosec", "1 θ θ", "cosec θ sec θ tan 2 θ SSC Selection Post (Phase - X)"], "ol": ["a", "b", "d"], "a": "a", "e": "SSC CGL", "y": "2022", "t": "त्रिकोणमिति", "d": "कठिन", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "+ = + 1 tan θ tan θ cos θ sin θ sin θ cos θ = = co s² θ + si n² θ sin θ × cos θ 1 sin θ × cos θ = = sec θ × cosec θ 1 sec θ × cosec θ"},
+{"id": "P3044", "q": "If cosec(A – B) = 2 and Cot(A + B) = , then what is the value of A? 1³ Graduate Level 01/08/2022 ( Shift - 4 )", "o": ["90°", "60°", "30°", "45°"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "d", "e": "SSC", "y": "2023", "t": "त्रिकोणमिति", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "cosec(A - B) = 2 cosec(A - B) = cosec30° A - B = 30° --------- (1) ⇒ cot(A + B) = cot(A + B) = cot60° 1³ ⇒ A + B = 60° --------- (2) ⇒ Adding eqn(1) and (2) we get: A = = = 45° 60° + 30° 2⁹0° 2"},
