+{"id": "P3050", "q": "If tan 3 = cot( - 22°), where 3 θ θ θ is an acute angle, find the value of . θ Higher Secondary 01/08/2022 ( Shift - 3 )", "o": ["26°", "29°", "28°", "27° SSC CHSL 2021 Tier - 1"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "c", "e": "SSC", "y": "2023", "t": "त्रिकोणमिति", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "Formula :- Cot(90° - ) = tan θ θ tan 3 = cot( - 22°) θ θ Cot (90°- 3 ) = cot( - 22°) ⇒ θ θ 90°- 3 = - 22° ⇒ θ θ 4 = 112° = 28° ⇒ θ ⇒ θ"},
+{"id": "P3051", "q": "If x − xcosec 2³0° 1 + cosec 2³0° = cos 2⁶0° then the value of + 4 cot 2⁴5° − sec 2⁶0° , x is _______.", "o": ["5", "12 −", "5", "12"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "b", "e": "SSC CHSL", "y": "2022", "t": "त्रिकोणमिति", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "= + (1 × 4) - x ( 1 − cose c² 30° )¹ + cose c² 30° ( 1² )²² 2 = + 4 - 4 x ( 1 − 4 )¹ + 4¹ 4 × = = × = - x − 3⁵ 1⁴ ⇒ x¹ 4⁵ − 3⁵ 12"},
+{"id": "P3052", "q": "If , then sinx − 3 cosx = 3 cosx the value of cot x is _______.", "o": ["3 − 3³ + 3", "3³ − 3⁶"], "ol": ["b", "d"], "a": "d", "e": "SSC CHSL", "y": "2022", "t": "त्रिकोणमिति", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "Sin x - 3cosx = cosx 3 Sin x = cosx + 3 cosx 3 Dividing both side by cosx. we get tanx = + 3³ Cotx = = 1³ + 3³ − 3³ − 9 = - = 3 − 3⁶ 3 − 3⁶"},
+{"id": "P3053", "q": "What is the value of ? ( 4 sin 3 x − 3 sinx + sin 3 x )", "o": ["1", "0", "4", "3"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "b", "e": "SSC CHSL", "y": "2022", "t": "त्रिकोणमिति", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "As per trigonometric identity, we have Sin3x = 3sinx - 4 si n³ x Now, ( 4 sin 3 x − 3 sinx + sin 3 x ) = 4 - 3sinx + 3sinx - 4 = 0 si n³ x si n³ x"},
+{"id": "P3054", "q": "What is the simplified value of [ ] cos 2 ( 90° − θ) − { cos ( 90° − θ) cos θ} cot θ", "o": ["4", "2", "0", "1"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "c", "e": "SSC CHSL", "y": "2022", "t": "त्रिकोणमिति", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "- [ ] co s² ( 90° − θ) cos ( 90° − θ) cos θ cot θ = - [ ] si n² θ sin θ cos θ cot θ = - [ sin cos × ] si n² θ θ θ sin θ cos θ - = 0 ⇒ si n² θ si n² θ"},
