+{"id": "P3264", "q": "If = asec cos , y = bsec sin x θ ϕ θ ϕ and z = ctan , then the value of θ ( + - ) is equal to: x ² a ² y ² b ² z ² c ²", "o": ["2", "1", "3", "0"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "b", "e": "SSC CGL", "y": "2024", "t": "त्रिकोणमिति", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "= x aSec 𝜃 Cos Ø On squaring both side = … (i) x² a² Se c² 𝜃 Co s² Ø = y bSec 𝜃 Sin Ø On squaring both side = …. (ii) y² b² Se c² 𝜃 Si n² Ø = z ctan θ On squaring both side = … (iii) z² c² ta n² θ On adding (i), (ii) and then subtracting (iii) + - x² a² y² b² z² c² = + - Se c² 𝜃 Co s² Ø Se c² 𝜃 Si n² Ø ta n² θ = + - Se c² 𝜃 ( Co s² Ø Si n² Ø ) ta n² θ "},
