+{"id": "P3266", "q": "In right-angled triangle ABC, ∠B = 90° and angle A and angle C are acute angles. If cosecA = 2 , then find the value of 2 sinA.cosC + cosA.sinC.", "o": ["1", "0", "2² 2"], "ol": ["b", "c", "d"], "a": "b", "e": "SSC CHSL", "y": "2024", "t": "त्रिकोणमिति", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "cosecA = = AC BC 2² 1 AB = = = ( 2² )² − ( 1 )²⁸ − 1⁷ sinA.cosC + cosA.sinC = × + × BC AC BC AC AB AC AB AC = × + × 1² 2¹ 2² 7² 2⁷ 2² = + = 1¹ 8⁷ 8"},
+{"id": "P3267", "q": "If sin = then the value θ 2 xy x² + y² , of tan is: θ", "o": ["2 xy x² − y² x² − y² 2 xy", "x² − y² x² + y² x² + y² x² − y²"], "ol": ["b", "d"], "a": "a", "e": "SSC CHSL", "y": "2024", "t": "त्रिकोणमिति", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "( : + : - ) are 2 xy x² y² x² y² pythagorean triplet sin = = θ Perpendicular Hypotenuse 2 xy x² + y² So, tan = = θ Perpendicular Base 2 xy x² − y²"},
+{"id": "P3268", "q": "What is the value of cos(x + y) - sin(x - y) + tan(2z) ?", "o": ["cos x. cos y - sin x. sin y - sin x. cos y - cos x. sin y + 2 tan z¹ − ta n² z", "sin x. sin y + 2 tan z¹ − ta n² z", "cos x.cos y - sin x. sin y - sin x.cos y + cos x. sin y + 2 tan z¹ − ta n² z", "cos x.cos y - sin x. sin y - cos x. sin y + tan z¹ − ta n² z"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "c", "e": "SSC CHSL", "y": "2024", "t": "त्रिकोणमिति", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "As we know , {cos(x + y) = cos x.cos y - sin x. sin y} { sin(x - y) = sin x.cos y - cos x. sin y} {tan(2z) = } 2 tan z¹ − ta n² z So, cos(x + y) - sin(x - y) + tan(2z) = cos x.cos y - sin x. sin y - (sin x.cos y - cos x. sin y) + 2 tan z¹ − ta n² z = cos x.cos y - sin x. sin y - sin x.cos y + cos x."},
