+{"id": "P3390", "q": "If tan P = cot Q and both P and Q are acute angles, then the value of P + Q is: Higher Secondary 25/07/2025 (Shift - 2)", "o": ["45°", "60°", "90°", "180°"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "c", "e": "SSC", "y": "2025", "t": "त्रिकोणमिति", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "Given: tan P = cot Q = tan (90 o - Q) Since both are acute angles, P = 90 o - Q Therefore, P + Q = 90 o TG: @ikunal_x"},
+{"id": "P3391", "q": "The value of sec⁴θ + tan⁴θ is equal to: Higher Secondary 26/07/2025 (Shift - 2)", "o": ["1", "1 - 2sec²θtan²θ", "sec²θ + tan²θ", "1 + 2sec²θtan²θ"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "d", "e": "SSC", "y": "2025", "t": "त्रिकोणमिति", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "( sec 2 θ − tan 2 θ)² = - 2 sec 4 θ + tan 4 θ sec 2 θ tan 2 θ 1 = - 2 ⇒ sec 4 θ + tan 4 θ sec 2 θ tan 2 θ 1 + 2 = ⇒ sec 2 θ tan 2 θ sec 4 θ + tan 4 θ"},
+{"id": "P3392", "q": "Let x and y be angles such that sin(x - y) = 1 and cos(x + y) = 0. What is the value of the expression: (cos x + cos y)² + (sin x + sin y)² ? Higher Secondary 28/07/2025 (Shift - 2)", "o": ["4", "2", "0", "1"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "b", "e": "SSC", "y": "2025", "t": "त्रिकोणमिति", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "Given: sin ( - ) = 1 - = 90 o —-----(i) x y ⇒ x y cos ( + ) = 0 + = 90 o —-----(ii) x y ⇒ x y Add both equations: - = 90 o , + = 90 o x y x y ⇒ = 90 o , = 0 o x y Now evaluate: (cos x + cosy)² + (sin x + sin y)² = (cos90 o + cos 0)² + (sin 90 o + sin 0 o )² = (0 + 1)² + (1 + 0)² = 1 + 1 = 2"},
+{"id": "P3393", "q": "If tanθ - cotθ = k, then tan²θ + cot²θ is equal to: Higher Secondary 28/07/2025 (Shift - 2)", "o": ["k² + 2", "k² - 2", "k + 2", "k - 2"], "ol": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "a": "a", "e": "SSC", "y": "2025", "t": "त्रिकोणमिति", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "tanθ - cotθ = k Squaring both sides: (tanθ - cotθ)² = k² tan 2 θ + cot 2 θ - 2tanθ cotθ = k² ⇒ · tan 2 θ + cot 2 θ - 2tanθ = k² ⇒ · 1 tan θ tan 2 θ + cot 2 θ = k² + 2 ⇒"},
+{"id": "P3394", "q": "If secθ + tanθ = p, what is the value of sinθ in terms of p? Higher Secondary 29/07/2025 (Shift - 2)", "o": ["( p ² + 1 ) ( p ² − 1 ) ( p ² − 1 )² p", "( p ² − 1 ) ( p ² + 1 ) ( p − 1 ) ( p + 1 )"], "ol": ["b", "d"], "a": "c", "e": "SSC", "y": "2025", "t": "त्रिकोणमिति", "d": "मध्यम", "p": "general", "lang": "en", "sol": "secθ + tanθ = p —---(i) secθ - tanθ = —---(ii)¹ p [ sec 2 θ - tan 2 θ = 1] ∴ (i) + (ii)²secθ = p + secθ = 1 p ⇒ p² + 1² p Sinθ = ( p ² − 1 ) ( p ² + 1 )"},
